#. uid: 21f80c233f23af0c7c8d52261dab718c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A man stumbled, his shoulder bashing into her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 142b644948fb81f6a5f5a6aa44f1a37b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A man that could provide. Be strong. Faithful. Honest."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d727a497391523cdd63f3c3f2e83d285
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A man that didn't much matter to anyone."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8f1575f115b8c89e04d0d75523f48f45
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A man that had been given a second life and wasted not a minute of it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1e76fe885d50e168108f9ad87055e7e8
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A man that had feared life had passed him by, and now equally feared that he had caught life but had no idea what to do with it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ea453e3abd27a8bc9ce2d2c4e4c3b7c6
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A man that had perhaps feared the day would never come."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 19f71514bbb1a7e75ae267e4199d3302
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A man that lived with his head in the clouds."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a14fdcb1943dd9b306dcdc50fb9e8446
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A man that treated her like she was worth nothing, reminding her with every thrust that she was only good for this."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5bce3fc2dcc27344a14c9d30a853cc5e
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A man walked in through the door to the Great Hall."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b370f9a246ebd009e4d928f666d614ba
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A man waved at Marion from across the room, and Marion waved back."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3bbfaadeb4e6c86e0d24027f9c032567
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A man who could not believe that fortune and fate had played him for a fool."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e87edc3284ced6a4162726577fc39572
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A man who desired her. Provided for her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: abd4402ed2a6b7c5e17c59189bde8c68
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A man who expected to find a willing woman, but not this eager whore."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 543f6c480bc0f19843db09e31dde420a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A man who had lost everything, and possessed nothing."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 889a50f0ae6b4f175aba034bd7043dfd
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A man who knew he had killed himself just the same, but took glee from knowing his enemies would die with him."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8626c4b556fb4128769273489fa82cf6
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A man who thought that only the decay of old age remained, who now instead found a young and willing woman, again before him."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4e7ed33ddef9090fb2fadc3e9deb3030
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A man who wanted to take a woman. A woman who wanted to be taken by a man."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e2f5d4c420344178536198c9ac17c728
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A man who wielded no sword was no man at all in their eyes."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d0d501dd1a693c02b2d4447dee5837bd
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A man who would gladly sacrifice every last one of them to carry himself across a wicked desert."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f261db569e4af169fb495eb7b0a0c03b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A man whose name she had heard many times by now, and whose appearance lived up to his reputation. Hassar."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d04c4e2818a3e020224a24f91cec6710
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A man with a round face slowly peaked out, his eyes narrowing."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f7a82440bae9ebdc2603715fde5c75df
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "A man with thread and needle? I'll survive."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 05ef2e426c7778bfd24f1aaf9e0b3f19
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A man wraps his arms around the neck of the soldier between Sarah's legs, violently pulling him away."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7fb2fea3e9d49e1679581dedb274cfb5
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A man's voice could be heard roaring through the hall."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 30dcee3634d60ea4a5cecba646f61608
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A man, as one ought to be."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 31e9188694abb158f396813e878915c9
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A man, pale and tall, walked across the hall with a great stride."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d4c2699e8ac5839f9a2516401b59fbc5
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A man, that watched as a group of Tribesmen took his wife on the day of their marriage."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e636f8bfe0a9c0555e8e868c6405e055
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A man."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d425dc35f38e2e248df1911685e0f86a
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "A man? Yes."
msgstr ""

#. uid: aaebdd10e7fcf96a87b8d1704195948c
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "A mansion? What makes you say that."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 30acc115bc51ad145c5517f00580bb90
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "A marking kit?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 084d74f7b37950fd39ecaf6eeb15819a
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "A marriage? Between whom?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 046ffcf9d87dd56640d81f8003c2b33c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A marvel of miracle and magic, held together by the will of the Gods."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d2bd9bbc19812612879f46f843059f6c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A mask balanced on her face, but her pale skin and form were familiar to Sarah."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0e0e1438453ad0ca6d98b5f2f0dce9ed
msgctxt "speaker:Tailor"
msgid "A mason does not just blindly hack into his marble, nor do I start without properly inspecting the body."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 20d7211191e9ba4d0386f1adf0c57d2e
msgctxt "speaker:Advisor"
msgid "A masquerade?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: ed8ac9da63ed62d3f24e461a5a360bd9
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "A massive conflict that could drag out for decades."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2041188c42070a2b5349531d99c3ff8c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A massive hole had been dug straight into the earth."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7fc6c00d5f54a8c47971c5b61ceeec41
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A massive stone statue, marking and guarding the entrance."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8548f9d812170c62f41d637644b4a879
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "A match like this one doesn't come around very often. True love, what a miracle."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cd6afb0d0d6fcd11a8b5b181b37d7755
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A meeting between the two, running late."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 379d2e9a65cae2616184580cbc68cdb1
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "A meeting?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 858c32d7d342a4b259e7be24deaefc5a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A melee had broken out."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5e22b2a17fa729d8ef980330bd60d8fd
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "A mercenary...well, you're lucky to get to forty."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1b100eeb7a3b2d7aacdacb419dfca600
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "A merchant knows when to say yes to a good deal."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 78ce65f6720aa79c04dfd6126702b5ea
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "A merchant, if you'd believe it. I thought they'd killed the last of 'em by now."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2a15cac5e6a0c42b4e73a6b5a0a4ada0
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A merchant, in their eyes, was as low as any man could be. Earning his way through life by trickery and deceit."
msgstr ""

#. uid: dbcee8a02e069cd6ab1bfb604f95e792
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "A mercy?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: fd444300664858e29a568faf5f7fc080
msgctxt "speaker:Kravel"
msgid "A message has arrived...from Marion."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a82b0e8b84497f906edec5ab669c13fb
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A message then, but what it was it remained to be seen."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4577f9c4ab903099a96372e987ade909
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A message, Sarah would try to rationalize. A warning to her enemies and those who broke their vows of loyalty."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3f7474cbb1b872a71b0130d7098975c7
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A metal door, carefully decorated, cut into the wall."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 314701e47427ec96d2a19cd8e2d6d500
msgctxt "speaker:Dalia"
msgid "A millenium, maybe more."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0a920d9d6b636b51bc2d9ec3eb8fa215
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A miniscule smile crept along Queen Maeiv's face."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 20eb3c842338b0cd8f685f653326961c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A minute, then two, then-"
msgstr ""

#. uid: fefb4251ecbfc3add46dea4d9fd44c9d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A minute...Sarah wondered. Was that really possible?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3945539a5eaae6a1bd69fcbd287bca9e
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A miracle."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0321117b770b5abcb54480690e487f73
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A mirror stood off to the side, and Sarah had did her best not to look for fear of bad luck, but an accidental glance forced her to turn and look at herself."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fc9549197474a4832d6ac4a490261fb5
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "A mission, far away from the reach of Mythra, of any power."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 327f064d57287cc1a0219759457d56c9
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A mist of red blood splashed out and a deep crimson trail as left across her back."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ea10bf4eaee7b05eb77b922b93743efb
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A mist rose up, wrapping itself around her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 38e9888c0bdc8806a3205edf4b553d4b
msgctxt "speaker:Gilead"
msgid "A mistake does not exempt you from punishment."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 605e13678373414f1b8c2cc6c7dbd027
msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "A mistake, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7690031911cd28490001048cb809121e
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "A mistake?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: d4878314e123eeb05c5d332cb2c3c7de
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "A mistake? It seemed like what you did was very intentional."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 20ed778c75b5cfd7ce3a22b26870cd1f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A mixture of chance, odds, bluffing. Half the game was the cards. The other half reading the player opposite of you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 661a59ee5d8b83f54ce4b601cf1d6180
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A mixture of lust and surprise painted the creature's face."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 002132b603c523a04a3455cc7633603d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A mixture of scented spice weighed heavily on the air."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 78ecd2d026efe9a468804591309d245d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A moan erupted from her mouth as if he had truly lost her mind."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 35a0c19ed495ad064b8f5a183a719fe1
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A moan slipped from her mouth and filled the tent, cutting through the silence."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8ae87ea957dd88f721e634ddf20516cc
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A moan slipped out as she felt him enter her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5f4b803626085acb59f150cbaaf9b270
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A moan, mixed with desperate frustration sounded out from Samayra, fearing that Sarah had denied her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 173177c1ad16eabc27510369736720a6
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A moan, no pain, she thought distantly as her mind sank into pleasured, thoughtless bliss."
msgstr ""

#. uid: bcd2bde74a4c82c006d6a6f99af14474
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A moment ago, she feared she had seen the last of him, and now she was back here. Back where she wanted to be, but could not stay."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1516008b4ef13a9e9ff8f070e115adf8
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A moment before they reach her, she topples backwards, her world begins to spin."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e2e0cb96cfacf349e0595eb65289e3df
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A moment in the fog of her mind passed, and she saw him throwing off the last of his own clothes."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a7dc5ef99652081c23f76358f50c1725
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A moment later, Sigmund climbed back onto the cart."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9b15fe995c83c8db6857e7d1e6acca9f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A moment later, soldiers pulled Kate away. Everyone seemed so busy, especially when they were almost ready to leave."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ae6b64b73cc89f0da031b6d6b28ed069
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A moment later, the servants arrived and began to help her get dressed."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e69fcde16c82ec33cad0f0f31ce0f71a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A moment longer, and her heart began to race."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e7a8b597c7e94e77b32072671b51d26b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A moment neither wanted to allow to pass."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c11ef1581916f6fc787a8e338bb5a482
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A moment of clarity began to dawn on Sarah, amidst all the chaos. She had thrown her life away...for this drunkard thief."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6f8c305169b1c0a8783d61a043528cf4
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A moment of inattention, and she had almost paid for it dearly."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c98a7dc3fb583dc8409888f965fe6876
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A moment of pause."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f4f647e878d4d3bbd750c593cc12f64d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A moment of quiet that felt as if it was drawn out forever."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6a98d2f1345a1c97c220c3ef9280dc3a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A moment of silence between them, as if there were no words that could be meaningfully spoken."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2b3a81b8d93d6bf21a30b87049568567
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A moment of silence lingered between them."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b8b300193be78001765df9ee715868d9
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A moment of silence."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d19d7cd123484c32d12d28fd7c386683
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A moment of warmth...and this was the price they would pay for it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 223209d81d186ef705848dcf45e4f8cf
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A moment passed in silence."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 601c4241a8b9d236cccdbb36d11da467
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A moment passed, then, movement."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2729d19f89aa67d0e7d79375a784f9a0
msgctxt "speaker:Hugh"
msgid "A month at the least. And after that, you'd probably still do best to get out of the city for a while."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0edd5a164449b3a7c304fdfeb10b258f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A month had passed since Thomas had been kidnapped by Marion and the old houses had declared their revolt."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8737e3581890e701cf5e6970c0c8a4ac
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A month. Was he really planning to stay here that long? Then again, if he did, could she really throw him out?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5d68d21d0941f3a62b1c02f9dd8e570d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A more humble man would have seen the signs of what came next, but Marion was not humble."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f4d244fdf8156e1834ee08825d103e1c
msgctxt "speaker:Voice"
msgid "A morsel. A most delicate one to be sure, but nothing more."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a4d01c3111eea5604ccc7c940c942f7f
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "A most kind host. I promise I won't inconvenience you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8094d3d49343a21d34aac3b55425c76f
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "A most kind offer, but I'll sleep here tonight if that is fine with you. The fire...it's awfully calming."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c5c5d6ef63d94fafb16a4b73c9cb9303
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "A most surprising answer."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f75848691e330ff87447dfd284602b56
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "A most wise decision, my dear."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0ab543229be5d6bb0f9cffa08c52c1ef
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A mother always knew."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 62dead2bfb4e57ec8ca366e4cc785211
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "A murderer and his victim, would equally go to the same place."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a55c3bc31344d0083ab380365d083ed6
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A murmur ran through the crowd like lightning."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2c7e2b4f4a972911fa5fdac49c60dd7a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A muscle long unused but now trained was flexed."
msgstr ""

#. uid: aed68d48f43b9b57766d36f0b5301748
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A musky stench that added to her revulsion of him."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4d08919bdd7c54985db2378585191854
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A muted scream rang out, drowned by his grinding teeth and growling rage."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8fbd55122dfc5e0084831f8758c2011d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A mutual madness overtook them as they continued deep into the night."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2509d8fe459b2dedc752c64bbc3d9f24
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A naked woman in Rosanna would bring the street to a stop, but here, she barely seemed to solicit more than a quick appreciative glance."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ba0cd2a1816434b309f8400f6167a88b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A nation where ordinary people did not have to live in fear of its own soldiers and nobles."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d29ecbaafd3eba8e363b844441aff1f4
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "A natural aptitude, but such is no replacement for commitment. That's what's changed."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 263444bd56c59944633f16346c000763
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A nature like this could never have existed in her home country, she realized. Simply because the ever growing masses of people would seize on it eventually."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 619c4945e2488f73d7b1e5352fc4ce9e
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A near army of servants rushed into the room, carrying an almost equally impossible amount of food."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9a0bde6658c7d2b86f62405a74873a1e
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A near madness came over her, tears flowing past her face, as she found herself begging him a third time."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9571989dc30072ccea8f8284f8c973ec
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A neighbouring kingdom might take her in, but so dire was the news from across the ocean, that she didn't even know if any still stood against Hassar's horde."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b579ead8a16d1ef5a0b17b4d17d6c9de
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A nervous innkeeper came up to her table and served her some beer and food."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 502a88e3d123ee67290624be80243909
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A nervous panic."
msgstr ""

#. uid: be5d28f4cc1e0bcfec8892038fbb9cc5
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A nervousness came over her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: addb0212e5e850b5194e189320b8106c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A nervousness seemed to grip him. Then again, her brother had been plagued with nervousness all his life."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 875d1cdfa89fa8b42975b138f3b63ab2
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A new couple approached."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 180331325cbace93047db39a5b1d8d40
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A new door."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 32f624a690de3bbc44ce037958b47567
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A new feeling began to spring in Sarah."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9f5e25a0dcd69e60035e243c4fcb5d4b
msgctxt "speaker:Ayaka"
msgid "A new friend, have we?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 978fafa27ac45b2f82fb7ab8c3492cb8
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A new lease on life."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 40de796485c7ee5491e9d7f0a5f9713d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A new life."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cd4c10cf073166be82545c36838228da
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A new report had come in."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c4d6924abc45537947f84d5a23c854fc
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A new understanding had grown between them."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d55deddc72ba502a16312201b576aeb4
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "A new warlord has risen, or to be exact, several of them. Each claiming title to the horde, but each as spurious as the other."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5d357843dfdde5915125f7c4f1666789
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "A nice offer, blondie."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6e2829a6a8fa1910e651092a2cb3e2ba
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "A nobody. You risked your life, facing down a demon, just to save me, a girl that meant nothing to you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ddc80b6697cc19ebbe1125a2a61763d6
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "A nudge here, a tug there."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4ca21edddacf5083f3dd5368246c4160
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A pain she desired, and a pleasure that harmed her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7a996767ac2c221f9092bb2f4cd49e23
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A pain that came as pleasure."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a78a1f240ac22638d98268252d11154f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A pain that was no pain, carried Sarah further over the edge of pleasure."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d296fbf20ca3a2cf8022556ba43458cc
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A pained expression moved across his face, for a brief moment, then he banished it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 257e739362288b78a9722abad8accb08
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A pained regret in her voice. Not tonight, and perhaps not ever."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1e768af472d4af9b731944a3bb4c61be
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A pained smile appeared on Cassius' face."
msgstr ""

