#. uid: 6be5b3bea1c1e2f7ffa957e0b177e8d9
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A roaring, blinding wave of orgasmic pleasure rose up from between her legs, rushing out across every limb of her body."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8e524081636616a40eace6c632d879a3
msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
msgid "A rock is a rock. A river a river. And a slave a slave."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 802d5b11c2e79df2858fa36897cb307d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A room full of them, she looked around."
