msgid "After blowing his last load, the captain throws Sarah aside and takes command of the wheel again."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1a4e55cd5f3bd1c9023d333a029dff7a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After burning the bridges, the farmers had begun looting the provincial capital, and even attempted to lay siege to the ancestral home of the Taylee family."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b1ac79697016b16c5345c5145cf06cf1
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After catching her breath, still on her knees, she looked at Atilla."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 832c88559b5b339b7825746be6c66de0
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After dragging her along up another dune, Sarah wondered if Jaeid had lost his mind and was carrying her off randomly into the desert."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ac409772cf47ff8d777ea61f62ed1223
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After each had had their fill, they stumbled back to the tent, falling into a deep and sweet sleep."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 27abfc1178f34ee2b6828dc5631798aa
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After each long day of work, she knew her work was not yet over."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cf16336cd3043f43766d02e79f929f6d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After everyone had taken their seat, a silence lingered in the air."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cae26f41d3fa80828b3d221e6106738e
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After exchanging brief greetings, Thomas began the meeting by clearing his throat."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 677cfe929e3863e950a608df5fc22b1a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After finishing her food, the officer came to collect her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3f2145cbbe9458d359a4032dc95229a3
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After finishing up the remainder of the laundry that she had not been able to get to the day before, she took to cleaning up inside the home."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 268ac256db8e71f2db2d8d16ae2b92ff
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After food came drink."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d1964c1dd9260b111a1f7e9614c3e8a7
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After getting her pregnant, he would sail the world, returning nine months later, only to do it all over again."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4833c077ea7308f54bba5291c5536fb3
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After having been in the forest, this suddenly felt very vulernable."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e0b32843585cc4c012ea532931432fa0
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After having carried the fate stone through the house, the spirit was now untethered from its flask."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0ed0dd01f70e5e0e1d1a2e44d96668e9
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After having survived the desert, everything else seemed easy."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3445139564351143c075d42ce8735cc1
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After he felt the theory was covered, they went on to the practice."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 89015a8704e48bfaa371766f927f6732
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After he finished explaining her the routine, he pointed towards his belt and loincloth, still where he had left them."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2554e04719e7fba39467fe047e9a117d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After he finished for a final time, Sarah collapsed forward into a bed of their crumpled up clothes."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f6e9222ed8bac0b7dd9a095e87b08ef6
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After her brief rest, she resumed the work, and not before long, she could see the sun set and the sky darken."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 884f61c504af367983449959cd2e024f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After her first lesson, Metis had strictly forbidden her from practicing the Art of Daemonology by herself."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 06ef9626def8cee688eb0e6d38d384de
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After her mother had passed, it has just been Sarah, Thomas and her father."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5eeb2b38ad0d3faac713d66211d8c5f6
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After her victory over Vaelen, the soldiers of the mercenary company had broken out into celebration."
msgstr ""

#. uid: aff45eb5f2d03d5e25f28078417db3d6
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "After his vision, he said he was going to change his life. Abandon his pride, his ambition and even his desire for revenge."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 76a45fc0ed1f34d8c8e4bca0afd6300f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After hours more, finally, the hood was pulled off."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 945b70b07d5d764aa13c6af9cb84ac99
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After hours of walking, Alaric finally slowed down."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4c0e86428633c58f5693cb03a167a33b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After hours, with their muscles and energies spend, they finally made their way out of the ruin, back to the entrance."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f4dc230c4983d622a9d2903145e5cc9a
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "After it dissapeared, only the roads and the crossroads were left."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1268041fc4d21f6fd4f3824c781ae1bf
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After kissing him for a long time, the goblin finally relented, leaning back."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 234132a97e02a64536cbbe20db5e3c36
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After leaving her cart in the care of Kate, Sarah reported to the front of the convoy."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ab14d2d239b0d6c7d953369957b80911
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "After losing it all, I had to figure out a way to make money."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6a270e69fc1574f7d77d2c0ba765aec9
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "After me, you're ruined."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4bbaf9a6e000061ae02762e983f12edf
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "After months of preparation, the ritual was carried out and another world was summoned into ours."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5667e2c449e38d3431a34d9ce75194fc
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "After months of preparation, the ritual was carried out and the other world was summoned into this one."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ee97130de5e92dac1e039345213dc4d1
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After more than a week the only spell she had managed was producing a soft glowing light from her palms."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e21bbe8aeff1d1818c1a51e7bb259087
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After much time had passed, though she could not begin to say how much, the door to her cell finally opened."
msgstr ""

#. uid: bfff6d6d81892c632805b0dd08e727b7
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "After my mother it was just the three of us...and I loved my Father, but I loved Thomas even more."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c9b1dc0adfc531753e4698d0eb9cc487
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After nearly an hour, she finally managed."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cbe7d224445f425c7c026ad6a8a7a8e3
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After nearly an hour, the last of the wards finally collapsed, and their magical energies cut through the metal door."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 69aebee6584db941ddec1f2d28108ba2
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After nearly ten minutes, Sarah could feel herself grow exhausted from the effort."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b5b3bf00e6118d3c3bbc8dfd15d1fa14
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After nine days, they arrive in Lethram."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 82fbfd25125d1ba27b9ae81b079d3bd9
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After only a little time, Atilla let go of Sarah's waist and let her take him down to her mound."
msgstr ""

#. uid: eb6fceccf4f2b0ce299f991354069fa5
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After placing Samayra in the bed, Sarah crawled in next to her. Embracing her tightly."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 004d478588a0609f193ee14e72f6b848
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After repelling the last of the soldiers, nobody else came to try again."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1c609d907dccbec5345da8c2d82d439b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After searching all over the camp, Sarah finally found Kate at the training grounds."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c8df902833592cc9aafee295c964d387
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After settling several smaller items, General Barion was the first to bring up another matter."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d7485095b4a921ba780d6e5577cb8afe
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After several days of travelling in what now seemed an unfamiliar sense of safety, that Sarah's eyes first fell upon the city of Rahayal."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 44370f8991fe3e7d522f1c33b2d61beb
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After several hours, she watched as Alaric came back to her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0d2fa00d17abf8f1c83010b50a96395b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After several minutes of walking, Sakar finally turned around."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0be8925d364cca723a1cc927b3566690
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After she finished scrubbing herself clean, Sarah finally followed Dalia back to their room."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 224c4c8335eebf0c531c2f4acd9566fa
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After she had finished her manic rant, Belmont released his grip on her. He walked away, leaving behind a cum stained towel for her to clean herself with."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 26f792f89c11b6e951956cae22f7489e
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After she had left the pool, Sarah made her way straight to the library."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4484ba9a1c41b1adda69e8b5b33ac272
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After she was finished, the officer came to bring her back to the cart."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 961324d288d3af1a8a3cfe986e7aff65
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After she would be in Gallow's Creek, she wouldn't be able to leave."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8e9e19c03d481b0d4c3d5a7e02bcb5e9
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After she's done beating one of the girls within an inch of her life, nobody thinks she's a secret guard anymore."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 98b46501724d772c774c4550c24649f0
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After sitting around for a while longer, Kim suddenly got up."
msgstr ""

#. uid: dd0be2dcefeff3956954fd42ade89677
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "After so many years, I think I should have expected that you wouldn't last long."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0393535557ea018cef820a74a3c63a63
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After some time had passed, Lady Carolyn suddenly offered up a question that caught Sarah by surprise."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 37b12915b2da64858ec5a890a421b0db
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After some time has passed, the two finally break from one another."
msgstr ""

#. uid: bada75d862b61e51a915ae19b3b4e482
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After some time stewing, Sarah heard the handle to her bedroom door being jangled."
msgstr ""

#. uid: afa7da7d087b76ba9987537f9c5a6543
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After some time, Sarah and Samayra finally came upon the room that Samayra had intended to show her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 17f6ba8c246815bc33747ea01e7e29a0
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After some time, Sarah couldn’t guess how long, she began to stir."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c28844a0755698d0af8d7737380f57e6
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After some time, and feeling only half clean, Sarah gave up and threw the rag back into the corner. She suspected the rag was as soiled as most of her skin was, and feared using it much further."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 07e3457fa88cac7235b7f7758ec50894
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After some time, it had become obvious to all that the old soldier was not going to give up, and slowly the other bidders threw in the towel. Until finally, the last bid was called."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d53e456f1c054b93e215d5fde0cd240e
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After some time, she feels a cool sensation run past her body."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f39c09b3a0d2c49ec784cbc18f8280b5
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After some time, the official turned and raised his hands."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 53aee225f219bca7c00a81499ec23ed0
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After some time, the two men returned. Sakar was walking ahead of Krip by a good distance."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d6adeabb3634567c193b1e7e75b3d6e3
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After some time, they were finally summoned inside."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e8522c2adcad00a0562881f0ec6b67b7
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After striking the stones together for a while, one of the sparks finally caught fire."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1cc368b24f8799e2202ae4d0fc539984
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After sweating the stove for nearly an hour, Sarah produced the dish."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8f72e349f9781f68c9b5112163472115
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After swimming a short round, she came back upon where she started, finding Jaeid sitting on a rock."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 352c96ed3c7b294152fefe9eadbd5162
msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "After that little stunt in Bagrad with that creature, and now with that water in the desert, most men are ready to declare you a saint."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c53226ed089084bd51a45173b75f5231
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After that moment, there was no going back for either of them. Sarah and Atilla lived their life together, openly."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e14b969b01f398a0651da73643ab96ca
msgctxt "speaker:Ayaka"
msgid "After that night, I couldn't imagine why I ever rejected him at all."
msgstr ""

#. uid: bbf4a904065395d776f6c291826d4078
msgctxt "speaker:Old Tribesman"
msgid "After that performance, none of them will call my retreat a surrender."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0b0e604e0ae65c1f79485e283543e843
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "After that, I could never return to my people, and so I wandered the world."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fbf5ade19d42a45b33b5f6df29b4c741
msgctxt "speaker:Ayaka"
msgid "After that, I still rejected him, but my rejections grew softer and softer."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 99e33fff91bfa511b2eff6629fc08c7a
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "After that, I wandered around for a long time. I lived off the kindness of strangers for a long time."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 28a3af456d80ae8a3d844070c99a30ea
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "After that, every soldier or peasant will be given free reign to kill you on sight, and paid handsomely if they do."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6afa3a51d3a330927f34ecbecea9ec6c
msgctxt "speaker:Dalia"
msgid "After that, it was just a matter of time before the Gods started dying, one by one."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a417281d98d574d0554002a80510efb1
msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "After that, my role as an emissary for Hassar and his tribe followed naturally."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 431cfb1499c7c86b606a049d8227c4ab
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After that, no more news came."
msgstr ""

#. uid: bac0ed760f1456c3aff7ecd0fb184128
msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "After that, report back, and we'll start your first shift."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e2c7cef04b1d32f2860b1cf4c25c5b0a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After that, she began to weave her spells."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e994df6b95ca70d8df96f650f704ed0c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After that, she collapsed into blissful sleep."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4af8d10be1b8af99864ebb11cf014e56
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After that, she was lost to him."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8eb86c1c732ab7f0ab111e5dd5a70b38
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "After that, the countries of the central kingdoms were so deprived of people and wealth, that they could no longer sustain themselves."
msgstr ""

#. uid: bf503ae6b61deff46f5d99833765e45b
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "After that, they gave me my title, and I never looked back."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 05a12a68527e930c198d4e65224fa6a7
msgctxt "speaker:Dalia"
msgid "After that, things got easier."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8dea1723696c693e31e9e2c4eaa3667d
msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "After that, we wanted to tell you, but we were trying to find the proper words for it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 358920e70bb19b31a84de998625c21c9
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "After that, we will move onto learning how you can manipulate and fold this energy into practical spells."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ed05e1efc35088724e33e7b07cde32f8
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After the blast had taken most of them out, Sakar's skill with a blade had finished most of the others."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f7e9e4e0db3edb2e91844d3f516d94e1
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After the captain finished his accounting, he nodded, approvingly."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b09e3cf334165532c07ea6b0fd08af81
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After the last drops of wine spilled from the bottle, Kate threw the bottle as far as she could manage."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5fd6e0131fe53bd480676c3889cb2095
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After the men had been served, Sarah quitely took her seat next to Alfred."
msgstr ""

#. uid: aba387a966bdbe34b440cf8779209b34
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After the official coronation had finished, the festivities could begin."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 328e8f410c7a37aa5d74f158565ca65f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After the spirit had been done with her, he had left her in the bed, spend and ruined."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b7136ccd495f6f9a59120d5310d0a95a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After the torment of the desert, Sarah had wondered if she'd ever feel clean again."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7b1e7770ce2f2f91ca3bb02242c9497c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After their meal was finished, Sigmund and Krip walked away from the camp, discussing something that Sarah could no longer overhear."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 66e1a598e44e32169907267abe810c5a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After they had departed, she had only a brief moment to enjoy the open sea, before more work had to be done."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 49b27160f745e377f8ba633f4d34628a
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "After this whole absurd council is done, I don't suspect we'll be spending too much time together."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e003093c284b1075931b28cad19ce403
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After this, down the road, past the shops, into the harbor. She tried to remember the path that Kate had dragged her along."
msgstr ""

#. uid: be062263ce92520676fdeccbde54ccc2
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After waking and seeing to his needs, he would lay about in his bed for hours on end, at some point emerging and expecting food."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1a91fed8225ba2981bce445eb8e001ee
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After wandering the castle for some time, she followed echoes of muted sounds, the embers of a celebration."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b3725d2c1e8dfcdda9264e440a9ce6f8
msgctxt "speaker:Tribesman"
msgid "After we crushed his forces outside, we prepared to siege the city."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 61e5a9abed051bc19117b5a11c87c353
msgctxt "speaker:Tribesman"
msgid "After we took the city, we send thousands to Al'Gahaem."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1a5b2bffbf27793cbc63dcc89f599c61
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "After what I did..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3f25943e967137352ca3758992efe1ab
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After what felt like forever, he broke their kiss."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a4ce4c0bdc15ad3859284076ffcd2656
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After what had happened in the yard during the day, it was no surprise he felt emboldened."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2a0a1749338321c49044ad1f0448eb56
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After working the captain's shaft for several minutes more, Sarah felt a tap on her shoulders."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b0080f9cd2725a11bbf073e4bb032a36
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After, Lady Carolyn, equally uninterested in Sarah, held up her cup."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1953e847122344756bf7e15b2ae3c712
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After, she gathered up the large pile of laundry."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9212433b2bbba3cd1b6e30d33a9bc1da
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After, she thought. Maybe after the exam there could be easy days, like most of her days had been before coming to Lethram."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fff5c66f44ed5bd831e9ac1beb6d362e
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "After, she would always repay him."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5f8a8524ed9325f25fddf5cbfc346247
msgctxt "speaker:Mayor"
msgid "After, the attacks became more frequent and grew more violent."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 214db71d1247fcf46a40a0a675b82930
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "After, the gods of your world vanished, but in truth, they merely escaped it. They hid because the destruction caused by the world collision killed one of them and left the others weakened."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e03feac11f023f2ab244546527fb4f91
msgctxt "speaker:Gilead"
msgid "After, we can discuss some terms for trading rights."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3fb7382511fbe4023c1070b8fead3f4b
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "After?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 196802cbc4afd0b5ad92e60efa91f4b7
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Again and again her mind had turned."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2ea9f93414fae8777d497e97e667c120
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Again and again she replayed it, finding herself back sitting where she was now."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c7fe62eb524b77950db3751672415f46
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Again and again she searched herself for the part of her that would deny him."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 85a2407d1f44f143427f9cf736cb6426
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "Again and again, I ran through the memories, the little comforts that I had."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f3d8e93d82a932264450394d740d225c
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "Again and again, I watched them burn in divine flame, undying yet forever lost."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 35e0f9f2c91804fd17e830adebb95f36
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Again and again, Sarah began to manipulate the energies, gathering the air and pushing out ships that were full."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 74eda882162c5b448f9f57922f5000be
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Again and again, Sarah drew out the clawed form of her hand."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6dd1e1f16e753c55255991107deb7a16
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Again and again, Sarah felt her entire body lifted up by her waist, only to be impaled again further on his cock."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 78cac2f8b2493aabf586adc03d9c67c0
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Again and again, Sarah repeated the words. All to the same result."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c6ebeba0007c6f60942fed50ce42ec11
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Again and again, he brought it down with a force that seemed inhuman to Sarah."
msgstr ""

