msgid "I can't try anything crazy cause I don't wanna find out what happens if I pull too hard."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b9c568a80988a61c9511e9edcd2c24ee
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "I can't wait for you to begin learning all of this!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8280a26f61ab9cb69bca47296b238b40
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "I can't wait to be rid of this horrid place."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 325e73b132c9de6b19ab6e7f4cb58f8d
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "I can't."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 92902df525b95beb89c50ce590fe103d
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I can't...I can't anymore..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0b259259ce3a9fc9c90835ce68bb513d
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I can't...I can't begin to think of what he means to you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 65d438f54659f3f69a6fc904d142effb
msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "I can, and I will, because I have been instructed to do so. I am a good man, or I try to be, but a good man is also loyal, and I am loyal to my Khan."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d4a1cf0b9349fb36a46d8f21182da550
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I can, of course."
msgstr ""

#. uid: eb7337f7b7ae051a1c32591944b8b872
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I can. And so can you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: abcc2e7fecf688d775583d7b8123805e
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I can...I can will it to be so."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7fe096aa5e6ed228848a4ada8054ea93
msgctxt "speaker:Kravel"
msgid "I cannot agree with her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0799c4fb8e2f4d895c84e3816ccb27a5
msgctxt "speaker:Tribesman"
msgid "I cannot be allowed to be seen as weak. If I am...I might as well risk the fight here and now."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6a9d4f9172b759bdfc4da623a7266597
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "I cannot begin to speak of it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ced065c934edbea155f8a27f034a170b
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I cannot bring myself to marry...not now...not for a long time."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6e06d26aae940cbeffa423336871b0e6
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I cannot bring you to reconsider?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 65bf6730ee040f056ccc94f86042a0ac
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "I cannot imagine this to be a trick. It makes no sense, given her character and given the strategy of it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e319915fb2a2c970533093b313c22870
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "I cannot say."
msgstr ""

#. uid: be6aa5d6f496917ed5f84e4efa33d097
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I cannot simply gamble away a vote on such a proposition."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4ed85b8d5ab22494294e27e146a7c125
msgctxt "speaker:Founder"
msgid "I cannot tell you how much it gladdens my heart to see so many of you gathered here today."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4ebec87d8354bae3fd53aff0dbf3bda4
msgctxt "speaker:Marshal Edmond"
msgid "I cannot win the seat for myself; I lack the support. And to be a peer to Antonio...disgusting."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9d6006b5e8658c60a1d9c96dd514e1f5
msgctxt "speaker:Tribesman"
msgid "I cannot."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c523d1fddb317169323af512ea922800
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I care about what is in here."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 362421bea8bcf24f6849be14f31c6ef0
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "I care for you Sarah, I do. I want the best for you, and above all, I want you to be safe."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2229196ec427790215cac09bb346ec99
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I care. Blame my personality. Blame how I was raised. Fuck, if I knew how to turn it off, I would."
msgstr ""

#. uid: aaa6d7683237ed5dab2b4287c3040a53
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "I carried with me this monolith, a fragment of a relic from my world."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a00403879894c6dfb5e188a9f25bc031
msgctxt "speaker:Emmissary"
msgid "I carry many names. Kinslayer. Widowmaker. Exile."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 13556aa2c8bd83b20eafed74db5b81a5
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I carry my homeland with me, wherever I go."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a7e66118160e09778c85de484337d704
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "I cast my own vote for Sarah Rose."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a08526a75c511bdfbb73845ddf0672f9
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "I cast my own vote for myself."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 99eebb76c99116eb8aab47e7c63a210c
msgctxt "speaker:Marshal Edmond"
msgid "I cast my vote for Sarah Rose."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f22718683b19e788786f3bef00e660bf
msgctxt "speaker:Marshal Edmond"
msgid "I cast my vote for myself."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f942bc81d44d5d1ab167bd4f17eddc11
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "I cast my vote in favor or Queen Maeiv."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e05fd5aa3fb8a54b99b058a638a4e123
msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "I caused this! And even if I am no to blame, I am still the cause of it!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7e3e95787e811d0660ca158501434818
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "I choose them because they're bastards who will put an axe in any man's head if the situation requires it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8696e86d592c988da107f6b57cb724e1
msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "I claimed her and she is mine by right."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 572969da3fc2c4a483cbb1c8bbc36a43
msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "I claimed the girl as my spoils in war. She is mine by right of the Tribes, by right of war!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3e863b24b07d4ef5b7288e7adab1d13e
msgctxt "speaker:Emmissary"
msgid "I come bearing a message."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ec8a1d37b5c09dea6ff571bbce8f0266
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I come before you, not to demand loyalty like kings of old, but to ask for your aid."
msgstr ""

#. uid: daa571f0d69babd94177799b4c72ccb9
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I come from a noble family, from Rosanna."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c07e81540163c0e35570de34f0421558
msgctxt "speaker:Shah Mahda"
msgid "I commanded you to tell me how the battle goes. Speak, wizard, lest I send you away."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a11b882bd5188e5e42429f6105067082
msgctxt "speaker:Judge"
msgid "I consider this most disrespectful of this institution."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e25749107fed029b889faae48c36ecf7
msgctxt "speaker:Advisor"
msgid "I contacted them in the most delicate way, regarding a meeting to discuss the proposal."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7f360c99b16b12f581ffed949ac8e249
msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "I could bash down the door, we'd be in in a minute."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 12192b19c5b8e2d94d6ef4264c3bd355
msgctxt "speaker:Gilead"
msgid "I could bash your head against this wall until you are nothing but pulp, and nothing would come of it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f15e1e181115b0ba1029124bd00286dd
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I could come back and sit upon a cold throne, ruling an empire of...nothing."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 588f1d0e8332f6e130a9e56c13a5bc22
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "I could crush you easily."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 924804642a27eb09e28e4fea612f8d5f
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "I could escort you back to your room, but such would only bring more rumors, no?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: c03d0380e401010ce7d1d3253a735f18
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "I could fuck your brains out on this bed. That should kill some time."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8378b838ee2230665276014a98d52c9c
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I could get used to it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 05db507eb5402c1ba3ee42a900faee1d
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "I could give a fuck what that old Spymaster has to say."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e38143673186469609ad26ea4e135ef0
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I could have asked my Father to..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7e207b1166f9ad98351393a39bb769c2
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I could have helped."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2c7d7a6780f241ac5cc1202b842eda0f
msgctxt "speaker:Gorak"
msgid "I could have taken you for myself, but a good chieftain must share in his wealth."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 920d5db79428bd0eb165a6842bb57d68
msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "I could hear the people...celebrating. And I was alone. Every cheer, a reminder that I would never hear my sister's voice again."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d50f2ef9cf74598c01073017472c1a63
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I could never have asked for a more loyal friend."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8eafc3d695ff06d51bb3e8b2a4fe9ef3
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "I could never have imagined it would look like that..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 493bba2c566cd26e8b548bdab5b3ef1a
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I could never think poorly of you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 47306617848760d23229bb9e709c5b0e
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "I could not have protected you there."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8ffd58c0758f60d5b516b693f2457066
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "I could not move too directly."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4ed21e5d7087bc78294950adde6920b1
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I could pay!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: ee1d504694e950b7bb77bb0df8e69017
msgctxt "speaker:Hecate"
msgid "I could pretend that I'm a true believer, but the truth is that the council also controls the promotions."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6fe16b3137ed79daf430b9d6e641826c
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "I could see from the start that they would lose. Not that same day, or even that same week, but I could see months in the future."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 901235844773411da55bedc81f3a09ed
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "I could see it in your face."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4facea9b0e429e5603b6ed075e5dd58a
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "I could see it, even in the early days of your training."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9f10945edd4f93db557e836915556fef
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "I could stand to lose a few coins, ease up on the weight of this here bag."
msgstr ""

#. uid: dbb29728a3eb54ebc1f6fe3cd3e0598f
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "I could still cry out, but I could no longer move my body, trapped in the rock."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6d449be78c85049caf52006bb4d29514
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "I could strike you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 158f366047b541c0f11f9de09008b490
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "I could take you and as my apprentice! I could teach you how to tap into your magical abilities."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 66e99c90f44556550e4aa78fc4f95c18
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "I could tell you, but then you'd be what they call an accessory-to-a-crime."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 873d89d626b3eacbd0b9334ddb10b09e
msgctxt "speaker:Thomas"
msgid "I could walk you down the aisle."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1e09120c154de69cd70ddf6e6045fed2
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I could."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 574b8da2978ca4f38318f558698dcd15
msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
msgid "I could..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 574b8da2978ca4f38318f558698dcd15
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "I could..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9b991d991baff60b3f034df102ef1bd0
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I couldn't agree with you more."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9287ff9797eaf4f99066a09d5f9cb8d9
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I couldn't sleep."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 205699e7cb3f2561c2b9be79d913592b
msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "I couldn't stop thinking about you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0ff1c22bf03dbe8dd8388b8c23648836
msgctxt "speaker:Ayaka"
msgid "I cried and raged and cried again, but no matter what, Hassar remained."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7a412ea7b0c779793232b5d3c65fe6fb
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "I cry too, sometimes."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 34a37fc5c690e9da705221cf6e18a767
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "I decide what happens."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 980a866813e66595f94f7cfc1abfb8c8
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "I developed ways of dealing with that pain..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ae144afcfb3821b7fad22d5e5c5887e5
msgctxt "speaker:Gilead"
msgid "I dictate everything in this Estate. If I pay you to stand on your head all night, that is what you will do."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ff72011654702abdf0224fc92ac1c2cd
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I did all I could...but..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 48086f05910a9e89d26bd5e330456c17
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I did always like to dance."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 175f2ac6140d31cc446d32c5aed8c60e
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I did change a lot as well..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a29ea2ba0922b4863dd97ff191e5759b
msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "I did no such thing."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 60774d101efa4a895a7bae42865f9afd
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I did not ask for riddles, but answers."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 25cb668349a624ff21685f4d980348eb
msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
msgid "I did not care. I could have lived with it. I would bear her upon my back until her skin would turn as frail as parchment."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 21144e84547a8adf642a5d9702c359aa
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I did not return to my homeland to settle cheap scores."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cc47c6d99787848462258939ebc7eb21
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I did read it in fact."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ae18c66af5c0de918742eebfad9beeaf
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "I did see it coming long ago. This moment. I saw it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9a3cc444060c752b474b5c893e3d860e
msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "I did that. I did that for Gods know how many times."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5f1ffc3b4ca80c8702fba017d3d40aa0
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I did what I did because it was the right thing, Samayra. Because you deserved to live."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2650e3e9da7463c9505d6c248611573d
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I did what you asked..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 151dab73fb18deb4c72b4c631328ab0e
msgctxt "speaker:Raza"
msgid "I did!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: af3b20ce87e84f03443d2a693e208e14
msgctxt "speaker:Tribesman"
msgid "I did, and then I took him, his sisters and whatever other spoils of war that were mine by right."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5d5064f221fcd62dd702aa051aa989de
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I did, and trust me, they beat my hands until they were purple, trying to make me write like a proper lady."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 851bb226838736dd45da03f3cb35b45f
msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "I did, but let me utter them again, free of duress! I will serve you, loyally, forever!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: a74a2ccbfd069b60014bd18d4a21d757
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "I did, for a few years. But military life doesn't really suit me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2d9a64530d86297d3b33d782bfb5968e
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "I did."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2d9a64530d86297d3b33d782bfb5968e
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I did."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2d9a64530d86297d3b33d782bfb5968e
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "I did."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2d9a64530d86297d3b33d782bfb5968e
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "I did."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9286658ff9b79c97e6dcf589f16adbf0
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "I did. Paid him extra if he'd wear it for the trip. He was happy to oblige."
msgstr ""

#. uid: df8146eae7667f2b780bb64ea9796079
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I did..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9dc48d52e4d39c5d31638d0bc7da45dc
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "I did...and yet, I thought you would not come."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7b09d6dcc7f01b4e8992d8d521ffc3cc
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "I did...but life goes on. And now I got to meet you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 33a4c9e9b5fc2cdb8df23f775cad354b
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I did...but...I didn't...I..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: da11f869ba652cc7356efc53b6dd12d7
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "I did?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: da11f869ba652cc7356efc53b6dd12d7
msgctxt "speaker:Thomas"
msgid "I did?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: b3efb4e66e722b114e5ed409636a076f
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "I didn't ask you to come here and tell me how this is impossible. I need you to tell me how it is possible."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e944cfd5f4114e6836d88a1ebb16898f
msgctxt "speaker:Sophia"
msgid "I didn't believe what the girls were saying."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5745e8e2f08f860b0b74cf1e25a7411a
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't come here for riddles."
msgstr ""

#. uid: aad039cd69380f8e96c2f0029bc710a7
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't come here to commune with unholy beasts."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f7ea87e7e5e3f21fbe7cb38c8d3cf06c
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "I didn't deserve this."
msgstr ""

#. uid: dd93a4c18c150c6ae0b1bafbf47c3269
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't do anything, I was just sleeping here, I swear that I-"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 242e4c627dc1339360b0cdce12a334cb
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't do this on purpose! I just...my mind slipped and I..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2785fa49b4badf6c85bbf61339e7c7f1
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't drop anything."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 94f1b2feed183b630a05829cf78fbda1
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "I didn't duck out! I was trying to-"
msgstr ""

#. uid: bac01143c959db17250438c7a9db2bb2
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't enjoy it..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 36a4be8f446d92a5294ab375e3c0c900
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't enjoy winning out over Vaelen. His death."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fa9c749c295f696c7e501f1fbe134922
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "I didn't even hit that fucker that hard."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f66772dc7751060521b47357c5586736
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't exactly come here for the food."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b7b7a51282e14b85a594c9c596068783
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't expect that!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: f7c52af7f53e63d6ad631cabd72e1e52
msgctxt "speaker:Thomas"
msgid "I didn't fall asleep in the soup!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 99a465bbada5a0b802792908b2a3b2d6
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't finish, but it's alright."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a8db2be6c82cb49e150b4270ece4af15
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't forget either."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8bea1361738ee14fa0764d72ead95a14
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "I didn't invite her to tell me the truth, nor did I invite you here to gang up with her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fd6688aa27b2e2ceeb604df5d8137c96
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "I didn't invite you here to repeat what you already know."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ac94edfcb679c01a0439dadbd2011d71
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "I didn't just come here because your father had passed."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d8c6c6ab284ea4916969ea8d6333fd59
msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "I didn't just come here to save you. I was send by Khan Hassar to personally guarantee your safe passage."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0d5ee93f7fef31c6dba5724e10c85723
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't kill a demon."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cbd4103d7ed1c8bba757bd404932f6d1
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't know I needed one, in my castle. In my own bedroom."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 322ae45df9d7d8bb70dec59d01c3fa75
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't know a wife needed a reason to visit her husband."
msgstr ""

#. uid: dfad15f2d95426a41049fc5797c51bf2
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't know that you..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c808d9668288fcf418703867b86acc03
msgctxt "speaker:Thomas"
msgid "I didn't know that."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b478fb59d84d955cc3759d41419bbcad
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't know the two of you had nicknames for each other."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 83c7125ff4d78723ae2ec5ee798814ce
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't know they had complaints..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fbc03cc06035fbdc36e17e05dd59fae0
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "I didn't know they taught mages dancing classes."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7ea3e3948c37609942d41012f0eabd4f
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't know what to do or where to go and I...I was so afraid..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ee5245d485a61755f9385cdbf1ef04cd
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "I didn't know you had a brother."
msgstr ""

#. uid: bf372429c2743965c5f49d4bcbfb0eff
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't know you had fallen so deeply in debt."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 14af239349d02216a3f1429d53b4d577
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't know you had met my father."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5f6943e352567904c11b0c5489a425ec
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't know you thought of me like that."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 39f2af363efc355a6b323cb772dda730
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't know you were a dancer."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3269c133adf01f624b848f6fced5b0e5
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "I didn't lie, your brother truly fought bravely."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2f4a161737c73029101ae28c0bfe185d
msgctxt "speaker:Nickolas"
msgid "I didn't mean anything by it, I just want to feel warm for one forsaken minute."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c807d27e53315a98792a95d41c34006b
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "I didn't mean anything by it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 30135635726a0c03728a7081bc67a3ea
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't mean finish in there!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 167612864bde0f7e02056adab70ee752
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't mean it like that, I just-"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 687a0972a05a0592bcb57be7372c6112
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't mean to insult you, Gideon. It's just...we're so vulnerable out here."
msgstr ""

#. uid: eec01db94cb6368b2ed5a7e262bd8f2d
msgctxt "speaker:Marshal Edmond"
msgid "I didn't mean to-"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 02501fd46f4019efc58f2c557510425c
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "I didn't meant to-"
msgstr ""

#. uid: c4860d83f6cb23f5811443385d2fd20e
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "I didn't miss much of my old life, but I'll say, those days out in the forest with you...I missed those."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 003c03b8a8290bce2b7ea64c6facc961
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't resent him. I only loved him more for it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8fc5b74a5983724bc7f4b4d0d98e6b5b
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't say I'd do it!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 68ca38e9dd628de9c19ccebd8dd7a555
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "I didn't say nothing."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 10b1bb0d75e1c0b2414021ddd352c606
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "I didn't see you again after this morning."
msgstr ""

#. uid: caf65713964758be55bd1f97c53c79a9
msgctxt "speaker:Sophia"
msgid "I didn't start sleeping with him right away."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8daa5488c8b50946e40c647eb9db1890
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't steal it..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5d68ef856dd7126d39757eedd181ad00
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't survive that frozen water just to die on the shore, and neither did you. Get up on your fucking feet right now!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5ef9424ce6e41554723d34a779e1ba69
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't take you for one who appreciated gardens and flowers."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 431a0509d011f0f2f24cd1b7d3c23a5f
msgctxt "speaker:Nickolas"
msgid "I didn't think you would."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 97996add572c832773cf29da9d7fef14
msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "I didn't want that for you. They break in new slaves, right there, in their backrooms. When I thought about you being there, it just seemed wrong."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ef64cb4d6f37e1d08b1a9749a2aeed61
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't want to be alone."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 427f782df21afbb1da0aa0a2386b4597
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't want to hurt her..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2de34dc068fbd2d054e3cc1366999cfc
msgctxt "speaker:Nickolas"
msgid "I didn't want to say anything when we were out there...but I was sure we would die."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 40534665c21a8b9b0fe6d2e9adedbf16
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "I didn't want to show up to our meeting empty-handed."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8569556a6d941750a0f9dd6934c44e8d
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't, it just-"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 56b89945db10fd13b79b61ea46dd2cfe
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't...I didn't say I didn't believe you...I just..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 49cd07d6c406d8d8493360c5e8b03237
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn’t like it…"
msgstr ""

#. uid: f941d498369d7a7b3164d45a1bcc6b60
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I do no such thing."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1c6acef5228a84f5d04336e597b306f8
msgctxt "speaker:Hassar"
msgid "I do not deny the girl is yours...but I simply requested."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a0ff58680887738391f5fbaa938b1c60
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "I do not doubt that each of you has considered themselves for the role, but I would like us all to put aside our personal interests."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2fcec7c119241dc2f98adb25ada5d049
msgctxt "speaker:Gilead"
msgid "I do not doubt their stories, or yours."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1ffc4636d6a0425df62c429b6266b153
msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
msgid "I do not know all of you, but even in these few days I have learned how you have suffered under this man's foolishness."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 23c6bf85166c7719589feff00136b1d2
msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "I do not know those details yet, only that the Khan has invited me to attend and wished for you to come as well."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1a6dca1af3ddbdce7b74fa1b38bad565
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "I do not know. Even I do not hold all the answers."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e506198d3ddbbd25f03287b45d17f605
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I do not mean to insult you, Varga."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ddf7d64e908a194b77e775e20d7fc4a9
msgctxt "speaker:Daemon"
msgid "I do not mean to tolerate her failures."
msgstr ""

#. uid: aa8522acf92dbd6306eb79cfe7b0e1d3
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I do not trust the intentions of Queen Maeiv, nor do I want to give up our advantage."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c40b1a72979be4ba45a8824507273099
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "I do not want a wife that simply nods along to me, you're much too clever for that."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ba4943d35751462873825809aeacfc96
msgctxt "speaker:Sophia"
msgid "I do remember though..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 12db1c826cb6df14f23ce85ca13d7c75
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "I do what I have to, but I won't pretend I don't miss my villa in Rahayal."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 297013513ed754a4136b613332736e1a
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I do what I must. Taking on my family's duties is an honour."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 67f4b3888dd740cde794782cc3a48b42
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I do! I always do!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 51aa8e1f144aef666f97b777a5e01de1
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "I do, but child, you told me you longed to be free."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2dcba4778bb9834fc3cc25915a4ad699
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I do, it's an order. I want to show you something"
msgstr ""

#. uid: e6eb22b1096f5af51640938208225816
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "I do."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e6eb22b1096f5af51640938208225816
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "I do."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e6eb22b1096f5af51640938208225816
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I do."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e6eb22b1096f5af51640938208225816
msgctxt "speaker:Sophia"
msgid "I do."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e6eb22b1096f5af51640938208225816
msgctxt "speaker:Thomas"
msgid "I do."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 907a290429ab3cfba85cceb7158e6818
msgctxt "speaker:Albert"
msgid "I do. And I didn't tell a single lie."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fbb0a0ec992cc071348290004f8eef7d
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "I do. And you're lucky to have survived that slaughter."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a1f976a004ba9f1739937e70d52afc75
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "I do. But you will have to ask."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 003fc648390f80918f5cfdbcf0f81be8
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "I do. I understand the demands I am making, and that they will not be easy."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0a1a0777ca97f14a3b66e75bc1923fe5
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I do..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e08b49a42c0c594b1692e86bbcdb9b21
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "I do...I vowed that I would help you return to Rosanna."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a21fd149dae2e36c3e82186e96597a8d
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "I do...care for you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f95eaa3a0d2322965baf4bb1ad5f6fdf
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I doesn't need to be this way."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c4ce9b08ebe68e5f74ba49ee163cb7d9
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "I don't ask for your trust, only a chance to earn it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ccc71f9b64dc7d4308b70d9611dacce4
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "I don't believe in much of anything like that."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1c94e6e4c5521c77e1aec05acb109609
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "I don't blame you at all. I really don't, Sarah."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 795e6653bd97572d9ca44a958fda49a4
msgctxt "speaker:Kim"
msgid "I don't blame you for waking up."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 051e7057cdc8ecebcfc979a3424020b5
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't care about rules or about what is meant to happen."
msgstr ""

#. uid: befd1972b10353acaa403f70b51e17ca
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't care about such things."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8ce5774d910ac8b51846349ac2c5a12e
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't care about that!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3b0c3500bd0c6600ec3a2167f5172100
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't care about that. I never wanted to be strong or a great ruler. I just want my brother to be safe."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 96605abbde0dd42c94ca706cca21a36b
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't care if it's an orc legion, I'm not leaving your side."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6b6c56247a4fb145bad7960e8b8c0e53
msgctxt "speaker:Kim"
msgid "I don't care if you lie. We all do, down here."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 640e79dd1b30d3fde2fbf3fe0b6f86c4
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't care if you tell me I'm a whore or if you..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f868aad3bd9b49734dfd944778946d6d
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "I don't care if your Empress of the world."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b8da9f3dbb74f2f5a679582df7f2688e
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "I don't care what you say or do. I'll force the money in your pockets if I have to, got that?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7b4b9d52eac56414e0bdd33e7dc87eb8
msgctxt "speaker:Daemon"
msgid "I don't care what you think or wonder about."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a69af9b662786b23fcfa0223d9ab0f9d
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't care!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: f6ae34e65d798819e46e44bbd016d137
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't care! I don't care!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: c88f169ae3cdea33aa355aef7d00ec4c
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "I don't care."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 97928d66aed18612670d2c5468458dfb
msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "I don't deny that what has happened to you, your people, is not a tragedy."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8a9cf4198f3897113bde3741b5e64c4d
msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "I don't doubt it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ffcce534ec64e9aee9df26475021bcc4
msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "I don't doubt you could, but I'm the better swimmer, so I'll just get away from you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c6ea9f8431e7f57a7092bde126d7c218
msgctxt "speaker:Damian"
msgid "I don't doubt you saw plenty a ladies turnin an honest trick for a food and a bed."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ab199bfc60a4decae066616d906b61af
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "I don't feel like I should complain. I've never wanted for anything. Whatever thing I wanted, I would get."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d8b791c79d12e72291cb85b88536a5ea
msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "I don't get a mage on my ship very often, and I promise that ship's Cook is quite good."
msgstr ""

#. uid: dd363c36a06b62db36c69c4e8b560a76
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't get a real sword?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 33ce86057a56c28ebc3ac838a4f1c97e
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't get it..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 95ec86086c1d9f33176413a5d13121f3
msgctxt "speaker:Mary"
msgid "I don't get much news around here, you know what's up? That bastard king still alive?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: ca03c6c389adc5fe5ebc9a9f19e253c1
msgctxt "speaker:Damian"
msgid "I don't give a damn if you had half of Lethram."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 588d011c99fcfd48dab170ad150bec39
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "I don't give a rat's ass about who rules over this heap of rocks."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b2a123e394becd6302bcdb27e69a52cf
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't have any illusions about him, but I do owe him for all he taught me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d21d9d786ae1426ffd178fb097a9f5a1
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't have any money either, sir. I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 393209f7efc6b99e60c93c447e12ef7b
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't have any money, so I'll just leave."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d8c17e5ad8710c552d632fe0b6301804
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't have any parents!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 943a3373017be4d7058104cdff2fa03c
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't have it yet. The contract."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 910c210a3395a06dedccb6821e7648d2
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "I don't have much of a choice."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 36221b44137e562f3159619aa5edb203
msgctxt "speaker:Thomas"
msgid "I don't have them Sarah. They're asking me for solutions to problems I didn't even know we had."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2d8fe2bb999e8119a33106fc4aa8ee94
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't have to answer you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c6e510b9ffbae8d2db781aae6c3503ab
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "I don't keep it on me, of course, but we could go get after we finish this one."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 87c1296ace6e63dc722758791665c9ba
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't know Kate. What's one less?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0f8f49e3a9a92f954c07879b4c21385b
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "I don't know about all that with you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 94fad23be517d0886d196a2d1c1ace76
msgctxt "speaker:Young man"
msgid "I don't know about good people, but this here town is a decent play to live, ay. Decent as any, I imagine."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 273a0a867dd8df94c3ea1e8d1795dca9
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't know anymore."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 947affc717b8462544e1dec3300e8e23
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't know anything about tailoring. I wouldn't be any help to you at all."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 89f34f83298df555d13d51b5c1f91f49
msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "I don't know anything about war...or kingdoms..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 496afb6039edf0c11ccc7f13c99715ba
msgctxt "speaker:Gabriel"
msgid "I don't know as much about that as Hecate, but...if she's afraid, then I'm afraid."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5ea3d3ce5996cba5023cf71e385fbde1
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't know if I-"
msgstr ""

#. uid: e4290da71acbb4a7cb790b5e94911d9b
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "I don't know if he was always a good person, but I don't think he deserved to die either."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 813470ac042261088dbf6cac775be1a9
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "I don't know if we should-"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 348255bbd6a7bd49ecc413ccddd62bc4
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't know this dance."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7e3b9e08cb8dcb15b6355b6fee0e23c1
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "I don't know though, it's a lot of money, but I don't think we're gonna be able to do what we did for a while."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e7f3e666c7eb2d8e4cd7d4a68f8afdeb
msgctxt "speaker:Dalia"
msgid "I don't know what I was thinking...maybe he had been too kind to me for a while. I forgot where I was."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 67696a3afae90b1ecb81cedf1b38067a
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't know what I'm asking."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 80bd0b251b096f6aed46b918f9102cdf
msgctxt "speaker:Ragged Man"
msgid "I don't know what a Samayra is, but make them drink the water and the water will drive out all foulness."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5b32b8e31983dd02865ea3c29819fd4b
msgctxt "speaker:Ephraim"
msgid "I don't know what to do, Sarah. About any of this."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9b7326967fef687ab07d86f1060806b0
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't know what we'll find in there."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 78301a0ba1fb00f8f8b13024ea7a3aae
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't know what you're hinting at."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cb7c46998a183680769de503a6605e30
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't know what you're talking about."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 138c804b56401e8c8cd88cc74daec495
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't know who that is!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 67527a810efe2884ad937c2c55346a07
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't know who that is. Am I supposed to?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2459ebd417b533fc2762d26af0a06699
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't know why I told you that. Forget it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6598d788f2757a2a389f0bad5b25210e
msgctxt "speaker:Ragged Man"
msgid "I don't know you, but I have friends that do."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0d7924e4c6bd94b05047154e03a0893e
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't know your Master, nor do I much appreciate being ambushed like this."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0737066180b3b48e04fe742946eb81d7
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't know your culture. Speak to me plainly."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7c476d636af5cb646fd9f2537427e073
msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "I don't know, Sarah. I wish I had more answers for you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6a4aba9de8beffb41478c686c1e1272e
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't know, a lot..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e6725c5b8c7e2f71e53fe6b03f63871f
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "I don't know, give me a helping hand?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2dc9970af419f0c081130db4ed3ece1d
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "I don't know, maybe I'll sell em at market tomorrow. Sure some broad will pay a price."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5e5684b8b265cd99ed4f23797a5f6277
msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "I don't know."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 781c531900397540da1dca9ab66d279f
msgctxt "speaker:Albert"
msgid "I don't know. But nothing good. All I know is that it is not as they say. These girls do not just leave."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 706c58ce0ffc4eb8cdbd963cb78bf0b6
msgctxt "speaker:Nickolas"
msgid "I don't know. I figured maybe you'd have a solution."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 62809bd52bca18cd3c8dc82701cf999f
msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "I don't know. I think you'd have a talent for it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3025dbe7f41fcb9f4a86ca828a6e0df4
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "I don't know. It feels weird to be back here."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cd07528dca8c0344928f0eae5de17abf
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't know. It wasn't anything I did, he just...he seemed not to notice me and when I got up he had his back to me and..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c5967688bb498bd998d79474df1ab085
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "I don't know. Maybe..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fcdc9c7420da5012452dba9b89d39072
msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "I don't know..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fcdc9c7420da5012452dba9b89d39072
msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "I don't know..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a385a63a33fe9c083e0d6e03aced8e6e
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't know...I guess it just...never happened."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a2e4adf3afde10a7ccbfba776e7a9be0
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't know...I have to think."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 714c56ae5491c6d6869af814235cbe17
msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "I don't know...it can be lonely."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9bcffd97ae2226e88f4ef60ee2021a01
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't know...they captured me and..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7ff9ca1a3926ddf2259db1edd1f916e7
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't know...this place seems nice, right?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 10958594da039fed4c8d2d921bec7f38
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't know...whatever you said..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c0f545e105026e0a952b0fb4d3a55d7d
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "I don't leave anyone alive, so it doesn't matter if they see."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7c1ad1216fede00ecc61056c9be0d957
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "I don't like it when you can't tell if it's a man or a woman."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 186975ae0e71893d3d61d21168746ec5
msgctxt "speaker:Hugh"
msgid "I don't like to chase my money."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a24171a5f306f77346e0cb2b17aba403
