msgid "I was just snatching wallet after wallet, and nobody seemed to care..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 56ab48c1cec5eab09518df0f47facb68
msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "I was just talking."
msgstr ""

#. uid: be1fad2e5371b84714d6c979fb16d903
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "I was just teasing you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: abc34a714b5e5a898a4e912f134778be
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "I was just telling my new friend here that everything is going to be okay."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 290d3933aa929e0ac51b15f537166935
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "I was just telling your brother how your father has left a void that can't ever be filled. But, alas, we must try."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 50499062c497a63b9ceab2830f468070
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "I was just waving my hands like I was silly, but then it just clicked!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: e002d295763ff23e255687026bf9a132
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was just..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e674301b91047ca5b06aca503874f572
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was just...daydreaming, I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 55298623a7f98eaabd10c47a19a35657
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was just...thinking out loud."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a83e4450544c7d5a32201615bebcfee6
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "I was kind for takin the both of you on my ship, and for my kindness I get you sneakin about tryin to steal from me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 955a64485744316d494b05248cd51c00
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "I was looking all over for you last night."
msgstr ""

#. uid: dd834f14ee3c168ae9abc686d6bbfc55
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "I was looking for a copy of 'The Desert Blooms'..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: bd93d60c672ff06670ae2e019490803b
msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "I was lucky enough to be born without having to worry about things like that."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f17a3cc952221874c3af8c038cdd10d1
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "I was lying on the ground...when I lost consciousness, I have no idea..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2549bd8f04c5f5fe9c5d6589084474b8
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was lying, you idiot."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1d2837ba9ab707865a0cdbe1f3548820
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "I was merely seeking to meet your new friend."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7e9e9565b5a08c94e34dd903f36a05d9
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "I was most pleased when I received the news of you accepting my invitation to the Union Council."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a3a68bba4d2c0443978c5692d3e8daf5
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was once invited to study magic..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 52861c7f064159a1d9f63a1a306c6d06
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was only joking Marion, we know what you and your family means to this country."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3624f758e761a5b79cd4dd0592e94b99
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "I was only joking but if you're serious..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: be24271c2c6b7e27bdc71ceeb4317ff3
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was only wondering."
msgstr ""

#. uid: db3dd90d1b951114514face63dfd8903
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was out at sea all day. Then a long meeting. Can you blame me?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6d48d28c3eab2649631a5047c37d6661
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "I was out there, in the eastern district, with King Orwell. I saw no tribesmen, only farmers driving one another wild with conspiracy."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ec63bee6b090e4b8664ef657a638c103
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was planning to walk a bit further up ahead, but I got scared. I didn't want to walk out of sight from the camp."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 167d8245118e7063a229eb4a607ffa26
msgctxt "speaker:Marshal Edmond"
msgid "I was playing it out as I understood it from the reports. Though I understand it was your brother who brought victory that day."
msgstr ""

#. uid: de8ffea32ababcbf6294ae74e9e354a8
msgctxt "speaker:Shah Mahda"
msgid "I was promised the support of your order, and all they send is you and this child!?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 10c9ddedaadecdb2f222af59f1711125
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "I was rolling around in my own bed all night."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 26b405f895178bfe5c0fd2cfda5f5dc3
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was sad when I didn't see you after...but I understand."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 463fa6029b39edf0f3f864aa63ca99c5
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "I was sayin you ain't as smart as old Captain Belmont."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 40bb5b76ed885dc4d747fb32e96ce8ff
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was shocked too when you walked in, but I think I'm happy you're here."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4e03e4a28bf2da69af344d5663f5673f
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "I was simply hoping that..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: effbbd33243417d066a73fb6a02ad40b
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "I was simply speaking from the heart."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2ab06ac9d7ab345ca09060a193df11e3
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was so careful with him, that when he started to squirm, I could barely hold onto him."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b9854cf79e131942123d320d80127f1b
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was so desperate to learn from you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: da002921e1e5556b0ce26cf7f1f9d7ab
msgctxt "speaker:Ayaka"
msgid "I was so scared to tell him, when I first realized. Scared he would be angry with him."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3f956ae1796df2d0e82d22cee00f16c5
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "I was so scared. I really thought when he got that close to you that it was over..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f0d5cf0669ce8a258a6ddc403b53ae41
msgctxt "speaker:Ephraim"
msgid "I was so scared...Sarah"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 655e311bafe561107d545bbf878e4eda
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was so small when Thomas was born, but I remember getting really angry that he wasn't a little sister."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 74dcaac557f13c9ff4cc8423636a5657
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was so unsure about...everything back then."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 39f5d5cd4a2b9bbca5c67cae23afe02e
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "I was startin to forget why I bothered to save you...now I remember."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 49e07afade54eafa227a33e2df339853
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "I was starting to get worried you had gotten lost in the hay somewhere with a stranger."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7753e79f6a14b6b47d6b14561ede4574
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "I was starting to worry you didn't remember me!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0ab6798fd858837c57d71559e9feef97
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "I was still in the capital of Rahayal. That city has more spies and wandering eyes than any other in the world."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5b8c63b209d6529af25a6a6ad63144b9
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "I was still up, studying, when suddenly I heard your scream. I rushed outside and I found you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 690bd91df9aff7b7bc2d169366b01fca
msgctxt "speaker:Hecate"
msgid "I was sure that you'd be dead. You were too far for me to protect you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e5483ad977a55d6e0bbd8013ea34c483
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "I was sweating. Disgusting. Starving."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7a4ada9656fed43ce9b7680880b3c86e
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "I was sworn to maintain complete secrecy, even from my own commanders. I'm telling you, first chance I had."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 822bbc17b3a1ee9d35e31221af8c53c9
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "I was talkin to ya."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1ad04cdae2aca44d8c9d000a9678d81f
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "I was talking about our history together, Blondie. Don't be impolite by ignoring me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8331af80a6625e46a223845a5789f9d8
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was talking to my father."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a639756a536dc8f0efbcc6a570260fe4
msgctxt "speaker:Dalia"
msgid "I was the best, most advanced student in my year."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8ef4d7345d9eb486410f4d7db5051737
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was the one who told the captain what you were doing."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c48aabd7f4ce915a554ae14cbb7c4d42
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was the princess of Rosanna..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c4382e7679c8d72b1c99553632704f31
msgctxt "speaker:Oryon"
msgid "I was there when the first Empire ruled, and I lived through the greatest Era our species had ever seen."
msgstr ""

#. uid: dde8d8825e5256efd515787e3767539b
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was there, and I'm not leaving your side. Ever."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b63cf611eda8c905e881b924cd316885
msgctxt "menu"
msgid "I was thinking I might stay"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8be16ea292b61cd5f36d58d5e9b5b928
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was thinking we could use the money to maybe move up a bit."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c0b2f191cf223568361a3e3db77c22a7
msgctxt "speaker:Thomas"
msgid "I was thinking, on account of Dad not being around anymore...I figured..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5988c732a42d950563412ed2acdb4f66
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was thinking...maybe I could stay."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8a3be694ef099eca5e744947b31c12e8
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was thinking...maybe you could train me?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: a1bb4586183f0f256a73a776ea6312de
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was tired, sorry if I left you alone up there."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0658a2676b30214b9f076602daca2bd2
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was told people in small towns have better manners than big city types."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 31a757c9e6881d820e34ce2f75b0a07c
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was told you were such an amusing person. Always up for a feast, a party, a joke."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a62a36d3184f1d8295a00a9a99331c32
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was told...enough."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2c8e43c2fd29bb38773e3eeaeb652e57
msgctxt "speaker:Dalia"
msgid "I was too comfortable in the bed, so I told him no."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c26dd81ade4e63aad0ba28e43be93de6
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was too scared of you tell you back then..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2baa493dd1483c9c758ddfb87c492f8e
msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "I was trained from a young age in martial combat. I know how to wield a sword. Please allow me to server your family as the rest of my clan failed to do."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e1cd45ee8b61b37357cc275f435853bd
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "I was up for a while and then...well then I wasn't."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e9e0635be8dc35b65c2181678b074340
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was watching you train."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1cfe037e56cf72c7dab7b7ec634f3e60
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was weak then...that was my mistake."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 212a772b6f3f549ffd5fdf1dad004341
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was wondering if perhaps...there was something to be done about...this?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 874d5fa40a20838b616f0aaa48442fac
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "I was wondering where you were."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 28085132ad82f5588241ebb02534134d
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "I was worried you might have been too tired. It was a pretty exhausting day."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 639dcae20b895ebca84a360758b80f47
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was yours...you could have taken me any time you wanted."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c1756791f3caad91c3031203cfa0f3d9
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was, yeah. Before he passed."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 017d42ddad5202281ebffb04ac82f58a
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "I was...I mean, I was still drinking, but I hadn't...not like this..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8b4468008eed8edbfdebb32c900d96f4
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was...I was leaving Lethram. I'm heading out down the road to find...a place that I can stay."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4c6e9e0d09b2271b8806b4dba7afc847
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was...I was trying to sleep here, in the alley, but he threatend me, and he tried to attack me. He said it was his alley, I didn't know..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: eee91ed09987fb1f794e69553d787f01
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was...running...please...I'll leave..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8e7016f879ab363d11c44cde057f28f3
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I wasn't asking if you wanted to sleep with him."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 735afa5d3001ee77765c0cb505821610
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "I wasn't asking you, I was asking the lady."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ddd13f8c00e0da8f4864d7b3c02d680b
msgctxt "speaker:Dalia"
msgid "I wasn't born in this world, I ended up here the same way you did I imagine."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5b720f09344828f679eb635ab3e674a2
msgctxt "speaker:Sophia"
msgid "I wasn't even special within our clan."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9fcd122300c790d4e278b4e8ff5f4bad
msgctxt "speaker:Soldier"
msgid "I wasn't negotiating. Strip!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 446d3ab886ad767cca1409977aebb682
msgctxt "speaker:Hugh"
msgid "I wasn't talkin to you, imbecile. I was talkin to your useless limp dicked boyfriend over there."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0c1bae07af66a0912fffdb8257f49c4a
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I wasn't thinking that."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ce3f6d6f0a9d9951423322c0f05ecece
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I wasn't!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: cd99d65c8d6a831058479e4a699a82bf
msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "I waste enough time on that shit when we're actually marching."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b807f30696a870e22dda98a255695333
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "I watched this country nearly ripped apart when these fools couldn't figure out who should sit on the throne."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 099bf5aa9f913c7e82289b62043fe3b4
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "I weep for you, Sarah saw him mouthing."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7a0522b05fcf5ac39a422acb79ce7519
msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "I went looking for her, but she had gotten lost off the path as well. It was more than a week before I found her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4cb567c79cef57b95bac063f1702ae84
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "I went out and I set things right."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f48eb4fb335f8bdd64e90dc37e33a54c
msgctxt "speaker:Dalia"
msgid "I went through every book I could get my hands on."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3615dcbc859d145c24eecff0faf0feda
msgctxt "speaker:Hassar"
msgid "I went to look for you, but none of the others had seen you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5594314f66871d3ebf42d71affe835f6
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "I went to my chieftain, and demanded he declare a blood feud between me and this orc, so that I might be allowed to kill him on sight."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c071f02f17dc56be95b1de410fda1873
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "I whisper to myself, be quiet, be quiet, do not wake her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 80c6cf125a9d3eb80e0d8d2240966775
msgctxt "speaker:Master"
msgid "I wil show you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2d32ec14d215ce9e44ce817b3799c89a
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will always have a home."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9b0f1d5d6e41d12852db5078fc5cad9b
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will ask the quartermaster to give you any medicines you might need for the girl's recovery."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 34a585d8c9ec1379ff188862d241e9c6
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "I will ask you in time, and when I ask, you vow to submit. That promise will be enough for me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ae13bc903a58db933229d84bb06c785c
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will ask you one final time..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a23eeb616ff5fb2dd7aa2ef48c7b38e4
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will attend the Union Council."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8949a30474a8f8e321ca3a587eb02a5e
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "I will be back tonight."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cfe21080f0355d135e43678e151449a4
msgctxt "speaker:Gilead"
msgid "I will be brief with you, Sarah. I can offer you either punishment for your actions, or..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4ed03bb77f51b3caefa9ea29148cf987
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will be fine on my own."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 01224672ad3c04b1f3e91daf143bbe7c
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "I will be fine. It is you they hunt."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f1a87e8dd763db37a010a9ecf69040b2
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will be happy to meet with all of them."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 03ddbea377b2eb204b3ec39ee193aadd
msgctxt "speaker:Hassar"
msgid "I will be in Naydeen's quarters, should you have need of me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 692970ec788e2be41a4018db09724eae
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "I will be the High Queen of the Union."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4f304a794a2522a5f342bfee019e28a0
msgctxt "speaker:Marshal Edmond"
msgid "I will begin my rule of the Union as a most forgiving Leader."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 10b9010c315451a226ccca1abeaf6345
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "I will build a mountain from their heads. Offer up their gutted hearts."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 99f993e2e4f4586d4a17212cc224468f
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will come back to you. All of you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8afc69080d882b410775933c607a1760
msgctxt "speaker:Emmissary"
msgid "I will deliver your message back to him."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d7e9f30bfa6b72bae0112c6f73b9411e
msgctxt "speaker:Master"
msgid "I will enjoy you, pet."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 01536220e61f42d4da0a11a61ec67a0f
msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
msgid "I will get some more wood for the fire, before it goes out."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 729e0dbf5ec8978e91fb2da435e54dcc
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will give Vaelen the true stone, just as I promised him."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7671795e2abf04fb0d2a480289ea8a09
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will give myself..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 594d50d5006473614e1c7a5fd2ecd616
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "I will give you my vote on this matter, and you will...pray not speak of this matter to your husband."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 716a4231fc53d14c661a4055f20f1a1a
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will gladly accept."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 799c01d6fdfc4b505481de0e573a16bd
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "I will go and get some dinner myself."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 78349436cb9f99151a113f021cda75de
msgctxt "speaker:Kamal"
msgid "I will go far into the desert and I will tell everyone who will hear of your victory!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5f69ca51f94aa51b590cbd8007e5e742
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will go speak to him, captain!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: edba1fc45593ff98fe9a310c71244e07
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will go to Rahayal."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b8e920fb3fd799280e2388a74262fc17
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will go. The discussion is settled."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3f694695f55e42ee5d44a5e6a2a22601
msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "I will grow my lands..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 78517a40b0c26fd4a620af25fd8f1073
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will have a small army to keep me safe."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0006172334cbb39dbc757f7ef8400f9c
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will have to consider this."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 934d3b2a9167d77e166d7d9bca899a15
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will help you get your freedom, if that is what you want. I'll offer you up my body every night. Tell me, and it will be yours."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6d05bf591e246b12c3507da8a66ea01b
msgctxt "speaker:Advisor"
msgid "I will instruct the Headmaster to make preparations at once."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5f1d59beb1217d827d415815c79c6f80
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "I will instruct the guards to let you pass, and you are free to go. However, you are not free to stay here."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f495f28af0e13b56bb3896d486f1260a
msgctxt "menu"
msgid "I will join the Brothers of Providence and reclaim Rosanna."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f495f28af0e13b56bb3896d486f1260a
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will join the Brothers of Providence and reclaim Rosanna."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e2bf3c0ff9297ac76eadd2464aeb4a0c
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will leave soon, and I will not be back for many weeks."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7714bb5c54d05cf19e35891cfa23c459
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will listen...I will listen to your advice!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5d9f0d150bfe51e451a08e3588230fe5
msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "I will make a proper woman of her, and then I will go out to town and find you a proper wife, Marius. It's time."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d581884411ab79dfe43a9ffd9282b70f
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "I will make no apologies for seeking to rid myself of his horrid presence."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9e03f4f2d21a1e0259dd5b278c056863
msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "I will make things right."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 38410038817c4f71e44ca986b1ee2a23
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will make you and all your men rich. Ride back off into the desert and spend your money as you please."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 76f2188c24091a510011ae5413455c00
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will marry you..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 640d5763b40cfa51b9f8197f4ff94087
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will meet with him, but no more than that."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 45266fc8f775d0ed754c7bda89e1fe32
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "I will move heaven and earth, lady Sarah."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0581ef1de03aee2ad9282f28f196753d
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will need allies where I'm going. People that I can trust. I have some of them, but I will need far more."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3c5e4c295450796a400ac0f40207bb05
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "I will not be made a fool in this marriage."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 03742b2c660a6e6120b146f94c3e1425
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will not be some soft queen who will bend to the whims of advisors, or who lives for politics."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 700f3c4d0001a31e8073417a04837a14
msgctxt "speaker:Gilead"
msgid "I will not beg you to grant you a gift, Sarah."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3a9eed2cd6f377924f825fcddc3ecf92
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "I will not force your hand on the matter of Gilead, though I will advise you that I believe we will need his Legions."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 56ac5e01d81de4a1322776bbf7f09199
msgctxt "speaker:Marshal Edmond"
msgid "I will not have my honour questioned by some a man who would sell his wife for a sack of gold!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: bffbcdd3834b97a5f79883ffd139cfde
msgctxt "speaker:Master"
msgid "I will not keep teaching you forever. Address me as you must, or you will suffer far worse."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a126f3361a9840081ed3ebaa543595eb
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will not return to Rosanna."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3456c103ae2228c8c64c24cda2aa7e9b
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will not return. Not with your legions, or any army."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 69a41e72ec694d53dc98a4cb414a4d17
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will not spill all that blood, only to replace one yoke for another."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6be02e66a31fddda345774667d15d0b6
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will pledge that I will give you my support, if in turn you give me yours."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a3c15aa03e639f6a523c685436a4d770
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "I will practice with you. When the times comes, you will be ready, trust me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 231661a98b2ece111283719d8743eeda
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will put this country back together, Varga."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 95eb814e9e9239cf59dd3853ca55ca77
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "I will require convincing."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 452ecd27aa7e0b735f30b8bac896a396
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will return to Rosanna, but it will be on my own account!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 83a631075448c2459513c50a05d19622
msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "I will see what I can do when I get you to the cart, but there are too many people here, Sarah. I can't treat you as anything other than a slave."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 62415142079d3c42e4c67b6ce253ef47
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "I will set up in camp, but I promise I will be back soon."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f9f97065a93c512c4d292d86a1f91385
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will settle your debts and you will offer me up your vote."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1f5c7da3e1b3ad40b15da233b8d3b662
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "I will sign the order, in my name. There won't be a soldier in the camp that will disobey such a direct order."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a7e930674e1e04d52d0fc877f3b15ffc
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "I will speak only truth from now on, Sarah. I will admit to my deceit, and ask for your forgiveness."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 79b1b351cee68c35a9150480952789c0
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will stay here, even if it means risking my life."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8f3bdfe7c5efe955e465a915b5774342
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will stay. At the very least to hear you all out. Discuss. See more of this evidence."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6c25ed4381945c06cf31e4833faee2b0
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "I will still counter your vote with my own."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d379641ffb3d9744bf561957afe14d18
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "I will support the proposal to unify the armies."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 18eee6238c3a10dab51e99e53191aedb
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "I will support your proposal in rejecting a unified army."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2db7a6b92b7baae4c92f7fd8c19f9c15
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "I will swear my loyalty to you, but I cannot stay here. I must protect your virtue."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e534feafc66088192d4cc5b702188be9
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will take back my country, yes, but I will change it also."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2791c52c1cd4878859de219743621694
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will take counsel from those I trust, such as yourself, and I will ignore those who make poor advisors..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3ec232e17915eafc26e2c7c9bb083b36
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will take it as a compliment."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 96c6b2c49927e71709fa0886235c1187
msgctxt "speaker:Kamal"
msgid "I will take what is left of my men and I will leave your lands!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: dd9d5fbd1fd5ece7280cd5ac90f45730
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "I will take what you said into consideration, Sarah, thank you for speaking to me. It really does mean a lot to me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9cff712348c5adf196e13a58139a4a3b
msgctxt "speaker:Naydeen"
msgid "I will take you as the men of the desert do."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d2226863974a22343928692460823b5a
msgctxt "speaker:Daemon"
msgid "I will take you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e3b080cfc12922381ce9c03f4d07fc4e
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will take your offer."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f3c776a0776e577d16034228483e57d8
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "I will teach you what to say and what to do. Would you like that?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: ce513a97cbe7a73e653dde8fbde1258b
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will tell Thomas what you have done..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 11e65300813002eaa0e0a51de294c3f5
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will tell her...I will tell Carolyn that I won't take you as a slave."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fcb7688467dd37a1aa3a2af852eaf1b9
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will tell him everything."
msgstr ""

#. uid: adf84110aa792e5f209ab569687a174e
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will tell him."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3c102a00133fd8806dcd8b7ff5ee96aa
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "I will tell you everything, girl."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ef532fdd52d166b16a6d1f2fd498207f
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "I will tell you, promise on the souls of my family."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1e77f69cbe129f26f9b363d8b2e66ff7
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will travel to Rahayal and...I do not yet know exactly what my future holds, only that there will be many dangers."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4479643dd1207ffbfffba2191ee7c0fa
msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "I will try to be as kind to you as I can be, but you and your people have been conquered by Hassar."
msgstr ""

#. uid: eb7df46af2751269ce7888b6ed1cc784
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "I will turn you into a soldier."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2aaf58e993a77785956ef6e012a342bd
msgctxt "speaker:Marshal Edmond"
msgid "I will vote with you on the matter."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f74f40f6d28ac77b858bf04c33544486
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will vow that I will carry out this duty to the best of my ability."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0044d3c44c0d9aa8ae66f67d6a5d1ef5
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will vow that I will use my army to put down any noble uprisings in your country."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9b59c60699347b5659ac31b571e1e3ec
msgctxt "speaker:Voice"
msgid "I will wait for you by the dark fountain."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7f33b95d4cdf911607517d7a73ee830b
msgctxt "speaker:Hecate"
msgid "I will warn the others in the Order. It will be up to them to decide what to do next."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3b61226da46f6e2fda903ebf3a0a7dd9
msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "I will work again..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0b5023e95cde42713f04471924d9cc54
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will! Tomorrow, first thing!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4b0aa664498f0769c30058795e5655ca
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will, I promise."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c7440de6768198355a00ab7fa39680ef
msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "I will."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c7440de6768198355a00ab7fa39680ef
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cd5150cca3653c31ddea01d62c9522ee
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will. I promise I'll do better."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ecf7dc122ff5bf373fd049d606b3f739
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will. Thank you for the opportunity!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7721a188cd9ca1c48e53d75f92b7e20f
msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "I will..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 869f51da9afdf748f014342077153f6f
msgctxt "speaker:Dalia"
msgid "I will...I will do my part..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1ac21ffc0d936ffc687ba8788a39d2b8
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I will...I will..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cfefe9602630142359138d312c49214c
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "I win."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ad0f744434679fe76c51467a704d8ba9
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "I win…told you I’m no liar."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2f1f7ce615cd5d7611f452a87e03363d
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "I wish I could be more optimistic, but the truth is, what happens to Thomas depends on how desperate Marion will get."
msgstr ""

#. uid: dc2ab25026795d52432d73a33ab4f1be
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "I wish I could have met her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4174e1ac2fb7c2071bd6c1cac614aa4d
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "I wish I could have seen it..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 16eb214317ede4460485b03573c771dc
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I wish I could offer you more help, but my army is on the road to Lethram and then on to Rahayal."
msgstr ""

#. uid: be2be697ee1620bd2521f20d63c98442
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "I wish I could stay longer."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4842f3284826dab5ede427ff71901cc6
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I wish I had known that you met with my father."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 29ccad4fc8dc7213bb7c07acb49e4a4b
msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "I wish I knew."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a8d5ae46adf71c2e8c5ad13583f5c096
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "I wish I knew. All I know is that some wounds don't heal, and some thoughts can't be undone."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0554289f34313258790d7868abc4e47f
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I wish I'd fought harder to find you when you left."
msgstr ""

#. uid: bc46d29118889d4bf4d5c46037c035ec
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "I wish all my commanders were as reliable as you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ebdb4259c03a48d767727923844e1ecb
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "I wish it could be like that..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 10bacdecf282d3f50b9536e0449b9422
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I wish it was that simple."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 161c567ed54d70d87ddb32704fa48efa
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "I wish that I could speak more to you, but I find these days that most everyone in the Order has become a gossip."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ebcf59f552d03942e25fba00f3c84e76
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "I wish that could be the solution, but this brings me to the final discovery made by my spies."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c162fad5f66b3d006201c053bcbb70e5
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I wish that was the case. That's what I thought growing up, that Father could do whatever he wanted."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c91c377a8693e06ec9ce9350f8370ce9
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I wish there was something we could do for you. We can share any medical supplies you might need from our transport wagons."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5b58a2901ee485ecc73c6ccbd48223d1
msgctxt "speaker:Dio"
msgid "I wish to fly as well."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 68ccfcdd41e13c71203e01bd002736e9
msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "I wish we had more time."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ebf131a4248c0e906e3e6e3b96758906
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "I wish you could see how I see you. How all these people see you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8d1092e2d3f9fabfe2199e2ad9e2d30a
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I wish you had...some nights."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1adeb9ea9c128dfc2b0c0d8ed06fc3c7
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I wished the voice in my head sounded more like yours."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 73379596b11ee1ae580a3a3e09403168
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "I woke up the next day with bruises all over my body. Skin as purple as grapes."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e7f0a85aace012116705d9b03fe04d2b
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I woke up to the sunrise and I decided to climb up to this hill to get a better view."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d48f34a0cbb9ef48ab5318106b1b0500
msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
msgid "I won in your name, and only in fighting for one as valiant as you, could I have gathered the strength and courage to win."
msgstr ""

#. uid: da88bb7d5265197e57094c190c8f5045
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "I won't accept serving under this man."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0bd69b85b6668880fb73c84e979c0c9f
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "I won't ask her to come up here and give a speech, I know she's not much for that, but I just wanted everyone to remember our hero!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0c9abbfb447de1c8d3fe074081781788
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I won't be able to sleep at all; I'm too scared."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c06d550e10746ca11e4cbdb54351e191
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I won't be your assassin."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1713a1c1242afe066102cd3dc66f3564
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "I won't bore you too much, but the empire is dynamic in its differing goals."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7de8f5a6ec5a9d58fde73b9837fbee94
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "I won't call you girly or slut or whatever..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f5de003fe08141e8fe76f12141ed9cbc
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I won't deny that I liked it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f236002a848f384ba7b34290fe3b4e15
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "I won't disagree that this magic is dangerous. I just don't agree that it is uniquely dangerous."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 37fe7354bd38da659d3fa3fb8057b158
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I won't do it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 412810995765952b12ca847ac14bd240
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "I won't drag you along. The training will be brutal. If you falter, that will be your fault."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1b9d978fa34fe9baedce790602302e73
msgctxt "speaker:Hassar"
msgid "I won't hurt you, do you understand?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 15ce3dbbce737df96a780e67c1ea02c3
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I won't leave...I just wanted to know."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c93a557f2baf11d9a54c9c615a185a0d
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I won't let that happen again."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 01082256c17a60f23ac9a175ac208e33
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I won't let you down, Master Gilead."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e6cbeccec61828a58b4f9247fdea2c9b
msgctxt "speaker:Naydeen"
msgid "I won't lie and say that's not part of it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3e050b071dddd7be75993b7308e30725
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "I won't lie to you, you're a beautiful woman and I'm sure you've heard that plenty in your life."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9f5f066d7d4908d0ae20f33e0e388f67
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "I won't lie, blondie. This started as a bit of fun for me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: aef214ab26c93beb9cab276e5eca0c40
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "I won't lie. Does it upset you, knowing that?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5fae7b7465d397030499d858a6594d6a
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I won't lie..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 97ce665080518792de3ceb8e3a7cb69b
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I won't make that mistake again."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3c187c6646b4f9aaa720f2cbf7150256
msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "I won't make you suffer that."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0c4fd167226ff4ad15ae6acb8d116aec
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "I won't need to sit here and have my loyalty questioned by some usurper."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5299f159fb7ea76e2d888bc6cb5531b0
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "I won't pretend I don't care about coin, but a fucker like Hugh is obsessed with it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a8c01c6b9eff267480cda16fce7bf8f5
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "I won't pretend that I'm never sad."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f5ef6b0185229d7be855249955cc22c9
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I won't pretend that this will be easy...Rosanna is a different place, you're right."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e732a5a6d523ffc00a7103e482cd1015
msgctxt "speaker:Sophia"
msgid "I won't pretend to be an idiot, I know most men think I'm beautiful."
msgstr ""

#. uid: add2734c1a5270361fb449ecc1816454
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "I won't pretend to be the fool."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8305fe8f3389e776202cdf151a4ed4d7
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I won't pretend your life was easy, but mine hasn't been easy either."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3eca53502a139a2264c5ade288a5927f
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I won't say anything."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f9470fd31745fbe9611e722861e718e1
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "I won't spend the rest of my life in a dungeon..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 454d3de1610bbf3d623ae36f4c46d220
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "I won't surrender...I can't..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7283147436e9bc6420b7e0d84dff796e
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "I won't take a vow of celibacy though."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 102aeea70f060012c868d9e0cb45792c
msgctxt "menu"
msgid "I won't tell Marius anything"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 992862baf67beeeb1ae0fa0e51277202
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I won't walk away."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 22a8fda9e200b5673f17081fa84f2800
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "I won't warn you again, let go of her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2a46db473dedde66ba30a336cde464c3
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I won't! I won't! Please..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2b8d0c7410c9394f1777c6610dcf7182
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I wonder if Marion knows how much suffering he's causing."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cf9300f614139e09340ba8ee0befb135
msgctxt "speaker:Sophia"
msgid "I wondered about it when I first got here."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 79a378bdd5be832679bd944cb3f30ad9
msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
msgid "I wondered where you might be."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b05c52bd53c531919a1ded4315cd7c73
msgctxt "speaker:Young woman"
msgid "I worked down south in a laundry crew till they fired people cause of end o season."
msgstr ""

#. uid: bd54da08801281b85dd9c6eb81e227b8
msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "I worried for the girl and so I went to see if she was alright."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 840f19ba28f4f9f9be183dba3be1aa2c
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "I worry about that all the time...but no, you're tough."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cdd0a68ddc4121eb4d619a0b2b1b8ac2
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "I worry that you will win."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 212627c8842a00d4f1d7cdf92d2f374f
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "I would ask no more of you, princess Sarah."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a35842105a6aa110ba89fa568595e163
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "I would be forever grateful to put this matter to rest."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e9c813dee67d63b5d663465f34b1f4b8
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "I would burn half my country if I could make a decent enough coin off it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d68cff13e10782ed3d64e16e18dff34e
msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "I would change, but I would wake up having hurt nobody."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 57b290b6419b8410ad588bd3d1df4b08
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "I would enjoy seeing that."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d4bce14b82e69630112bbc0775c98bd1
msgctxt "speaker:Gilead"
msgid "I would expect consideration in return for my support."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cadb7c54666bab6b65ddd346c48b38dd
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I would expect nothing less of my Warmster."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b008564ce6afef8e8237ca4c9a63931d
msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "I would give everything to get back what I once had."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d2a29a054bf5ae3e485765dc52f92ee2
msgctxt "speaker:Gilead"
msgid "I would gladly wish to hear more."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a93d9294079648fe12ea8ae4594d5cf6
msgctxt "speaker:Marshal Edmond"
msgid "I would hate if I had done anything to even give life to a seed of it by keeping you here so long."
msgstr ""

#. uid: af4083744fa715372be69b02615cf39f
msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "I would have done it myself, but all this disaster has found its root in my suicide."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 610c00336674cf13aa482154114b055b
