msgid "Kate was almost out of breath."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 53b8c99634fb5f477f8b25302eb4ad16
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate was also a woman, same as Sarah. She concluded that it would probably be best to have a mentor who understood what it was like to train for the exam as a woman."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b3e75ee6769ded20305efea8b313faa6
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate was blunt, but honest."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2c90636034c74d9c442d30c9a3597ea7
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate was clearly unhappy at being ordered around so directly."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9ffc30ad390d97b065d25963ee0945ec
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate was direct. She wasn't making idle threats."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4df08f6f1ec51300bfd488d9d8fe863a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate was going to keep coming for her, she'd have to try and be faster than her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e1489242dd62128dcc019291c4691ad3
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate was hesitant with her words."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6be5b242f53393c252b0bb55edc179af
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate was looking into her eyes, as she continued to slowly finger Sarah."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3370a816ebf0e6477f657aec66a477db
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate was losing sight of her own strengths, instead hoping to overpower Sarah."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 29292ea8330ba4b5347afd7d91c11b85
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate was lying on the other bed below deck. Kate had talked so much about Lethram, and the mercenary company, that by now, they had ran out of things to say."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e8a058bd5ac1b032a7bbb975a084fe88
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate was nearly screaming."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 740317ac7ed7268da19416e398b06561
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate was not going to let up, she was keeping the pressure on her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 378ccaaef9b4b65cbdc5497c594bd101
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate was silent for a moment, then she reached over and grabbed Sarah's hand."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b7a916336df6caaa1031f36718de9656
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate was sitting, slouched up against a wall. Her head slightly hanging to her side."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9bc9e874af0ab3b0d8217ee27822019f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate was smiling."
msgstr ""

#. uid: af2033b48ad9c75ee56f2b96d856794b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate was speaking in between heavy breaths."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0b22f39f038be675a52831c7e7d891c8
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate was standing next to an arch that nearly rose up as high as the ceilings."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 303a9329228d8150133251e7b7d45f19
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate was still the better fighter, but it came as a surprise to both of them how close in skill they now were."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8f7f2364ad5fb503922ed4cc26d765c9
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate was the first to regain her strength."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b8dd848163ff2686354b03c6a64f510d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate was too skilled, and so Sarah did not even attempt to resist her cries of pleasure."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ddc4517b064b30e5dba763661f9153f9
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate was, despite everything, her only true friend here."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 02be481832533f8be2399484ff4390ca
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate waved as she began to walk away, heading towards the showers."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6a33fcff5645ee9c911c11805dcc15ac
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate waved as she walked away, and Sarah waved back at her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8ab9b0d212daf3c3733cdb6bcb45efbc
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate waved before leaving, then turned and strode out the tent."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d8336ac73e480069dd00fdc5e1d03b2c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate waved her hand about."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f17c5f58e49fa94abab9cdaa416e1eb8
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate waved her hand."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cf3cb97502dc3446373894f5bc2c941c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate whispered to Sarah."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f1186e3726136817a3c386486dbcf79a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate whistled as she looked around the room."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5a30bdeb87100929df55f59204784aa2
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate winked and took off down the hallway, leaving Sarah behind."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3f7b4e94d42fcda1b2b5d54023f60f65
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate winked and took off down the hallway."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e59983c824b5e517161cf84a5d43f4a4
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate winked at Sarah."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5c41bdd065b5c8dc8aafb86ec135f613
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate wiped away some of the tears on her face. Tried grounding herself again."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 822acb1c28f32ec53285080b2dfec140
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate wiped away the tears and nodded."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3c34b988a4edf460487b5a484f80b139
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate wrapped her hands around Sarah's waist and pulled her closer."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 27930fb16b98663985cf1456e0efd030
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Kate!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 27930fb16b98663985cf1456e0efd030
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Kate!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: c42f6f807fffbe4439f42c9de513e326
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Kate! Are you-"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 848c47a04db5d8cd3055572f67aaa744
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Kate! You scared me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8a572856f8a35c9cbab4bf690a1b2ef9
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Kate!!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 424ad0b045ff233f4b2c9bfc18bbe754
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate's chestpiece clattered agains the floor, leaving her mostly naked."
msgstr ""

#. uid: add8aec9e4a0e69a3c665c69654d4494
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate's eyes glimmered with tears."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 97b068b5c407f6933b272f834e04eafb
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate's eyes had begun to well up."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3f7805d3c9211eba6157a5b0e5562f35
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate's eyes scanned the crowd, searching for Atilla, but she could not find him."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e978eeb7331ba2befc288be32254c793
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate's eyes welled up again, but these were tears of pure ecstasy."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7b310ae464aa4003bdf218fefa5c8795
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate's eyes went up and down Sarah's body."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2bf3a34935a56c55752410a9213271df
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate's eyes were locked on the ground."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fbe76a74a2d76735ed172556e0788b66
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate's face turned sour."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b577f0398d6ede09772d07bde395f43e
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate's grip on her hair, twisting her body around."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 390e3d701d7127002a9ef16d384550ee
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate's hands began to slide down Sarah's sides, slowly going lower."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 197d222031d546c8c60d76fa5a46e6cb
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate's hands came up to her faces, gently wiping away the tears."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2f2892df4407bab7eb6baf14e54adabe
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate's hands easily found the various clasps, and pulled it off piece by piece with ease."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8ead67a53c9d2ad434959d30aa865d30
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate's hands reached up, covering her cheek. Her face was stunned disbelief."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5579add67c9f171741c8fd0e22f986f2
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate's life had been one of pain for most of it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 210559dd9a92b74ad080dedb60301b89
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate's moaning could now be heard everywhere in the room."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fe6d2aafe25cd8e88d859dee0c870bce
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate's shoulder connected with her own chest and Sarah felt the air knocked from her lungs."
msgstr ""

#. uid: aa39c9a07ac9e00a1fa097aeb9964cf4
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate's strong hand on her back kept her in place."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cb38b362e56587c4477cbcce2b225979
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate's style was graceful. There were none of the brutal hacks that Sarah expected, instead, Kate bend and turned her body to chain each strike with the next, almost performing a dance of sorts."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 140fec71a6561d9885fd1fd225b5f967
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate's voice faded as she looked out across the lake in the desert."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 54fffbec09b2cf64d769c665f75e0756
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate's voice had begun to pick up, full of excitement."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9f342a1289f6696143f340d55bb67348
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate's voice slurred."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 461e72d9c7e7778b9befd60566266985
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate's voice was soft and trembled."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2787866ae5642f0f9290b26caa01aa68
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate's voice wasn't serious at all."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7361ec853771070ba7825ea726b448dd
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate's voice went soft."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 806d2afdcdfd54917365b6473b234366
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate's voiced drifted."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 032a60881806e4314a3b7fa9f45c4abf
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate's words were infused with a soft kindness."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3469f17bf2577b5c927c22cacfd231f9
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Kate, I never wanted to be here in the first place."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 029e52c3b0a7c9290fd8a0a25338e84f
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Kate, I'm really tired, I don't know if tonight I can..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8c4aa5be8932011994e1de647a233f1b
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Kate, I-"
msgstr ""

#. uid: b9cc21786e9ee348a40e4a6212bb0c36
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Kate, I..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5899ab7b54dd9cdd0e37a7c73164b493
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate, again, seemed eager to please, her tongue reaching out in between Sarah's legs."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 740e41220f65ffbc44b6bc1beb97e126
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Kate, are you crazy? I almost had a heart attack!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 41a5371163d3ca17cfc4d2ba225d0b6d
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Kate, are you ok?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 358fbdb3a9433fbba4dfd60b1fc65535
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate, as if partially sobering up, suddenly looked at Sarah."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b03ce29d522d780acc7b0ca8e01b267c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate, embarassed, looked away."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9ef2a69d8d7324602af416e2f7c53054
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate, for her part, had known Sarah long enough to read her body."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ecb2bd6926094ab6f445389ca4031139
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate, for her part, moved swiftly down with Sarah, and kept fingering her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 49568f9e8b351d35047ede48bd947095
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate, for her part, took it as the latter."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 72a52d8a5b8771cb8a9f9c5d434f2a5a
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Kate, gather up some men and instruct them to gather up materials to build a barricade."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8f711f6c0ee52ee5580ba4319785b2f5
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate, knowing Sarah is close, keeps up."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 25488f0eab514078951ed85eeb591268
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate, quickly complies. Sarah feels nailed to the floor."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5ab6870cfbb1df60a2e03f35b02ce599
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate, realizing Sarah was not about to be able to get up, grabbed her under her arms and pulled her up."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4729391a278cab5e5e2baae2e2b45850
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate, seeing that her friend was starting to learn, decided to reward her by picking up the pace."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1b5238200c403f6ba5540001a05740c4
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate, too deep into her work, stops correcting Sarah."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8c6034a383a51dcb19643c484c1fc699
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Kate, we need to..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ce5ad220a0b9bbce71ee03e5bdafb0fb
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Kate, what are you-"
msgstr ""

#. uid: abc6b63777430609efa5e5ac3deadf3a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate, with frightened expression. Sarah knew she cared for herself, but also cared for Vaelen. For Kate, she stood to lose regardless."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 238d3d2ee0a2de55bb6fbee8f109a738
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate, with her head under the blankets and between Sarah's legs, is too busy to notice."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5daf156b76080a4f2ff7ca0ba15ffa87
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Kate, you know how..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e19bb3666576df44008a31808389565c
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Kate, you know that-"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6efa2e811e1a566cc528123d88067cde
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 372e8a54c7941b310a29a7f2b5d40560
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate. Of course."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0dbfa8b5fe84abd01fc9035e7904d794
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Kate..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0dbfa8b5fe84abd01fc9035e7904d794
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Kate..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e770a472175580e42c356bfa505449eb
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Kate...I understand why you did it...but the Tribesmen will be on alert now."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c4b2ddbb0c0a537bf3d2d228e6e7fe53
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Kate...I'm just so happy to see you again, and to know that you've been okay all these years."
msgstr ""

#. uid: db085e6254164370798652a4d20bdbd3
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Kate...did you..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 28bc38162b955ec291b88e78dccff79a
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Kate...do you think I'm ready? For the exam?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 99d6663b5cac8eaa6d81c245deac6fc0
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Kate...what happened in Ridgehaven?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 62348d26f2a0524fb6afe9095521f471
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Kate...you can tell me anything. What is it?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: d5089802bbea5c66e3cc12c8713db6cc
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Kate...you go around beating yourself, drinking yourself into a stupor, all for what?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 84352f9c960aec317a481dd695d2180a
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Kate...you shouldn't feel afraid of being sad."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b0fac5507abcdfdfbe74289932ba2aab
msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Keep Drinking"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9f5325300ed3702f9fac1e5c2ab3728b
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Keep a nice house. Bear my children. Raise them. Take care of me whenever I'm in port."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5c2e8b5e6ce10e133d74979bdce509d4
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Keep advancing down the hallway. The entrance to the western wing should be nearby."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 33ebcb9896d40705616e6d665e5edc20
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Keep advancing!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: fc42e200277d7fc557fcf433ed0f0136
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Keep all that sweet talk to yourself. Just show me by doing the work."
msgstr ""

#. uid: dfc72d21ed356f2ded21e0993cafc522
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "Keep asking questions, I like that about you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 27de42bfd035df217c7654fb9956270f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Keep breathing, she told herself, even as the cold advanced."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 92b93a9f7bf78b6c1fa42b6e064362aa
msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Keep defending against the orcs"
msgstr ""

#. uid: f3414e715b527779d8e04f0ff7b94acc
msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Keep drinking"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9d6966c5a0e11010bf13b28724849c25
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Keep firing until a breach opens up!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: bd81c21790801b9c260eed6fc9dc3fac
msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Keep going"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8e4f2ad3b48911cfd00d240b32714ec7
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "Keep going!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8e4f2ad3b48911cfd00d240b32714ec7
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Keep going!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: e4d73e83546d98f8ae927dda0b6a3e73
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Keep going."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6338704019cf9689165c502eb1413182
msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Keep guard"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 630584a7b4f7b3b2e0aa3acae9d0cd95
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Keep her safe."
msgstr ""

#. uid: db53613bdf0c8fe8020d3a81fe8f91c4
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Keep him in your mouth, she told herself. Stay in this moment, just a fraction longer."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 05ef449652d966a3dc9cd8fbe1d8d231
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "Keep it up."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9c332fcc3ae0aaae6cd0ee1fb055d6dc
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Keep it up. See what happens."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2feb0d116efcca55ad5c1a7e7da670c8
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Keep living as we did. Taking on contracts."
msgstr ""

#. uid: acc05e6ea5e5ca2c0aa71855931bbbc8
msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Keep looking"
msgstr ""

#. uid: f9781c7a3fb52ee3356561d280d305fa
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Keep me forever."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9959f2b24bb96972921df99b7138c58c
msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Keep on your armor"
msgstr ""

#. uid: ec7bc68574ba14ce3acb8e6ec658ffc8
msgctxt "speaker:Ephraim"
msgid "Keep pushing, the path to western wing should be close."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8d370aab0f7b7f071d24150eafe067d4
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Keep smiling."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 508dbbc8165517b24466f5035931f4c5
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "Keep stability."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fcc957f8aa012cb4c0581ad4fa241bfa
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Keep talking, and you can get another one."
msgstr ""

#. uid: bbff5c8c223fcf1a0f8ab9e4d680e902
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Keep telling yourself that if it makes you feel better. You liked it anyway. I know how you looked at me when you left my ship."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c8d66bb6a79adb9ecca5526e0cc9c0e7
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Keep that to myself."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e0b2f10e08316e60600d9a8a87aeba4e
msgctxt "speaker:Marshal Edmond"
msgid "Keep the fat blob in check and I'll still grant you my vote."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fe9addd2ba863358dad4db4c69b29d7d
msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Keep them as our hostages."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6ad9743263d987099f3a6633309f66bc
msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Keep things modest."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cbf567e031f4c9dde69d91ff84512693
msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "Keep those ropes straight!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9b3b7fd3c974ea243567a1c00f64bb28
msgctxt "speaker:Matthew"
msgid "Keep up and I'll show you your cell."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1bc822e7c5ba66be8d3a53e639cc92de
msgctxt "speaker:Jasmine"
msgid "Keep up."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1bc822e7c5ba66be8d3a53e639cc92de
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Keep up."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e209cdcededcc082e0bd77b2570b534d
msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "Keep up. Just a little way more."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cee70fa11bb091a35425b128687df243
msgctxt "speaker:Damian"
msgid "Keep your dress."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 05ac273978fbc151377457ff5a176629
msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "Keep your head down, do good work, and you'll be okay."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0559be622a494753a22ced0894b4480b
msgctxt "speaker:Naydeen"
msgid "Keep your head up, girl. Be strong. You can have a life here, one that is still filled with great things."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 68d746a80a74c1757da6de931e7a2fe1
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Keep your lies and your fake stone."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e764073ad9566d925593e50ba6c4e292
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Keep your little secrets, blondie. I'll pry them out of you one day."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 432ccb8c3f664f1d8ee24c716704aafa
msgctxt "speaker:Jasmine"
msgid "Keep your wits on you here, alright? Don't go day dreamin."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 096c90f0a14f20124d473fd8a1d6bc80
msgctxt "speaker:Ramsey"
msgid "Keepin a pretty lady around is good for business."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d3a648fe73cb44c07caf286369c69596
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Keeping an Inn up for such a time was no small feat."
msgstr ""

