#. uid: 7e65875589ab0175b6efc4c2a29d8eac
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew he had no more power in this place than her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 125ae2b7a0f9811771de354350813bb2
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew he struggled, and bore his advances no matter how frequent they became."
msgstr ""

#. uid: be747549ea9df03827161f9d1b104d23
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew he was right, even though she hated to admit it. She longed to just wrap him in her arms and trap him here all night."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2ca8f357a04e94d37945466234fc1c9c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew he was right."
msgstr ""

#. uid: dd9c83b6b8161c78d8d922414853e562
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew he wasn't serious, just as she knew she'd actually give it all up for him."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8f6c3b5623224779e2998b7687a4b0a6
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew her armor could be a pain to put on and off, but she also knew Kate was being more than friendly."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ff61fe775dc5284158433a2025324790
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew her father frequently visited the neighbouring countries. It had been part of the reason why peace had lasted as long as it did."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5c0fbcbfb9923c90ec237b93f6ac3c66
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew her only chance of ever getting out of these tunnels was to keep up with Vaelen."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7b5247024168703ce83b8e9c7c2d3f90
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew her only option was to play along. To finish what she'd agreed to."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1f08e9880091f8f581a6a082597f1a65
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew her own position. Firmly against."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 265dd814ee260a3f43fec89762aa317f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew her own position. Firmly in favor."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 858cd518c0f8a2472e2533603276da1b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew him and wasn't surprised to see him, Marion Achillea, from the Achillea family."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a50b1b6003528f3d047f3064417f3f92
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew how it felt."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c45348aa8b64873ec2d3969b8fddfb46
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew how soldiers and guards sounded, their harsh voices."
msgstr ""

#. uid: dda5cf7ad162ac76d81b591bb2af2cda
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew how strict the uniform was."
msgstr ""

#. uid: bff78d8bda9aafe7ad687c63c96bb5a2
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew in her heart that could be loyal to only the common folk."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 37b1da3a3c6457a7ec941b2f9fbb1d8a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew it as surely as she had ever known anything in her life. In her mind's eye, she could see it play out again and again."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6978aec827b21b994ae06029b788cedf
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew it could not be her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 84cf40d35ed3bad851b2cbb2d3f0cb60
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew it had been no idle fear. She had felt the same."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0da43de156fa9855e12c800a72946a8a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew it was Vaelen, but she could no longer recognize his face."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 65d0efc1fa57364efc26d2a4cfa5708d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew it was a risky proposition."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7caff219153e44bc1a25f26ec48e1856
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew it was true."
msgstr ""

#. uid: bd3fb3d25ce16bb11443e49fdc2091f2
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew it was true. She made him that very pledge."
msgstr ""

#. uid: efa6493a9e147447e0135e8f8fb1f8f3
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew it was wrong, or at least, she knew it only because she had been told as much all her life."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9c252f04f9fb2f8773cd4694e3de4f0d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew it was wrong."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 40c134bd8a33eaa948087c58063db67e
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew it wasn't a real offer...but even if it had been, she knew there was nothing in the world that would have made her say yes."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3f13f6d38c8af4ab86258d7700374c46
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew it would happen, and still found herself anxious."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b6fee4c42ab13725ed76ad88b68ef6e2
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew it wouldn't do her much good to be alone tonight."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ed96f39b5274c411ddb3334ede64f735
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew little of cooking, and less still of the cuisine of the tribesmen, but she learned as best she could."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0f47f2c4795837fce240630e48cea29b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew little of magic, or the relic, but even she could conclude that it confirmed Xan's suspicion."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 88b249413dce8df3191f5a43a1bc0e4f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew pressing further was pointless."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1618f30e68ff9c15600eb542c27e0b4e
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew she could never leave Samayra to die."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d288c8dee4cc935a0aaaffb601b1e1c8
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew she could not just be allowed to leave."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4cb94b1cd1052ed6939b600141133957
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew she could not punish her friend."
msgstr ""

#. uid: efbfb3ffdd1baf6a42f609560adae839
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew she could not resist this man. Doing so would only invite violence."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 76c3ef0e8988773de412261a0bc902af
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew she could wrap both her hands around his shaft with space to spare, if only because she'd done it before."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4689d17dc44f160be08da076e74dc6fd
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew she could, because the only things expected of her were either to clean the house, work the kitchen, or service her master in the other room."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6b0983f0083ca311a635f2c13cd46a56
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew she didn't need to expect much sympathy from him."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 126fee9aba267144532a96058e9b5e23
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew she had few other options other than to do what the spirit wanted."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 30732a6b310c3628ed0031fa010c46a9
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew she had fought hard and long to get to where she was. Sacrificed everything, given up her dignity."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3112aee797388b343ef8acc334856940
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew she had leveraged as much of her advantage over him as she could."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 84c7b3d88d87e037f1f96e99fed54337
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew she had none, nor would she offer any if she had. She wanted him to take her right now if they could get away with it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3a95841e85f91a72a8cd132815bd5a12
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew she had to act."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9644cb79bb0f6f39c6897868fd6e86b6
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew she had to force herself to be strong if she wanted to survive this."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b39c7948d6cd594ae1e8b950fd60134a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew she had to listen to the captain. She had chosen right by siding with him. Of course she had, the captain always won."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 71733a3b994c9ba3e3f79fe921d4d823
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew she hadn't been raised like this. To be forward."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2922166206b1e46a33714597f6d4c770
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew she might actually do it too."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 72eded43d14d58b9ef1d7809fedbb65f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew she shouldn't, but part of her couldn't help but be intrigued."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9400c0f2072a0e4f2f88690ae451184f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew she still had a maddened expression on her face, but she also didn't mind."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 604daa1baf994b04071c393d04304a4c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew she wanted to live a long life."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d7372d3d6ac782514549fda288aa5a44
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew she was in danger."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 46f6b28484fbc50aaa24bc44fddae590
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew she was never going to say something like that to the man."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0e09ca646e2e37333e94944742d06ab5
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew she was ready, but she felt a pit in her stomach. Would she really pass? What if she made a fool out of herself in front of everyone?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2b2770eea4170d421926f808c793eea6
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew she was ready, but still she felt a pit in her stomach. Would she really pass? What if she made a fool out of herself in front of everyone?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 47f289943b609af3be09b3f851e04dbd
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew she was risking something...if anyone ever knew she had done this with an orc...nobody would ever want her again."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 53ef1b3b839f7ea2607a6db474bb196d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew she was shrieking like a woman gone mad, but she also had lost any ability to restrain herself."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1dd3b84d509da22acad3d5564d92fb02
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew she wasn't the weak girl from the alley anymore, but she also knew her power, great as it was, could not protect her from everything."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d368ccdfecb4310788e17cb7de98195d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew she would for him."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0b872c9ebb6fd1374a69e6dc1de75282
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew she would get no sleep."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f8247e187b623bd84a8268f3ea0c82b2
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew she wouldn't."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 29fca9de097788251a247ab1ae62a5ed
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew she'd be happy when this was behind her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 720d1acff5aaea4e31cbfe80a10bc835
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew some of the other reasons why they had been called out here, but she didn't want to trouble Kate with such things."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ac300be2af8ef61d455ca1f18f86b023
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that Caleb was close."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 76791d0fe47e1d8c2335035348d33619
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that Carolyn couldn't force her. She could fight back if she wanted to. But she didn't. Some part of her yielded to Carolyn's authority."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b3159189b7f085df5a924241e7677e75
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that Kate understood what she was asking."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fedb9f96d50e13b5a53d02d966dee69f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that Nick had to be punished for his mutiny, but she hoped that this would be the end of it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fbda18576ea07c1dd8adb70897541d02
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that Sakar was dishonest in his intentions."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c0fad58166f42481e76eb174c182c146
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that Thomas was never one to care much for land reform petitions, even on the best of days."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5faadcc6657e6110aafd3b054acce783
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that a spike was a poor attack, because it took a long time to produce the spell, allowing the other mage to anticipate it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 557840083ba784f2844b576622b71a04
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that as one of only very few female commanders, she didn't need an introduction."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 692bc48d49811a6d1aa628bc4a10819b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that as true, but she also knew they were not her soldiers at all."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 99a0f51df47d36ac301c2f579f19c8f1
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that beyond the palace, gangs of soldiers, some Mythran, some from her own mercenary company, would be stalking the streets."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2364ed2039a49d3c5fc7d4b79edcf5f7
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that escaping was dangerous, but if she even wanted to have the option, she would need to learn more about the city."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a3d5f13b6041ba1dfc59db736a9398dc
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that even if she threw the strongest possible punch she could, the man would likely not even feel it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cb60180efebaab32dcc8a9c751dadc80
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that for as much as she hemmed and hawed about Nick's fate, her own role was not as clean as she pretended to herself."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6079735536bbfde57e94425b8d673fc8
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that he meant it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ad9db37461d1c6f6a7a4eb295dc675ba
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that he suspected that she was of high birth, but she imagined he loved that too."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 019c9f6779c9d9976ea9f1a54b3c73b5
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that her position was still uncertain."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8e482cdd67e4125f2f7defae05315fe6
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that no matter where Thomas was on the battlefield, he would not survive."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 294337a27bea03d64d563db1791c5f4e
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that she didn't have the power to compel an answer from Lady Carolyn."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3daf16cb9fa90d80ca7183f9a0013859
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that she didn't, but everything still seemed to be moving very quickly."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9c866139d21f6aa2f1d3023d2c5512ac
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that she had."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7810b38d8692ba4a2977d770f894e68f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that she owed all of this to Atilla. He had taken her from the rich spoiled girl she was, and had given her a soldier's body."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d635506ee83c0d57ebbe15acc7bf8613
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that she was inside, but the inside of the Imperial Palace was so vast, it almost felt as if she wasn't."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2daffe58b0e7f571cf5f409360e20287
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that she would if he'd ask her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 551283fc0b0c52413c231df7c7e91d5f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that soon he would be fucking her as he most wanted to. Violently, hard, entirely for his own pleasure."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 395792b6fc9c4ee401f40ca66cf40372
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that the best option would be to side with the nobility."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9b83a16b1906d4cb0768a4bfe7f5cfc8
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that the captain enjoyed it whenever she joined him in humiliating Nick."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 942b2638d8c305dd534ae1946678f870
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that the house connected to many spaces across the world, so the spirit's words seemed obvious in hindsight."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d21f3699184f4ed69461b421a617f2b0
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that the soldiers were all on their best behavior when she was around, and even so, she felt uneasy at how crude they were."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d273c83a9f69450666a2ff25a8fb7e26
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that the spirit understood her, but he compelled her to speak plainly."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 08b18dcab82f905eef80090dcb4bc524
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that the spirit would offer her no respite."
msgstr ""

#. uid: aa121afc16395547b56d2ffc4ab6e84c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that the thought had passed her mind. She had even asked some people, but nobody seemed to know much of Atilla's old life."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b0a67719fd312a606c1d2eeade63c8b9
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that they needed to keep seperate armies."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 949993c3bc0b32807b16c4de5f772af2
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that unifying the armies was the only way forward."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d2e7a425551d75fcebe42ecea2c16a64
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that was a bad idea."
msgstr ""

#. uid: dc5fffc78f3b1bc9fe1475da40713974
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that was likely the least of his intentions."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ada036cb92ce71779da8e3a0b82ff759
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that whatever the answer might be, she would best be served to contemplate it on her own."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d77d66eb3446b18dd8ffd4719a90ae07
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that with her numbers, her advantage was too significant."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 754dbf4a7f59c50e90acfcff03fa4b1b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that you could only push a man so far before..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a826e6db669250e160a321e7bbf79a9e
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew that, whether she had admitted it to herself or not, that this was a part of it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 66224d835e5d0538a873aa1927be3033
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew the answer almost instantly."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e96ade007d11ffea0bed8610863bd3c2
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew the answer before she dared to speak it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4f4495919575ef7a95078c5b378686f7
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew the answer the captain wanted from her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d3427ea3a035d7677e36e506050e1a5d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew the girl's body well enough by now, quickly building the pace as she pistoned her fingers ever faster."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9d40a45f48ee2a65a5ada65fee3acbef
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew the list, murder, lies, adultery, but by now she imagined she had broken more than a few of them."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e4238f5a4a548494aa25bea916206191
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew the orc wanted more, and she obliged. She unhooked her bra, dropping it to the ground next to her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7c5c5ec3a6c3740b6f0edd1ecddc8d3f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew the reports...but her only source for those had been Carolyn."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 332543efef11bab81e6f605fb6335156
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew the spirit had a point there."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8f2e1bb6ca1fd168f24726979ed66e76
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew the strength of her husband and laughed as he slowly pretended to lose."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a2ff474dc817fd44f703e1e9ec5bd180
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew the topics were important, boring as they were, but she was eager for a break."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3e9717e0dc6093bfacfd8d0329ac0601
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew there was no reasoning with him."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 91c0e6305c751d065d6b65132f2a8198
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew there was town here. A small remnant of human civilization just on the edge of the bay."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8cf8313aea8f516b8a51e376577410be
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew they had the supplies and logistics to keep this up for a week if they had to."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a14bcc89246723d46f6f7783cc96ef0b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew they would be loyal to her, but only if she took the city."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 497f1f7c649208b57cc49373ed688bbc
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew things had gotten bad, but she hadn't imagined that bad."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ffa7593e4ad534b28cbf0e3d1c743c10
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew this painting well. It once had a prominent place in Castle Reinmeer."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f0fbfe713276c491c368ea1292006550
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew this too was part of it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2a262c67b9615f0baa6b1988d583f0ce
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew this was no idle threat."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9e3951e73ecb5569a5cd124edc2ff7fc
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew this was on the agenda. The event itself was a formality, but she worried about how Thomas would handle such an event."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 62e93fc672ea20d74111fdca18139929
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew this was the opportunity she had been looking for."
msgstr ""

#. uid: dd2035e64cf3af9d579ed9d1608ee8b5
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew this was true, but had given it little thought."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6e75fdd3e8e78c2d8dd29e95c17b79a1
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew this was true, but she had no intention of buying the silk."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f30cbc9ad59c103570f1d0bad126c1c3
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew this was wrong. She knew the type of person that made a match for her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5f3305e548ec9150445be568eafd58b2
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew this world was different. There were different rules. She had to be careful. Unlike back home, her station offered her little protection."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9a9f734defceaeff528efdfd236e4406
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew well enough the effect she could have on men, and it was obvious that Marius was hardly immune to her either."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b851ab4036a2f6774116575c0f3d6173
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew what Kate meant."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1104114dc97f79c486de96729f85d6e9
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew what Lily meant. The Union Kingdoms, and with it Rosanna, were not as open to these things as some corners of the world."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 798c50f5ae9ceef5a3bfd01946a7ac19
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew what had to be done."
