#. uid: dad5b5dfe5f30855dd2548a7b5b96df6
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Silence lingered in the room for a moment."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7c9181d3177e5bfcd20528587c3110ea
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Silence was her only reply."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5f7ca957deffe940cd21d2562751c72e
msgctxt "speaker:Judge"
msgid "Silence!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6a3c6d71eca9307bcd65991e628dbf60
msgctxt "speaker:Gorak"
msgid "Silence, human whore!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: bc1fe70dcd10d4fefd44ca37473954d1
msgctxt "speaker:Hecate"
msgid "Silencing their screams."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 795b4d70104d058f8f3a94635b00dba7
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Silent, each began to get dressed. Only when Alaric had nearly finished putting on his boots did he spoke to her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b8f300b950548b27e92f5ec5b8bb9c02
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Silently, the two of them laid there. For how long, neither could quite tell."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 43ddb1ffc57bef3e7942d0401d4cd894
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Silly goblin, she thought."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 009e22007073ac778383a1acb7e335ee
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Simple creatures."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f615de75b375d085597bfb476d10e631
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Simple how?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 028641f46d2374ef68d41f6cd5c999e6
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Simple, payment for the second half...in whichever way you're able."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b45dc277c61eec9cbbe4dd8fa795962b
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Simple, we give them what they want."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 711051adc16c9e8e4596f7d22cf17092
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "Simple."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b4615e6affae024a4a9082f4de60e776
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Simplistic as the cage was, it appeared to her unbreakable."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 485c5714e35d456c227ce877b438e49d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Simply landing thousands of men was an entire operation by itself."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d3ed52b7cb9987edcb057226767723d4
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Simply lowered her head, and continued to go along with everything."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e0d6b51bb4d3b996ca84cb6495784c2c
msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "Simply never speak of it. He surely won't ask about what he can't know."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b02595417b2622266c94f7e309cb935c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Simply the idea of her body heat was enough source of comfort."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 61030fbb6ce1af7dff3b7672e483f2b5
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Simply thinking his name brought on the memories, flashes of heat rising up from inside her chest, her breathing growing heavier."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 218baafeb7366c5d9dc7f37e2a4518b4
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Simpy be patient, dear. Make sure no tribesmen cause any trouble, and try to keep yourself from going mad with boredom."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fa01fcb26fce7f86e9ecbd5c17460f13
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Since having lived here for several years now, the smell had taken on something different."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 27e65d2625ebc167676ea45326564a23
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Since that day, the town was called Gallow's creek."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d20d142a5e4ea6b93446efb3f88cc62d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Since the homes were illegal to live in, but there were no guards around, the people that lived there had few if any rights."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3853338f7bc8404fd5c30e2de8b2364f
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "Since we're getting to be drinking buddies, my name is Sigmund."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 075a8ae36d2a78bd74d3be4a5311155f
msgctxt "speaker:Voice"
msgid "Sing your song if you please, child, but know that your magics do not work here."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ef2445a1fabdaef6ce95aa10c32e7d5f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sinking her desperate nails into his skin, begging with pain for more."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 742141a3e9e984b96b6abac0f9ae831b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sinking into the soft bed, Sarah could feel his eager hands all across her body."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 33f9c6bbffa72bb349e86c0aa6ea1c4c
msgctxt "speaker:Damian"
msgid "Sir Goderic found me, some three-years ago when my village was attacked by bandits."
msgstr ""

#. uid: eef8c36b1f0e320895935c71abe6b1e2
msgctxt "speaker:Damian"
msgid "Sir Goderic is famous in these parts."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0a4341181f8d2cd6df7ea65f6843b3ca
msgctxt "speaker:Damian"
msgid "Sir Goderic, Knight-Of-The-Fields. I pray forgiveness, for I do not know where or by whom he gained his knighthood."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0ddf40bb1be70667f7c490bad43d3b37
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Sir Goderic, if the words of your squire are as true as I imagine them to be, you are a true friend to the people of this province."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 926bff4dbd7fbbc3b39a451d65ddfa58
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Sir Northwood...I can't say I'm familiar with that family name. What part of Rosanna do you hail from?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: a2785f6e4afb3b8b1bc2fe1e49248a74
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sir Roderic would ride home with his beloved and marry her, but compard to slaying the basilisk, few children cared much for those final pages."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ef9514fb010343562534224b82536e4a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sir Roderic would take his magical sword, go deep into the mountains, slay the wicked basilisk and free his love."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 22b3f0f8e9b6c89c1941cfcbb0deb1ae
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Sir Roderic!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: b7477002c7a50a434bfec51e9522ea38
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Sir Roderic, newly knighted..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 158531e3bf21450fd337695e8e63924c
msgctxt "speaker:Guard"
msgid "Sir!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 158531e3bf21450fd337695e8e63924c
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Sir!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: c306da8baa84d691e322ca57126379a6
msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "Sir, this goes beyond that."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 56a804987c284b272846044d4c1f2a63
msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "Sir, you understand that-"
msgstr ""

#. uid: b880fe175db7e0913a5cf570c1924eec
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Sir."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 846e8ce41153cd866bcc661cafb6c376
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Sir..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 294f34b4da8dc77acdf92d4ce6ca9958
msgctxt "speaker:Damian"
msgid "Sir...I can't been called all proper like that in years."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9df8c80264cf01b20f324644e9e9ffce
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Sir...may I ask why?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6ad4e9600f3b9c582681df5aa6c8160f
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Sir?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6d5b157e5561c83d3e226170810bdd2e
msgctxt "speaker:Thomas"
msgid "Sis..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: dc3f3a8d260a70b7e554df5e216fcedb
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "Sit and close your eyes. Take on a cross-legged position if you can manage it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 09c5a5bc35ff7ad81181790fa3d829b5
msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Sit still and observe"
msgstr ""

#. uid: a89d30184aa206a574053a5e1c1ef58f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting about the room, Sarah could see each of them tired. Exhausted."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 827e64863e4c9717220f8f6417984d3a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting alone in the garden, Sarah continued to take in her surroundings."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b5ece1e05d082a316c53496ec44c81d2
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting around it, Tribesman, clad in their linnens and foreign garbs."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3fe3733289187f5d1a4e69931ef15eb6
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting around the table, Sarah held court as an endless stream of commanders and officers pleaded for her attention."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b57f7f60fbac722f281fc2553630751f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting as his feet for hours, Sarah would dream away as she looked into the flames, while her father worked."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 205dbcd20d2b39402a1eaf542933d403
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting at her desk, Sarah began to consider on her next move."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6dfdf2113e5b86dfb1b522b79aaefde2
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting atop the box, Sarah's eyes trailed the winding road that led away from Lethram."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c502db2958f513c02f702673b5b687df
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting atop the elevated position, Sarah could see a bit further out."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 801d271e28d634c2256c9c2e818cc159
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting atop the pillow was the crown."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b9bcb2acb3b77f4ff8a0fff777ae1dd7
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting atop the stairs near the dais, she found her brother Thomas."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 911a09078bde16f3bb922959183c5294
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting atop the throne, it was exactly such a new problem that came before Sarah."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cf295a17381b0619dd596ddb519ef6c7
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting behind the desk, Sarah watched as the spirit manifested itself into the room again."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 126cc9a95f452fad4458cba84af8ce23
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting beneath a tree, she saw Garret."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 12e61bc2caa8d14aab5735c8ec9c91ef
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting beside him so nakedly made her feel vulnerable, but she began to doubt that having clothes would change much to the situation."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4df6582406efeb73e73c8d9f80096c93
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting by herself, the loneliness of the city seemed to encroach on her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6161e34e60200e8cf391d9c9f039c324
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting by the fire, she could feel the comforting heat on her face."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7c1731c1df56032cf55e2d154ccf1192
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting down at her desk, she laid down the letter and stared at it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7384c5c9f89c786ef4678740dd3c2156
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting down at the campfire, she ate her fill."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a9d6c398bfe3229c3093e5aa272a10a7
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting down in Xan's chair, she looked over the many papers and books that were piled up."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2be9f33b500e49410f82d2c6087432ee
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting down on the edge of the bed, she found her mind still racing."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2168657e522696dcafb707cbec1182cf
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting down on the ground, she saw Ephraim, holding Caleb in his arms."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c05966e10ebf0d92023c29699bc60f93
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting down together, Kravel walked Sarah through everything he knew."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 003f5076f45cade73917b8740473968f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting from behind his desk, Vaelen observed them."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 90fc5358f449c3e6fed154ad7488b9d7
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting her room, Sarah considered her next move."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5a1bff3ab58d4ca37d53a92e896fbd56
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting in a chair next to the fire, Kate."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f2d6731e1c017825b1bbccbc1a8a4859
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting in a perfect pose, every part of her body carefully controlled, she seemed nearly like a statue."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1bc1cbe0b3516de9d2f1b92ca61df7d6
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting in an easy quietness that only old friends could share, they watched the people celebrate into the night."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7b682cb085ecf831ec8ea5a8789eb5de
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting in front of his desk, busily scribbling notes, her husband was working diligently."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c45bbeda8bf75cc1b9a275df39c1d7b5
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting in her corner, Sarah began to ate the stew."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fab7c48f70ea63103cdd11834397206a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting in his chair, he ordered the women to bring him his dinner, and sat with a seething rage as they prepared the table."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d44c39008b6a3bd0df20efa34978d6a3
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting in his lap, she began to devour the food."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fe4a3636dc76d0e789fd9a56f61a77c1
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting in one of the chairs...a stranger."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4dda83ca046cafb0bc12e54032ef20f8
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting in silence for a moment, Sarah found herself strangely happy."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9ab709060f295c000062adcbb86d526c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting in silence, she looked out across the road which simply stretched on each direction."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f935c24f0779d4459edaee689a1ec62c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting in the cafe alone, Sarah began to wonder why she had even come here."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 93d265a5654eeb5ee98c43513fa0e767
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting in the center of the desert, it was the only point that connected the Union kingdoms with the far Eastern kingdoms."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2ec3b0388dce005033bda61befd7019c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting in the chair, Sarah felt her eyes slowly glide towards the desk."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c920ba01057eace2c644b04dcbfa9d20
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting in the corner of the cave, a man dressed in bandages."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 299b889c0b51f0ac1832374b9ce9e02c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting in the dark, Sarah continued to watch the road up ahead."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b9481380dde7f82bb1603e7dc274085b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting in the gap of a broken wall, a fair distance from the celebrating crowds, Kate was staring off into the distance."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 843f993b710a4d04ba0420416cb3c683
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting in the moonlight, she had never felt more alone."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3d5afc1a3b0e2bae35e98b102e4e7eea
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting in the small yet quiet spot, she couldn't help but feel a little proud of herself."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 220b46bd3c04e12d0762ad6ba1e364c1
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting on a block of wood, near the edge, was Cassius."
msgstr ""

#. uid: faef22fac662ef0160f3bdd68307ab36
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting on her bed, she worked the tear in her dress with a needle and thread as best she could."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 276ef9a656ccd7f7811374ef2753c4be
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting on the block, staring into the fire, her mind roamed free."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 43868914406281625e455699c9679baf
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting on the edge of her bed, Sarah tried to recall how long she'd been here."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 53d0e9fc347a7d5b796aa1dfc98635d1
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting on the edge of the bed was Kate."
msgstr ""

#. uid: dc311b389ee40476d4566fecd4e039ce
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting on the edge of the bed, watching the woman down between her legs, Sarah felt a heat rise inside of her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 56aeee264655612924430abb6d61c285
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting on the far end of it, behind a large desk covered in scrolls and parchments, sat a woman all too familiar, from a lifetime ago."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 76e8aaeee04aa95b794efc339461a13a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting on the floor, Sarah stared ahead through tear stained eyes."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e056bf8d99432095a57f451e3133eb32
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting on the floor, as he sat on the edge of the bed, the difference between them was even greater than usual."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cea2979690bb35e746b488a7af71bc9c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting on the heap of hay, she did her best to clean herself."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a9db75faef476022e25e6a22400f8092
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting on top of it, a husk."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1f33aa728322850baf75588ce6fb8d4f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting there alone, Sarah counted the hours passing as best she could manage from memory."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c597422ba1d53a660df09c557c7b4a81
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting there, Sarah tried to process what had all happened."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 14a7be7935d8f96b7a611d87a4b882f4
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting there, she suddenly heard a sound coming from the side of the cage."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2b12f33abacb372243ad1d36b7f20808
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting there, she watched the city she had come to love pass by."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 34a72dfad4989b2d418cf459b8b80fc4
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting there, the man that could only be Gilead."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e0bed456240ae60cf00a3ebff7448a63
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting there, the two of them went over their day."
msgstr ""

#. uid: debc57792d9a15c89cde538cd0d9d36c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting there. Looking at her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7f8fd08fec0f2f9b25c6df485ec104f7
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting together under the soft drip of the shower, the two friends speak wordlessly."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c28c4b507876a1f65d82be672f27bc1b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting together, they slowly warmed on the fire and one another."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b4acedecf63d87c9747b8870b55f098c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting up against the wall near the entrance to the camp, was Kate, slumped over, her hair hanging across her face."
msgstr ""

#. uid: deaccb1465b65ff1c834ac1303ff374b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting up against the wall, in a corner of the cell, a young woman."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 293655c31d115a3bdbbd6b06f21483f1
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting up in bed, watching Kate scramble around, Sarah wondered if Kate was taking her time on purpose."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 11f68d54debf098cc4f3a24ce97232b6
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sitting, playing near the fire, while her mother sat and watched."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 83fd98681ebc497b68ad79b2062900f4
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Situated in the middle of an old marketplace, the camp was surrounded by tall houses, making it feel walled in."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8ba5c1c5015c955a5b142debe35c30ff
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "Sixteen"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1aac33e82f210247c40e9e1ce256babe
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Skilled warriors, even here the Tribesmen proved their reputation to be true."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ce939b550ebb77e32289f3595abffc93
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Skilled, his hands moved swiftly and with purpose."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 00b46b4a8069f8b85cd5695772a4ba3d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Skillfully, Kate continued to thrust two fingers in and out of Sarah, curling them with every motion."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 96b279d6c280e4a66a8b0c10f16076ef
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Skillfully, he did not slow, instead keeping his pace and drawing out every fraction of pleasure, keeping her at its peak before allowing it to recede."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c70011bdcfe6fb9457d7325dbe6e9398
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Skin on skin, Sarah became again aware of their vast difference in age."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8cab4834bd2b608261c7867502841a29
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Skin, slapping against skin. Every imaginable act carried out, some beyond her own imagining."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 72ef2b9b6965d078e3c7f95487a82d1c
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Skip"
msgstr ""

#. uid: b6a1928d8fb50cb82daf37562901327b
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Skipping"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2d0a726becdded0ae6db335fdbbc1315
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Skips dialogue while held down."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 464a502c301aa1a1799b5543d628a90f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Slack jawed, she could only slightly turn her eyes and saw that the smoke produced in Alaric, the same sensations."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d25df65d1df9909e1eeb3d8385a39855
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Slapping her ass red."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fe25c0ad752c03ce2361025c235b63e1
msgctxt "speaker-name"
msgid "Slave"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 84bb816818f48e83a074512a4a2ecbd0
msgctxt "speaker-name"
msgid "Slave Woman"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 582727260d8466da4a353a64527b0715
msgctxt "speaker:Gorak"
msgid "Slave! Come here!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6cbb3bb4506cf68bb4595b7ca4b4102b
msgctxt "speaker:Raza"
msgid "Slavers trade in these mountains."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 35c4e902a858bd1ec39d64095bdd2b65
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Slavery is strictly forbidden in Lethram."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 70eda75cd9478e9061c5963f43a95cf3
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Slavery wasn't legal in Lethram, but this far out from any civilization, it didn't seem to matter."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9a812c5747339826eb177509db0f0546
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Slavery wasn't legal in Lethram, but this far out from any organized government, it didn't seem to matter."
msgstr ""

