msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That is why I'm still here, Duke Antonio."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 91ad2878150357685bae39b0b359968b
msgctxt "speaker:Oryon"
msgid "That is why our world has remained in such a state of decline."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8e7caba521a94e82d3e905dbfdd0d0f8
msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "That is why we leave the totems, to remind them of their old lives."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0593d81502cf46a9b7e210ade0cd50f0
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "That is, supposing you are still interested in learning more of the book."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7514cba55500514f0b9d6e5fea7eaeed
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That is...you speak the language of the Tribes?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: aaafc81e7ad6b8262da7a3af4422d739
msgctxt "speaker:Tailor"
msgid "That isn't why I called you over."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 399397875296ddce018560cc451708a0
msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "That it might just be. Still, you should be celebrating."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b511b8777b8d552e848d27b4e01858a8
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That it was Xan who was doing it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 78179344c224c90333aefc79c8c0eab5
msgctxt "speaker:Hecate"
msgid "That it's you! Xan had told me so much about you, his new apprentice."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e18c68a0ee7e9e2898be07515e28e605
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "That just cost you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3361f9ed53b09379e6eb31d15db17e83
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That just happened to be yours."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b3a80465a9777e54acbd096e1c07725c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That kind of softness was something she couldn't afford in her current life."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 21f71f7af08687a2a4f5c2c1d7e4ebeb
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "That kinda connection...that's always gonna cost ya."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c924086345c6130143a253bf6082dd02
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That knowledge had lost its use when her homeland fell, and most houses she could name were now either snuffed out or living as refugees."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ed2e60f8827e49d64c3d59ea54505db4
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "That leaves the palace almost entirely undefended. There will be a handful of guards left, but that's it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6243d57ffe024d6c85ff1855e83ecfa4
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That leaves you with only your own."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e2b69d7a3702b2e2412b1afca440f493
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That lithe frame, mixed with the strong muscles, hers was truly a body in its prime."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 643a674020f3bc3866cd9a5a2bc0315a
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That little?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: d924a354987d7700b9c92a16c1482645
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That long, without food?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 09d2509e96669313875ba9dd146e31ca
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That long?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 17d98f1349d24bf20c379801f61b7065
msgctxt "speaker:Ephraim"
msgid "That looked like a nasty fall."
msgstr ""

#. uid: faba62e6d2743d6538abe342c6fd6b0e
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That looked more natural on him than the nervousness."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a39a3a41204a23d53fa84144e284b866
msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "That looks decent enough."
msgstr ""

#. uid: df165a47530dd64de6219e1bf61c0368
msgctxt "speaker:Hecate"
msgid "That magical pulse. Don't tell me you can't feel it?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7e49ac268dcf98e0a94889c90967ae06
msgctxt "menu"
msgid "That makes sense"
msgstr ""

#. uid: d34115ff234d03ff7cc1a0cd0b052d20
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "That makes sense. I really should have figured that out myself."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fd0419b8754a0f1c27f7919cd46bc28e
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That makes sense...I think."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 98795d5fbb3f80a91b52e8ab06db6b69
msgctxt "speaker:Man"
msgid "That man...that man that served you your drink, and your food, he used to be little more than a farmhand and a thief."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 02e050d8c4e0ff2d2ae45b665dad0f45
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "That many."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 75a87cb3cbcfc865dab23bfc20802db1
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That many?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 64b4c7a61d28fc122057aa055dc43b94
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "That maybe if we picked up on where we left off years ago, I could be all quiet like about it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 19caa70a33faf607989aac56ec4f1ea4
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "That means I'll take you on as an apprentice."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f1fd1bc09c681ccd49b6ad82cfcfadf2
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "That means leaving everyone except the capital, defenseless. If Hassar avoids the capital, and attacks another district, they'll only have women and children to defend themselves."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 02c02831f2b1fb47559120d6f3c09dee
msgctxt "speaker:Matthew"
msgid "That means no fights. No drugs. No trouble."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a959465b2fb3a0baf664b3581ff7b5e1
msgctxt "speaker:Hecate"
msgid "That means they were there when the old Empire fell."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 84fed30a6d971ceae4db2e881e6517e5
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "That means you must govern not just from your heart, but also from what is right for the country."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7782a2d840da3f2c5486a0d5ac034a1d
msgctxt "speaker:Mythran Prince"
msgid "That means you're free to leave. Even if I suspect you probably killed more than a few of my men."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9d6f571df4f0dc3d4b135d35cf7d8ee3
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That meant bringing them over to her side. For some that was inspiring their hearts, but for many more it was simply filling their greed and urges."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ac40c73c4f05550618bbf1643c2292e6
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That men were of such nature, and women of another nature, and this justified all the ways in which they were treated differently."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1deb621a9d458dededb930655bace0ff
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "That might last you longer than you think."
msgstr ""

#. uid: be79e378b343f4b7f7810651a09a2ee0
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That might not mean anything to you, but it does to me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1b00095cea1f63edb108b7977eabb1fd
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "That moment is now, in this place..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 90e3aa4232f6723bfa0092b72212240d
msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "That moment on the balcony just keeps haunting me and I can't do anything about it!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: a02d6faba9b498c65743b9d984b7bb10
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That moment when all she needed to do was be present, for him."
msgstr ""

#. uid: dbbe5ff2231f502efd7276044cf40aa4
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That money would be far better spend on the needy."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 70b8f4562050f422a38a14cd5a330a41
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That morning she had awoken as a princess, and before the sun had fully set, she was now a slave."
msgstr ""

#. uid: bfe2ed91ca9e1f6b52b4e395f9ae70b6
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That moron!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: bd1d6e55365e5163e889288357fc04b9
msgctxt "speaker:Hassar"
msgid "That much is clear, but why did you lose? Why are you now offering your body to the man that destroyed your nation?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2b6413e693470c9eb034cea7cb7f4460
msgctxt "speaker:Jasmine"
msgid "That much is probably true. I'll go and see about uniform, give me a moment."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6b6c9b6e448a660b0ae0cfe63eadbb7f
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "That much is true."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1cbe3b6581cfd3703d8244022b5c4686
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That much was the truth."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c9f274e8263ac834b0bcc4619bf35024
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That much, Sarah knew to be true. For every king and emperor in her world, there were millions who simply toiled away their lives."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ef6d0ccb12da34d4d091d47ca146548f
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "That nobody really knows what they're doing. No truly."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9d81cfc1996d5b7de4f0dfa133610504
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That nobody would ever know how she had given in to him."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4b46490475c9f5fcd87df69e44e80a9b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That obnoxious booming laugh of his."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a7b9e306fde0f8e0a06b6ed588c807d4
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That once, rivers flowed and carried with them life. Fields of grass and grain, spoiling the citizens of the nation with plenty."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 04844a782c744357c30ba3698b022a2d
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "That one over, not under. The rope gets pulled up this way, and leans across that part. You wrap them up, you risk it snapping at high winds."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b7d62d8a29302efbc91c41c6c776d6d9
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "That one was a deviant as well. I got rid of it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 29fd81790f4bc6b1eeff445e938bcc0a
msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "That over there was the town square, but you might a figured that out."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ac099209ae49dda329e6da883d15fe51
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That part also belonged to him."
msgstr ""

#. uid: acefe96c61e9f3d1f6bea42315b9f1f8
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That part was clearly virile."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4f52ae7701d20c292bc75eb7feda41d9
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That people could live so freely...and confusingly...it was a lot for her to make sense of."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ce12d644e59930fa06ea33f988727cff
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That perhaps it was as simple as the fact that she wanted him, no other conditions."
msgstr ""

#. uid: add70f0e52d9c3dfbc87ab90900df4bc
msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "That place had nothing left for me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 430f9edcdf8ce1898229c5f0c700a87b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That place was no doubt dangerous. Going in at dark was not something she was planning for."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 77cb908938bea4dbd28e2e7898353fb6
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "That poor peasant girl, whipped on your command."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f209bfa35700585731f6a148bc5439c0
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That power, his iron muscles, the way he could so easily throw her around, thinking about it, Sarah felt herself get wet."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 82162935d695a21310652c857bd26d41
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That promise, of war, then comfort, had now been crudely violated by Vaelen."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c8627f3050862074cd8a60dd090bc58f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That reminded her. She had been so busy lately, she had let her prayers slip."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8c6ef2f0f2ad30df6288ca125f735530
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "That reminds me, I need to get one of my tools from the cabin, that will make it easier to show you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 68d754e22cfa3b41d8fb0d7331edd85e
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That rough and violent desire, mixed with that arrogant disregard that he had for her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 59f68907633cfbb8744938895a4d0f75
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That same brutal winter landscape that had ruined her last time."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8f4060b9359b86fbb51ee1fa1d7d3bcb
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That same false smile. Those same cruel eyes."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 494374401852f560cd6e30244dca2f82
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That same night, they also murdered every remote branch of that family."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 108bc7a6f72050c525b224b1f06cec24
msgctxt "speaker:Shah Mahda"
msgid "That seems to be about all I ever purchased from you, despite everything."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 71c9b3d9515e8dcc0b3f611fd03ea903
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "That seems to fit."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c5be08c6901b0da4969cc721a541e3d5
msgctxt "speaker:Thomas"
msgid "That settles the matter of Hassar and the desert tribes. What is left on the agenda for today?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 505ddae0d31f75868cf2dcdc19cfc363
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That sex between a husband and a wife, like all skills, was one honed over time."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e141fc7a32dbc017b9568cb7b2412c90
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That shame will follow your family's name until the end of times."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d03539622d557f3bd3aa517c99623917
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That she could manipulate him."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4fff1fbb44fd57c0eb407e5264231e05
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That she had lost something that had never been hers to begin with?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7219b0db9b01998837138f97e1559d3b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That she had permission."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8369aa1e683a481e2abbcece7c54c94a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That she would do anything, literally anything, if it meant that he might call her that again."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b052d3dd564f34fc03d53694d160d02a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That she would take off her clothes and reveal nothing other than her ordinary body."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 501e7114edadad85232086c960041870
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That she, the young and beautiful woman, was like a gift to the old man, for which he should be grateful."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d10413e5b94a7acb0a79fd06ec451066
msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "That smells amazing!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 15aec7774f1c9b070d9181f74f0a19fe
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That somehow sounds even worse."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 674691185b592eaf50244d91ad91598f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That somehow, despite everything she knew about him, he would prove a hero."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 54d07217f75a7e02b2cadf8bee31df07
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That sounds awful."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 98f674619cbdc55072e1e4b6a36a7ad9
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "That sounds familiar."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d9d138a253f3f3ce05085434bc4b46e9
msgctxt "menu"
msgid "That sounds horrible."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d9d138a253f3f3ce05085434bc4b46e9
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That sounds horrible."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8179fce726644308a1f948193414f429
msgctxt "speaker:Hugh"
msgid "That sounds like a problem for the two of you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: dc06c745f98521064c5d94a359928615
msgctxt "menu"
msgid "That sounds nice."
msgstr ""

#. uid: dc06c745f98521064c5d94a359928615
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That sounds nice."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7b982b245a419f650522ec59668604d8
msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "That sounds pretty bleak."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8bde15fe4c9a43ee6e8d6150d744588a
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That stuf...was..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 48db809bdd1567385d3f48483abbd583
msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "That such a flower should belong to another family, when it looks so good on you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3bf1ccc44c35c12675e1fb54a28f8391
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That summer, shipment after shipment of grain arrived in the nearby town, collapsing the price."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ba3f8c1d5a7d272d7369494400be8302
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That the death of their Khan had caused them to fall back to infighting."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4ae02ea0c3edf75e250982b68b4122e0
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That the one true ambition of Maeiv had been this last and final proposal."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 053e473e2de1e3c75133c5369273df7b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That the real work was done in the shadows."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b098f5fcc705913c22d55f3234db53ea
msgctxt "speaker:Eula"
msgid "That there is Edgar."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cd0c23ec021efd5c2d8f4d676bb813c3
msgctxt "speaker:Jasmine"
msgid "That there is Pale Eclips, what I use for my cartography."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9300cd8e866022cadaed7b596d64dbc6
msgctxt "speaker:Man"
msgid "That there is a proper glass of wine. Or at least as proper as you're going to find in these here slums."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c50a6d6835caaa7c2af61a7ebef0251a
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "That there is shoreline."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c589daef09a0dd6ad09830418f246067
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "That there is the last housing block that is still standing."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ba7192e919d1aba425c3a1c790ecfb16
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That there was some part of herself that didn't fully live in this world."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 072d09d5b14d088207191da75d09e4b4
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That there would be more here than mere lust."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e4aa56158f6d203d3f8219735917e045
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That they could make so much money off just one cart seemed absurd to Sarah."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2deed4e2a96b3b37a263ce502204e902
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That they were not all so different, and that they likewise lived upon the edge between surviving and ruin."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fd0f1dba6f70c709197be683881095b1
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That they were somehow the same."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 62ee665001449db16d89462d11c17c35
msgctxt "speaker:Mayor"
msgid "That time it was one of the carpenter's apprentices. Boy lost his entire left hand but at least he lived to tell about it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c4228a37862d64d51bb73462d2d64140
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That time passed, she could only faintly tell because the light of the sun slowly turned and then darkened."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2250b491fc09478cca40468a6529da09
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "That time will come."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d590d99d70307648fe5e8b5db6680d82
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That title of yours...the Silent Queen...I don't think it fits."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9577107fe3cc107e0e595223aca6b7f3
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "That too, but I also think you got potential."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5405221530287b4e86904fc3fc982d9b
msgctxt "speaker:Kim"
msgid "That trade official was a big softy, but plenty of those people up there are ruthless."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fd2b9b47ca2fdbe0048ea02bfd75cc45
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That type of stuff should be between people that love each other. I don't love you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 92b414f9685f22d223f760689056f338
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That underneath all the pretense and protocol, the world, and the people in it, are reduced to their nature."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1ac2498d1d8a5871f1f4b9641203b19e
msgctxt "speaker:Marshal Edmond"
msgid "That understanding ultimately led me to...well, you know our history."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d24cb4a496d3c96d60fed23bbc14c50a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That use also no longer mattered."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1d85dc264ae135d784cb41b10ce8ca5f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That was Atilla to her. The surface, and the deeper version of him. The real truth that only she knew about."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2a605f95c9aef4c0befd0264393631aa
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That was a dangerous thing in a place like this."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d86352d0d5f4eddf77390a83c530f26d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That was a lifetime ago."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 76febafcfee7c5d51288ec55ef361f9f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That was about all that she could say for it. No luxury. Nothing that made it seem like there was any personal touch to it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1d106292ff64488d8bb9de796746ebbd
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That was about all there was to the sparsely decorated room."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 09398d4325b36beb3aeaacf620702bba
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That was all it took. And in return he would give her so much more."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 512aa7a576c012fef7c17cf32bbb55fd
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That was an idea that did seem to appeal to her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: bead9babddc983cd99fc945665f0f64e
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That was an insane amount of money for anything, let alone a drink."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d887f66f9b9517fb0821276c344527db
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "That was back then. We ain't doin nothing you don't wanna do now."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5e4b303a711dd4276d8a60e18ace5e99
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That was before they went to war with the Mythran empire, centuries ago."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fabbdec0fb2ba323170a5a61aef18c4c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That was enough for her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e9eeec5f2914737c17ac2b3ebac58d69
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That was essentially all of it. From a princess, down to this."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9fe41d8bebf211ff349450cc0a7d1d3e
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That was far from how the people of Rosanna lived."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c66a31c12dd44633e0d7ebc0c6263569
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That was her weapon, she realized. The means by which she could bend a man like him to her own will."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c6c7bcc2b182b6b22ea0bcadb2a51eca
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That was him, she thought. Those two parts, the desire mixed in with his hesitant tenderness."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8d843fa07e589ff8cf5a954e677d1dae
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That was his curse, Sarah thought. If her brother had simply not cared, or been lazier, he wouldn't have demanded so much from himself. He wouldn't push himself this hard."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fed81f92d089d086e7fc77dbbd4d9046
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That was it, Sarah thought."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9e1391ce1abacafc055f1ec8afafc6f5
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That was it, she realized."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0eab5b2008a88fb3334ca6f9af622d19
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That was it. Her one ally. Her one resource."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fa196aa1ae548977dacf5e097604b6fd
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "That was it. That abominable mage..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b263b75afd126a71fc66c0ed1c4272c8
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That was just...foolishness, captain."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d32180cfbc1f8e9ceeb394d1304f1eee
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "That was more than five years ago. I thought they had killed the entire royal family."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9d945eb6ccf30a87de64232d6ff95027
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That was one thing about soldiers, Sarah thought, at least they knew to keep to themselves."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3dd69d7fe10fdf73754d58cbcb238371
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That was something she could give him, she had decided."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6757365ef3b4513775d622d7a1bc4a4e
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "That was something..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5a4016677a3798b8ae632497e0c57c4a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That was the life she had been preparing for back then. The game of politics."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 58a37cd8f7d8b0f4a23b21d0a96b7a55
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That was the not the wound that a soldier might have given her. It was more like something a wild animal might do."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fe2453adf27da53ef145254efb05180d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That was the only fraction of comfort she had. The knowledge that the creature would pay, in time."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 455c3e66fceac4372b603e9262fd132d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That was their biggest difference, Sarah knew."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 631145514abd3b62dd940e5c2606e881
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "That was true when you found me in the alley too."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ae23b83c93f57a0227bd8038b436321f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That was true, but Sarah also knew what Samayra likely hinted at."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a34f3c22ef72ab5dccab02e26f7a39ba
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That was until its ruler, Shah Mahda, had accidentally caused the death of a Mythran prince during a fight at a party."
msgstr ""

#. uid: af3fcb5910c405ea1914dafed40f7776
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That was what all these nights had done to her. He had trained her, and unknowingly, she had allowed herself to be trained to his desires."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f43bc2bacd219673c0e6c605b720dc82
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That was what passed for privacy and politeness."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0c76c5e5329da94b7da95ff4b8d04e3d
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "That was why I could never bring myself to ask you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 33fec80d5302dd5e2d576860a4b377ce
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That was worse."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1bbc71058f3c57060321113f3f1f439e
msgctxt "speaker:Gabriel"
msgid "That was years ago."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 61769664a77dad29ac095082e00ceaeb
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That was, until Xan told Sarah that they were going to offer the city their protection."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 02169ed3b93f4c688c77d2578d594817
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "That was, until a thought came to her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2e7a79abcaba14b32a8b84165c59ef73
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "That was...how did you do that?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6c1e666067f7898533b2b9dca0f293c6
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That was...something else."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c1ae7cc30b11458db24ae4e8941a5d23
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That wasn't funny!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: df93061cce67ff961e2d89ad6c4ffdf4
msgctxt "speaker:Hecate"
msgid "That wasn't my fault!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: f53dcd5525a3cfed74b8f088ea8c1a9f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That way that only he could make her feel."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e9f98b32809c87bf5b40c3ab4dc311a0
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That way, no matter what, I will be safe."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 69cce6b9c2c96995644f0d03690d182e
msgctxt "speaker:Marshal Edmond"
msgid "That we as leaders of our respective nations are bound to uphold a duty to our people."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2569c475e4ee47043bffe1f15e230c19
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That we can do."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d448a76e95925d0ae438dca7c2982cc3
msgctxt "speaker:Ramsey"
msgid "That we do. A few open actually, there is a nice one that has a view of the plaza outside."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ab0cf55ac5cc440767fe4ea6ef2200bf
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That whatever this latest act is, it comes only after a long series of debasements."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7ae32cbead8d3128cc9e427ea22359da
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "That whole attitude. Acting like I can't fuck you whenever and whatever way I want."
msgstr ""

#. uid: de6883f2bf138959e117a02afdbe0455
msgctxt "speaker:Hassar"
msgid "That will bring a child of whose claim to power is legitimate in strength, as well as in blood."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7f0e23d88fc7fcaa2c59ef411b783518
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "That will give me enough votes to secure what I wanted regardless."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 666e94677a3a7e8fedeab2c810ec4c5d
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "That will keep him in check. Make sure he gets no ideas. So he remembers whose in charge on this ship."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 361b4c5d59f8df06fe6c8a693f8a81b6
msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "That will likely slow us down."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 185be6806863baa1463534bb4540bae7
msgctxt "speaker:Hecate"
msgid "That will take us into the inner palace grounds."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6e431edd968ba1e76e150f8378e42aa6
msgctxt "speaker:Nickolas"
msgid "That won't be enough!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1859d7bf5f6e0ee27260435103d6ebd3
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "That won't be necessary blondie."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 40ef05977a45130d622817d7416743fc
msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "That won't do."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 717ba98287d8a0fd85aa780b4b6ddbd7
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "That won't work. My nature is not quite so similar."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ede6a010294faddc30de19841c69ab8e
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "That would be Gallow's Creek."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1bf5d2289199ea6318b1a8a1c6d100af
msgctxt "speaker:Soldier"
msgid "That would be a good start."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a16b121fb845916ffae67669e7019302
msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "That would be much appreciated."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 95ba2e2e1cc6f4acf63b427bd5d250d3
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That wouldn't have been a problem if we had reached our destination by now."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f892160f18d3c7be8389bb0bbe8813b3
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "That ya did, blondie."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4f30931f6d022ecc9396aa3f718c1e9e
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That you are hurting them. Is it on purpose?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: aa2866a11b15057dc916019c7c06172a
msgctxt "speaker:Kamal"
msgid "That you are just! You are rightious and kind! You will do what is right!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 79699371fbe6524c0fb7b15486e1752b
msgctxt "speaker:Marshal Edmond"
msgid "That you are your father's daughter."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 321b07ddb7cdc95c0a4fe31820837632
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That you are."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 917dbb10b64a0a1573a6ef70a897077a
msgctxt "speaker:Oryon"
msgid "That you murdered Xan."
msgstr ""

#. uid: da0a76aa8d862a933e03537eb98d80c6
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That you were always going to be like this."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 75b99b0c733d8589c4a5ecd1ba99ce33
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That you were dangerous."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 68643de6602d44e654c79df94da82a8f
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That you're disgusting. Fat. Old. A pervert."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 93692631a0cf6a9243bd8b12baef4e95
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "That you're not as prim and proper as you like to pretend."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3d09554993179e9b3ae0c2944a8fafe1
msgctxt "speaker:Voice"
msgid "That you, Marius?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: ee7b14d6e831e76c7a82042d692879d4
msgctxt "speaker:Tribesman"
msgid "That young man was no warrior. He would have died regardless. Now he lives."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ea6acfe59c95d58e5468e8c17e388e9b
msgctxt "speaker:Eula"
msgid "That's Synara and her cronies."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 85453af66592f3316be6853a747015a9
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's Thomas."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4c3f385ab6692fdf28d4a0ac3d6edb69
msgctxt "speaker:Matthew"
msgid "That's a decent start."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 33ade2e108889658be63951f77ba0743
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "That's a good girl."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3d695c90a3dcbbd8dec53caa6469ce15
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "That's a good thing."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3d398f6187c54a63b99e1e03cb0c5452
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's a lie, and you know it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6560b6dae26adfb4effa6fd602a18b55
msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
msgid "That's a new look for you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: da89d00168466388f12d0afc39207546
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "That's a nice phrase, but it doesn't change reality."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b087ce19f3a917dbd54f2385a53905c7
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's a nice thought."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cfd4e8e71d01f7b5bd61cca97efeee69
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "That's a promise."
msgstr ""

#. uid: afb7caa5125002ce849ab9f5b7ab6fc6
msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "That's a side branch to the main road."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e5456e696b8ba592baf0ec397312ba30
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's a storage room."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4627741fe0c4a525e42c123261912c4f
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "That's a strong name."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9d26b446144c13cb7827f91c0e67756f
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's a very kind offer. I'd be happy to accept."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a9b9dfadb10c65495b4651d1f97f3af5
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "That's about it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: bb720c88fea30bd3fb5d836a1004cf8c
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "That's about when the food stores will be running low, and I don't want to be here when this city starts starving."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0635949d636722d165fff91eee20d34c
msgctxt "speaker:Male Soldier"
msgid "That's all I wanted to hear from you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 818e612360de94e3899e65ad71dcab0d
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's all we can do really, Ephraim. Promise to do for each other what we wish we could do for ourselves."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 271c5ba7daee666992e8cfe697ff5ff2
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "That's alright, I was only offering."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0053dd63a63c0bed002fd7349c333d29
msgctxt "speaker:Nickolas"
msgid "That's alright. I'm sure you're a fast learner, the captain speaks highly of you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f6b2e371539b2671d8e5dc086c5c9b7e
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "That's also why I don't really like to talk about it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 312f7da8289b4201d84262a2a0de3f6e
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's always your answer to everything."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b71053f1c23fbf5ba95f7517f4cb5861
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "That's an interesting choice. But I'm not sure that Xan would approve."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7581bb844b60d6e494592960093647dc
msgctxt "speaker:Tailor"
msgid "That's better."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0bdd5ae75d1f58ae5a313fe8b79b2c58
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's bullshit."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 166c07f4774d0a34ea15805e4254a941
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "That's cause they see me talkin to ya."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fa1afeeac8d4d3d3e7b65127ea8c5ba8
msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "That's definitely true."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2ca19d428e6d8af7927cc91e30e8b038
msgctxt "speaker:Albert"
msgid "That's enough for today. Don't want to fry your brain."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 559564d55ef60626f0cbfbd9f72244a0
msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "That's exactly it..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 449294237de141c1d3aeba79acbad5ed
msgctxt "speaker:Nickolas"
msgid "That's fair."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fe10842214e48e028e23a2c63eeffb3a
msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "That's fair. Any other?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0531d20dde3982315778e570344c3a81
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's fast."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 17a0903e5603a1230b7d6a36e6dd6082
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's fine, I was really hoping to talk to you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4e8e38a91fbae7408558bb7b4a4c1bd2
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "That's fine, I'll lead!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: bfc5e36da788e40903be00fea4a04b28
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's fine, I'm not a difficult eater."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 451f8ffa7a5b53b5999dbe606c1fe8d8
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's fine, Xan. Thank you for telling me all this. I've never heard of it before."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9ae7cf4c9cc10ce4752f2ac4e9e1a2e3
msgctxt "speaker:Naydeen"
msgid "That's fine, it took quite a while for all of us to settle here, but in time we made it work."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e45edb4cd5076a1fadf4663b9749e7dc
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "That's fine, you can let me know how you want them handled and I can finish them up."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5b948b0768f5f2f53f98eadea40ab6b3
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's fine."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2818194181cb900cbaab31aaec2e46b0
msgctxt "speaker:Nickolas"
msgid "That's for spinning up the back valve, it can let the ship load on water in the lower hull. Slows the speed, but when the ocean gets rowdy, it makes the ship more stable."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ff866f42f3409555a0cd592ebfe62ae4
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's gonna go on your review. Does poorly with authority and doesn't know when to keep his mouth closed."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 721ad82827e607cf4f1dce43fa040854
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's good, right?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 428251b8d64667c8b9eb139cc6011de1
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "That's good."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 428251b8d64667c8b9eb139cc6011de1
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's good."
msgstr ""

#. uid: db49c03e3850dfca379a3e51bdcc9dd7
msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "That's good...but it's also..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6078cde117c7d56fe72c4727fadba612
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "That's gotta be at least a few days worth."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 06bd69c552cc40242824e10a4dabea2c
msgctxt "speaker:Ramsey"
msgid "That's great news!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 63d10459960950718f5fc613ee79d513
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's great. About all I was used to drinking back in Rosanna."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9df5b5fab74af19be354072d6c1c1fe7
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's home. Yeah, for me that's what I think of when I remembered Rosanna all those years."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 787c7d9a1467b76f106ffec2f9f4433a
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "That's horrible."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 787c7d9a1467b76f106ffec2f9f4433a
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's horrible."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 60121ff015d912063747b4cb448480b1
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "That's how I go through life, I don't make excuses and I don't lie. I am who I am, simple as that."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 35b29c90e96be6b8858df5f456d9977c
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "That's how it usually goes though."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 09d3fc2db34a4fbc2b95be47ba7f6071
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's insane..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8e80c3895c24860ed78da56c1c723565
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "That's it, keep going!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 963726f2702ad508b543c1ef6f3267e3
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "That's it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 137978b79ad7bc0a089863dedd6488e9
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's it?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7898df5adcdab67a311e15334d4e579e
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's it? So simple?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: b8732caa1bb376fbdbfe739a6bd8483a
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's it? That's the story you want to go with?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6555b52ec31307a1697fadfa9599936d
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's it? This everything you earn in a day?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: e0a9e2e80d53026de628b0609e29d947
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's just a polite way of saying morose."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e87bb4944744cc698c488c3dfbdb2f0b
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "That's just about the only time he ever talks about himself."
msgstr ""

#. uid: dd44578cd4c8482ea7b76d81dace30c1
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "That's just called gettin hustled, Blondie."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4fe1a0ca570520112005da52e44574ae
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "That's just like the door from my family vault!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: e2db95c50aa8b5840fb12d70ee897db6
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "That's low."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a181aa956ae019bbf44068df37cfa44b
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "That's my Blondie, always such a smart head on her shoulders."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3c34ec93b5dc5bf6681e1b7a79a7de5b
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "That's my Blondie, now get on all fours."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1e3791c551188e2b2b8902f05e19299c
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "That's my fault for depressing you with my stories. I always drink too much when I'm sad."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5ed39edab7fc5e9890296ea2bd2a800c
msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "That's my girl."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5ed39edab7fc5e9890296ea2bd2a800c
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "That's my girl."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f9c341553da9dc331d3b8a4e79ca0215
msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "That's my home, right over there."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9dd0f306fe1b522aad6d0ad2a5c53bfd
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "That's my kind heart."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d41014a2899613c7995b2024c1d87278
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's my problem, I guess. Still figuring that out."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3f63978c17052eba164a9f41e45252fe
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's nice of you to say, but you're going to have to do better than flattery if you want to repay me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 78e35d8dd5d52a0b6724ad3f82912599
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "That's no way to greet an old friend."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e198a2360454c782132ea5376f67ac8e
msgctxt "speaker:Merchant"
msgid "That's not a serious price, come on lady!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 896fe573ec19ea0a22fbb5db47bf6276
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's not fair, you didn't-"
msgstr ""

#. uid: b1147c5612938458a4ed94b1bb64373d
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "That's not funny Sarah, they'd whip me if anyone heard you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1af1121b1b9c2ac2ca33533391406484
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "That's not funny."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2a3803778d288bab4e0ecfafd5501459
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's not happening."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 64938804e3ae539bfc058fb77a65ce80
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "That's not how I meant it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 037c1dab8870c6cf90ec64953921f2ae
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's not how I recall it. Wasn't it the other way around?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: f4dfb704940095e83fa19cdfd0520d7e
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "That's not how I remember it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6346527cf90bbb7ba74d45e209e01a02
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "That's not luck, that's fate. Fate brought you right to my doorstep."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6b8859b1d7b8271580c18367892eb01a
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "That's not my story to tell, Sarah. If I did, he'd kill me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 763cd2946cf2888b579e3d1c1b1a91bf
msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "That's not possible, commander."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0eaf0503d62de846750c2b98b6c44ea6
