#. uid: b5d9d4fdda7745098b64fe6f7767d516
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The door opened and a man stood in the doorway."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c1dffa8f77a16c8ac626fcbb1968620d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The door opened and one of the soldiers stood in the opening."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 34915f2fe9ca710967c18a5deda10474
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The door slowly opened and she saw her husband nervously enter."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e790f2e568a6b6945cd85af8e5b57ef4
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The door slowly opened."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cbf7b027111a0811fd2ced6a2b5ed07d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The door swung open, as if by itself. Or perhaps it really did just move by itself."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3524d0f943110a80798db745c321997f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The door to her cage swung open as the orc unlocked the hatch."
msgstr ""

#. uid: dcaeb82913be872856170f6ccea3d188
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The door to her cell flew open and the creature stepped in."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 311de5a393cee50521c0c71b4075f001
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The door to the cart flew open. Sarah stared up and saw Jaeid standing in the doorway."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9b9bb2a783e55ce2bc6d6b4faa28acbc
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The door to the cart flew open. Sarah stared up and saw the officer standing in the doorway."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0e00e660acfbb8c280988ec98883797a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The door to the house opened and Marius' father stood in the doorway."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 47a2c0291a5e8240e34a38d9df0a8fbf
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The door to the main hall burst open, each frame slamming into the walls. The sound echoed through the hall and a gust of wind was carried in."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 89ef27a5f56b22633f1357c900dc293b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The door to the room exploded open and Samayra flew in, full of frantic energy."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1bb034b1bc340f35d49aa8ae1895a1c3
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The door to the wagon opened."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 89c3992e57c04d8e95a4becef16e3d81
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The door unlocked and softly swung open."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b51543d898b30fc8f5528ce9846b8570
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The door, unlike most of the castle, seemed in somewhat decent condition."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8a4f45dcaab33967e4833ef9c605b00f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The downside had been that though she had been able to call on the many noble houses, and rally their men to her flag, most of these men were not trained killers."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 472e60b8e29d7702e288dbac15fb2dda
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The downside of soldiering were the endless days of hard work, but the upside were the bodies that such a lifestyle produced."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5bd810cca47cf808f4981d7f182886bc
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The dreamstalk had pushed them further than each had thought possible, and she could feel her muscles screaming as if they were on fire."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 81127bd45de5573298755ea992d4528a
msgctxt "speaker:Hugh"
msgid "The dreamstalk? Oh sure."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fbda766e52a3d57b8eefda8f38d2aec5
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The dress had been the last tangible part that connected her to Rosanna. A gift from her father."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c2bc7e7e5dbb6c119d779d778fa524d8
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The dress had begun to stick to her body more and more."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7bc78ea1ad38bde6273f3fb5d0301987
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The dress was perfect."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 33da43d6c94f07ca5c0ad0576b05da79
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The drink, she now understood. The faint purple colour of it..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6146e538e3f357dad32eaf7c18bcea03
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The drool from her mouth, sliding past his shaft, running down her own chin."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9887004d10eade99b559b392cfc44a9d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The dry wood from the shore proved easy fuel, and before long, the campfire blazed."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7f5f97bccd88cd24dac630f92f7c0128
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The duke paced about for a few moments."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 22e2f199e979202e35b88f699fba308f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The duke sat back down."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b42bd386b308c3827ba8fbc0080c84fe
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The dungeon was a cruel place for an adult, she feared what it might do to those too small to even understand why they'd be kept there."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9a1b65c35559a2cc02770c0f20b5fc7f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The earlier feeling is nothing compared to what Sarah is feeling now"
msgstr ""

#. uid: eff1b6bab605e5ec05a278aeef267b29
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The earliest reports of the Mythran invasion had solidified."
msgstr ""

#. uid: aafc9a961869e390fbaec2a769292133
msgctxt "speaker:Kravel"
msgid "The earliest reports showed Hassar's armies moving into the eastern districts. We've still not received any confirmation on whether they actually did, nor the size of his army."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 900d06e02cc7cbd2e67d184ea97368b0
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The early movements of the market, coming to life."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a466a03265388569db2a38ef19ea574b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The earth itself roared from the violence as explosions racked the ruined street of Lethram."
msgstr ""

#. uid: eca677032a52b7abefa359816fcb3941
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The earth rushes up towardsh her and Sarah closes her eyes."
msgstr ""

#. uid: af8ffed3671e0eeabdb5d97eed4a4fb2
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The earth upon which it sat, as dead as the sky under which it labored."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f7bb039de7e052d111d30b5740de9518
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "The eastern districts are far, but that's for a regular army."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a88c1c03a536a456896e333560ed2a83
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "The eastern tribes are famous for their horses. In their army, every man has a horse, most have multiple."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 79ecbfe1d8eef48d0f335b480b0d4b7d
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "The eastern tribes like to boast. I think it's too soon to waste real resources chasing some phantom."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c5cd5f9b83e488f26ea0f1eedf4b2d6d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The echoes of her own moan, vibrating through the room, through her own body."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 27273ccb601e2380efe17b86e87c64a4
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The echoes of the ravenous appetite were heard all through the room."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ce0fddf20bb997a4b29c72219758e4b2
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The echoes of their sex still ran through her mind, even as she clumsily got dressed again."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7c75e965eb868f523dc6bab947f26bf1
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The echoing sounds of Samayra's pleasure began to arouse Sarah even more. She could feel her own sex begin to burn."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 75b7e9188c1003da42389285de3d59e0
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The edges of her vision seemed to blur, and the ground under her feet began to shift."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1f290ed9c8ea537bc7fee083e3c3f791
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The edges of the rag cut into the corners of her mouth as he pulled on it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e23508a48d87568bb7619afd55be18bf
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The edges of the room, which had seemed so flat and unadorned, now warped and bend back into themselves."
msgstr ""

#. uid: dfcc45a3b81883e55fa6d69ebb7e3a29
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The edges."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6fe5e7a55569041009158a8826302b26
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The effect created a loud slicking noise that echoed on the walls."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 87fa54647bd7e4d6656a00ab92856814
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The effort of blasting through the stone had exhausted them, not to mention the fight with the creature."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d933fe2e403dbc82062ef612d1598bfe
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The effort was bad enough, but the desert heat made it worse."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 39a962b2216f0e2f595325fa0e260a31
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The electric jolt rocked her body, dominating all other sensations, as she finally got what she wanted."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 29bda91a517b53d148af1442f53dd196
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The embers of pleasure in her chest had now grown into a fire."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 586fb7ab860e2882456122da2f40f926
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The emissary bowed low one last time."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8678a5019279a03e6d130356ebbc75c5
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The emissary had been sent on his way, but every member of the council knew that his threat had not been empty."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c899f66f1d4fcb356c5991d34cf3dbc3
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The emissary let out a sigh."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5049dfc05e41cb5fae76de78ffa5c3c9
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The emissary nodded."
msgstr ""

#. uid: dc02812d352e0ce8aefb6b20da25694b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The emissary reached into a bag and pulled something out."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f3b32a05c701bc791d28d52870d803d3
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The emissary stood up."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 66beb4c9879e64129a521882cea05766
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The emissary threw the head halfway up the stairs, where it remained, delicately balanced."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 821041d84d8e1a37605a67a40652e03b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The emissary wildly waves his hands around and is screaming at the men. Sarah can't understand the language, but his intent seems clear."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 671523c4ccf65ba44e789296c92019b5
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The emissary."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8dd4a0679600beb20fe65614f7e5a727
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The emotions quickly fade and gave way to anger."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4e862495d8a012c2b59acb8f6868024c
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "The empire fell into chaos as it sacrificed everything to fight back against the tide."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ed1eec579480b4acf4e0db56e7073b53
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The empire that it represented, likewise, possessed no equal."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5933c93328df4b93118996613a6fb3ab
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "The emptiness of this room was a torment to me, but the short relief of your visits only makes that torment deeper."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 15b2f5bed0ad909f0db40d5f659f5a1d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The end of harvest season, the farmers would retreat to their homes and take to other works."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6784afa2a074b81da477a1d6d046f381
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The end."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3f858fc5190075053b4679e981323f5b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The ending to the story drawed nearer."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6ba56ade1f962129ed402d058fe66c0d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The endless dunes gradually gave way for fields of grass."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7485e9ea3d21ce42f5e72a3f2f0e477c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The endless exhaustion that never quite left her bones and muscles."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7ce22b276131c308e41ca829e3cb8896
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The endless hordes of inky fiends crawled and flew and dragged themselves towards the city."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6987a6e6b3465fa841167c5a69964117
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The endless march."
msgstr ""

#. uid: caecf8228db0f63003b7e7005e268af6
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The enemy returned fire with a volley of archers, but their arrows reached only half the distance, if even that."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d3fc339cf66229b609c13cc4a02edabf
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The enemy's defense had collapsed, and what archers were left on the walls had either dropped their weapons or were too stunned to to pick them up."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a2b71a9db8a590879ba39514a219e9cc
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The energy in the room condensed into the palm of Samayra's hand."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7956a2ead1eb6dedecf15dd4573ad9bc
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The energy she'd left behind to guide her way back to the door through which she had come."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 87c4f2b3fce6ee61170c70eb015da3ac
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The engineer nodded."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7ad80e205e66ed5c7cc83d6a95c26162
msgctxt "speaker:Barion"
msgid "The engineering corp informs me that the higher water levels have eroded the foundation of the city's walls along our coastal flanks."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7a279133ef7d910658e7bcfc39f88036
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The enthusiasm Dalia displayed from before was nothing compared to now."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a4671f7aa84d0a6ada99a3a12b46476d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The entire bed shook as he fell into it, their children shreaking somewhere in between joy and fear."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d36b45c2390852073e99d77068bfa66c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The entire castle was ransacked, everywhere, statues had been broken, paintings torn apart, paperworks strewn across the floor."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9118fe20792db4ac075913559ae2a223
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The entire city erupted into violence, all at once."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 93c66c3df7208583b2b56080c3185218
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "The entire city is one giant weak point. It won't be long before the Mythran forces realize that, then their entire army will follow."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3a129ff263fc45b7af2a22ec03d5d281
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The entire city was celebrating, her soldiers and her people alike."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ec31c5cd991d059df50578732830be97
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The entire house roared and trembled as the magical energies clashed."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3318a6f7f12e2f2fd0cbc06779d05d0d
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "The entire reason for this army to be out here is to secure it and support the archeological staff from carrying out their excavations."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d0993ecd10268cd0ae6cdb47b5a3f5d4
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The entire room of sycophants burst out into laughter."
msgstr ""

#. uid: afd1e1f10aa98b8378cc78d2ba09a2a8
msgctxt "speaker:Hassar"
msgid "The entire sanctuary is private. Each room is no different from any other in that regard."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1fee89c515385c232f2c72df4731f218
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The entire table shook from the violent force with which the Daemon ravaged Dalia."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 584ba91f4dd777239236a32fdf3b075e
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The entrance to the western wing of the palace, the only way in or out."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1b2c15b08632b59fc35b67b45482bb55
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "The essential parts of the monolith are imbued in you, and I can travel with it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c6619566defae4b5ec2b2db4cde4d236
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "The eternal court, they call it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 13408166029a746c29fed3b9290c93bf
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "The eternal court?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 663c288b3184bbd7f03665b5ca3855f8
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The evening carried on, but Marion's departure had signalled to most of the other nobility, that they could leave without facing scrutiny."
msgstr ""

#. uid: bf17b5b1d163e179450418a1194e3e81
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The evening passed quickly and before she knew it, she and the others were called up to the main hall."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d3f52d73cd5715b8b03361fa1d7c74cc
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The event had exhausted her and she soon found the sleep that had eluded her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ab6b3b62e0a4e1a1c5500953ccc3a5df
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The event had shocked Sarah, both for how she had not expected it and how she had rejected the moment she had prayed for so many times."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fccc1390f3432a4e1ccd77c706096ace
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The events and stories depicted within, while fictional, may be triggering to some audiences."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b0bc17dc569cd532017ee1fd3c10055c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The events earlier that day, the Tribesman at the market..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b1e462cb99140a182fa352ac3a5d9c37
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The events had caused a rift between them and Sarah suspected that it would probably never heal."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9c1491c72c6c74f1c6a84ade6d767fee
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The events of only a moment ago now feeling like a strange dream."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4906866062eebcd0eccc16a32fa42983
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The events of that morning were still fresh in her mind."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 29ace7b34636aa8e4b151a4f37865e9c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The events of that night had shook her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 29defce938248a0383f5f531ec3faa71
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The events of the day proceeded. Priests read out the last rites. Some spoke words of comfort."
msgstr ""

#. uid: db96b5614183c903472b50daedcb55c7
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The events of the night before were present on her mind."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c62c26899e61ff24270f59aa6d59aa87
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The examinator began pushing forward, swinging wildly, trying to break free from the corner."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d9984708e80a2b36c756f89ee7e3b9fc
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The examinator only rose one arm, and threw up his thumb."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 633406eae24104f036970a5187e47320
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The examinator pulled his arm back, before releasing a sweeeping blow aimed at Sarah's midriff."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6fd61eedaaecb79dc33999309be00a9c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The examinator released another blow, same as the last, but this time, Sarah was ready."
msgstr ""

#. uid: eaf0025bd490206bf9b5fa7628d38c15
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The excess of the moment appeared to Sarah as some kind of fantasy. The one thing that seemed odd, was the expression on his face."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6797f5c076ca2b3a94ff2a5b7db621a5
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The excuse to get out of the house for a moment. Walk the streets of the city. Feel ordinary, if only for a brief moment."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 124e0f6c3b1c50e5ff1add57afc764a9
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "The excuse...to hurt me?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2fc5b740e488b9e9f1518930ef402088
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The exhaustion had forced her to sleep, but the crude shaking of a cart now roughly woke her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7bd34cd03754cdf95439747c8702efe7
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The exhaustion in their bodies, almost luring them into deadly sleep."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3bc4f769b584a8faecd8303f37909576
msgctxt "speaker:Thomas"
msgid "The expectations that people seem to have. They come up to me, asking me to weigh in on one problem after the other."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9a150dbab18bd3af3369087b94a41b53
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The experience proved likewise useful for the reverse."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 419df66246920a5d1db129503066ef22
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The explosion of screams was louder than anything Sarah had ever heard in her life."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 917f9fc43a4735e8535d17264be3dda7
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The explosion was blinding."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 45ab1585250e62e563929d7894c90594
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The extra training, combined with Sarah's continued effort had yielded its results."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 034354cf1945ff26764cea80890b95c8
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The fabric filled up her mouth, making it hard to say anything, but more importantly, Mary had warned her it would keep her from hurting herself."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 777877753a5641e9cdd5fad2b5dc1863
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The fabric of her dress ripped easily, down from the shoulder into the midpart."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9322552ba5f71f07bf8add905b03a876
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The fabric was coarse and brushed roughly up against her skin."
msgstr ""

#. uid: dc63a6fac6be45fd6c890d6da64dad90
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The face he had made when they had spent a deep winter, out in the courtyard, throwing snowballs at one another."
msgstr ""

#. uid: eae296d531fdd8d8bfadde3c330bd1f4
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The fact that Kate had a way of pulling her out of her inward turn, forcing her to remember to exist in the present."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d864376ffaf6e619a3261e7e12bb28cf
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The fact that a man so wicked carried so many blessings, was perhaps the greatest proof of an unjust world."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c6022c85ed0997f63e3e9c53c6370795
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The fact that by most estimates, they should have reached the city of Nauyziri by now."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0503a11a5a2fe2f1239a2767aba506d5
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The fact that each of them was so naked seemed not to trouble her all that much anymore."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f166af0811998454a6145d942f25bb74
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The fact that it was him, of all men, him, made Sarah lose herself to the moment."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e3950e019d478d8f7a607671f706674c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The fact that she hated him somehow had the opposite effect on her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 98108c5bfac3b8f610e89233fd43c944
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The facts of the night before still lingered between them, poisoning any conversation they could have with this awkwardness."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0c0ad03ea7ae4eb4ff338183f4c5e5a8
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The faint black marks slowly faded with each repetition."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 76f9533ff92dcfb2ef9ba1591d060469
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The faint light still seemed to pour into and dissapear into its scales."
