#. uid: e47d84408dd49c645ddcf9de4cf8cbc6
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Too far up, she could do nothing to aid her own soldiers."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0ac6078dfe249453cabfd5607ea6e49c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Too focused on marching, she could feel her cracked lips, parched from lack of water."
