#. uid: 83b14dbd6f833a5d67e520b701b28c3b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Up her arms, along her shoulders, down between her breast, across her nipples, down her stomach."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0425840a0dd9416070394c4f15cdae37
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Up on the wall, Sarah saw her family."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 96be7bc549bd6504aac1f7a87ad5a3cf
msgctxt "speaker:Matthew"
msgid "Up on your feet, prisoner."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fb915504c19d1505c5798b67c2678007
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Up so close, she had mistaken the stone and metal for a wall, but now as she looked up, she saw that they were in fact a gate."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1abee9111d18628cfeecf0eff139cff4
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Up the ladder! Keep moving!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 01f4c5a9b027ad856926283867e65932
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Up the ladder, now!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: fa95983ba7e7d6c923533800159c677e
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Up the plank, across the deck and down into the heart of the ship. It surprised Sarah how fast they went from the bustling streets to being alone."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 99d66f7ce55315c168bdd5cb569c8ed9
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "Up till Gallow's Creek nobody will mess with a cart like ours, but further up along the old road, there is no telling what can happen."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6e76b8b4498ca681614f101f0d2f31af
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Up until...I suddenly didn't anymore. When you came into my life and filled it with a wonderous chaos."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4d902f9030bd7cdbe662ebc34d4b7d8d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Upon being rejected, Kate fell to her knees. The bottle slipped from her hands and rolled away."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8502c769435f2bb7a0231ec7b44c0fac
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Upon discovering that she could sing, it wasn't long before each of them began to demand a performance."
msgstr ""

#. uid: dee7754cfe9cacf14e1330e62520c8a2
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Upon hearing her friend's name, she crawled out the tent, followed shortly after by Caleb."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 731580c9309be917489116d16ef2dd1b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Upon her sex, she felt his magical mark, burning into her skin, compelling her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8468b787638b3990943d27dc38552a9d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Upon his passing, Sarah and Mary inherited their freedom from him, as well as the house."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 24baf18f2826380724c42242fd35292c
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Upon securing this glory, they are elevated from their human form to that of Noctori."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b4409d0a6fc6588e5a349cab8ec7a6f3
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Upon seeing her, everyone in the room stood up."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5bfaf38584f5aab56c9f7e3fc96ca564
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Upon the back of each man and woman now balanced a weight as great as they could manage."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 054d7512d8003e7361b81cca9702758e
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Upon this command, Sarah could see the smoke began to swirl, revealing the spirit's uncertain form."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 36132281b367c6ac3ea258b7314ce149
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Upper class girl, taught all her life to be proper and prim. But deep down you just want all the things you're not supposed to."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8bddbf3f081c308f4edc3988f8e55dcf
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Urgent news? More attacks from the Tribes?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 692f1abbd920d0877e156af5ff5a9fb6
msgctxt "speaker:Damian"
msgid "Us?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 692f1abbd920d0877e156af5ff5a9fb6
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Us?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0efbc7e36bdbef0f0ae27b7b41075273
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "Use the force of my blow to strengthen your feet, instead of going off balance."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 827da5870ea66287d98488739314abe4
msgctxt "speaker:Hassar"
msgid "Use your mouth for now, it will prove sufficient."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 96ce7a24102da3cf12ac153a765ef1fd
msgctxt "speaker:Oryon"
msgid "Used our magic to sway the course of battle?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: c44793100a50623cc752f5c392340e60
msgctxt "speaker:Mary"
msgid "Used to be most slaves came from the far east, but now you see our kind by the bundle, dragged around the markets."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8176c749f75a2eed423e72b580d39eac
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Used to have a few spots, but if they're really chasin me down, odds are they might go lookin for us there too."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1857977a988c80b131885abbb0bd5615
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Ushered away by the servants, they arrived back at Sarah's room."
msgstr ""

#. uid: aed8a85c735419585df78682e39f282a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Using Carolyn's connections among the refugees, but common and noble alike, she gathered nearly a hundred people."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ba12818efec11d4241d4749c146eabb5
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Using her body as leverage, he leaned closer forward and began to thrust."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e5ba495fe26a5c4003d72b1423e0ccd2
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Using the narrow streets of the capital to their advantage, they hoped to compensate for their smaller numbers."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fcb3199ab14c55fd329ea51bd6f58ccd
msgctxt "speaker:Ramsey"
msgid "Usual rate is about ten Mythrani to a night, but I can make you a discount."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8c722606c4ef930238457a6cb6778b9a
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Usually I march with my men. Make camp with the others. There is always some noise, anywhere you go."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4c141dd5f55a3ad71a950594ab2df262
msgctxt "speaker:Female Soldier"
msgid "Usually dead ones though."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4c141dd5f55a3ad71a950594ab2df262
msgctxt "speaker:Male Soldier"
msgid "Usually dead ones though."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a8de409228061105dc00ae955718bf15
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Usually she'd have been angry at him for his coarse language, his crude remarks. Now he just seemed amusing."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3d5d61ef1f8998956aa1326ebe5975aa
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Usually, Kate's voice was strong, but now, it was soft and weak."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 13137c1ebbf15f014a9d06fe0a96eacc
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Usually, it was Vaelen who would undertake such meetings, but she had no idea where he was."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e1d50e2f9a5d4922aff11c7746e885b0
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Usually, out on the road, such repairs were a small matter."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ad8477eb235ae066ac2f52b70c301915
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Usually, she would have spoken with Thomas, but he was gone now."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6bc8aa893f2eed0709909f120e73016f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Usually, she would have."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a86a30692f7827b436259c9a18e6fd40
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Usually, the castle was filled with life, a coming and going of nobles and commoners, each with their own reason for seeking an audience."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 65f7bb29b09e0c20b82ecfd7dfabe22d
msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "Usually, the tracks we find are a bit up ahead, but we won't find anything tonight. Best we stay to camp."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f9953cd695cb98b1a8ff2b22dfce7f61
msgctxt "speaker-name"
msgid "Vaelen"
msgstr ""

#. uid: ac70e81642621cb0b0d0f0424bc35e22
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen and Cassius drew into a fighting stance, raising up their weapons."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d303ffd577089be666aece392c0e7d64
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen breathed out only blood; his broken head spilling something more of himself."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7ef5282764815ce3daa97bc6076466b0
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen continued his pace, leading her further along the halls of the western wing, down towards the far side."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ddf4f580bb7929921c31d4c0ec5fd8b7
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen didn't answer her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ead6db681fcb60aec3f7ee8e9fcbf07b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen didn't turn to face her, continuing to stare into the distance."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1c1b1785f4400d130577442163d65f52
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen embraces Sarah."
msgstr ""

#. uid: bb07f15b6419b08a820987fe9bb92e35
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen frowned."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4b71f521aaa40d04e67772b703acf08e
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen gestured at her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 850dd1d73f0d5d64b9e758b3f7735875
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen gestured out ahead. He didn't need to say much more."
msgstr ""

#. uid: aafe626c78704b1dc481687af2862707
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen gestured towards a lamp that hung besides the door."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b56e89a0b8fed3bf6124ad303c1f092e
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen gestured."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 48278e0e240a37c47362e06d9b6aa1d3
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen gestures at Kate."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c3478e0441da5a1b9007ab168b6deb0f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen glared at her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7a230a57748bf8997eac50c2fb80f063
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen glared at the both of them."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 47cdda7788947dca2821ed4f5230fffe
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen greeted her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 80fbcfadc17c230a46fe86311b0aee95
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen had been born in the Mythran Southlands. Poor, inhospitable and impoverished."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2d27cf3e6d77a5d8b33077b75d34fa6c
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Vaelen had called an early meeting, there's a change in plans."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8cd258ff2dafd306c9ef86f1d94c5211
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen had given Sarah some rough schematics to study, showing the quickest route to the palace, but little more than that."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 581ee9b343ea93c30c672b863a3f95c6
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen had ordered a last meeting before the attack on the city."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 387afbc99f14057e3269ad5b6244cae7
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Vaelen he was...being an asshole."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3e4ede635239acee853880076a4c4bde
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Vaelen he...meant a lot to you. He meant a lot to me too. You shouldn't be so hasty to close off your heart."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 67d129b3a39027572996808aa4fa4ab5
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen held up Sarah's contract."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 46f95dad86353862d273ef6bd638a0f0
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen kneeled next to her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 34405525e8981537f28adc648225ca23
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen knew her position on the cruelty of war."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 19a2aa9809a28c4c490d17e94d80f58a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen laughed."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1e353794211a94e26d358aec0b3a4cbb
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen laughs."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e146ab2c695480ff3bab6b408e5ae463
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen leaned back into his chair, his hand stroked his chin."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cc92cad294708a5b2ec7cb9fa68bdd55
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen leaned forward and sprawled out a map in front of Sarah."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9b16b9fc7c5f6cba6dc2dca99ca536bc
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen looked around, studying the construction."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 346af2c6a9ab7e92f4434aedadf9da2d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen looked up from his desk."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ba280295f4e5a775a17835597c3606c5
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen looks at Sarah. She sees an odd mixture of surprise and sadness in his eyes."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 63b0e47a315f18d7a9006e70c59a9934
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen loved being up on the stage, to hear himself talk. Sarah hated almost every moment of it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 91ea9fe1e1e2f61e6918e3aab3cd3673
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen lunged, swiping his blade at her wildly."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c818860087774b592e77eba8d5f5f9cd
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen muttered something in stunned disbelief."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1df6190703df0349a1c1599d785c5c4b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen never asked her what it was. Perhaps he didn't care, perhaps he understood she didn't feel like telling him."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8c24468e56e2849125ea564026fcbf54
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen nodded as his eyes remained transfixed on the stone."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2d8a98a3cc4c9370aee536281cc55654
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen nodded."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 53aba831382cba276acfc24951ebb15b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen paused before answering."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a89243b0493e2984d4d389701255b226
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen paused for a moment, before nodding."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1f6bc04743f44333d1c4f18a0cfb3135
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen paused for a moment, considering his words."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 12d60ae6f2f3acd2ca69a6781d866acb
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen paused for a moment."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fdb583bb48f4433d6f36665d73835d0e
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen placed his finger on a small dot on the map, further east than even Bagrad."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f3751ad1abaabcdb34c530a861a5c435
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen pointed directly at Sarah."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cf1bb14da3876fc67e3ae0cc3dba89e6
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen pointed his finger angrily towards Gideon."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c982a80e404566a097850d14bf9598c1
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen pulled a torch from the wall and held it up, leading the way."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0785c7cc4803a7233e96b354e05055e7
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen pulled his sword from the earth."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 36ba3a695a7a303f20788fc4fd1e6766
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen pushed a sheet of paper from his desk towards Sarah."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ed35f96f531b711ff7df6a22b7987a40
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen quickly continued to another topic, but Sarah continued to observe him and weigh his words."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 92605d879ef68292810288ee59868d65
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen raised himself up."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9e9ca6cd5ea0f70c5db2b76398a398a1
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Vaelen ran him through with his sword, over nothing!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8dc3b13e86ec654d5809fb9afa9db25b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen rasped his knuckles across the desk."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ccab79ae3cc1d6f400dab0090fb51d3f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen rolled the map up again."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e62557bdfa78449258e2adeaac89e5c3
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen rubbed his temples."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cc5e8f97b42dcd4f80f36cd40ae41b54
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen rushed towards Cassius who had his back turned to him."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7a2ad24d7153649009329c84756a86b7
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen sat up straight."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9a1652aecd5328323f6017ac232920ab
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen scratched his neck, trying to ward off the unrelenting heat of the desert."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c457ffd9a1062e7df59bd072db074ab9
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen seized the chain and held the woman in her place."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9c98c56f48b99e02f433d1ff058723df
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen shook his head."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a7d5182e00a19eaca2e48c0000c59cb5
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen shrugged."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7ab6a4bb1a66f2baf8303315cd7c67eb
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen sighed."
msgstr ""

#. uid: df7630a4eca7ee1872f8d27310447f84
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen slammed his fist against the table."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ab395ff89cddebe02ab6c74cb3ed82d9
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen smiled, but he seemed without joy."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3ce5529a14bee76c093f759d757c4e90
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen smiled."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 282ca80f4e848ec3ba521709caf68a7e
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen snapped his finger at the soldier."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c4282d7bd3add59ad7b0db3fd1bc5b0d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen spat on the ground near Cassius."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c0ced2ed154d7f7d6ee90d10e54a3067
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen started to walk, motioning for her to keep up."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6b38f375ca335c5315d29fe8fff965aa
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen stood up and walked to the other side of the desk. He placed a hand on Sarah's shoulder."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 90d003e63efa894cb890ff423c1416f9
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen stood up, walked around the table and grabbed Sarah by the shoulders."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 43a36de5c687ad89b8e81729fc20f510
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen stormed past them."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8336819d336c982235313347f5ee40e3
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen suddenly looked up."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 649fa553ca483e222812d93882bf306e
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen tapped the map on his desk."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0f96e68f6f40ac80c2e8472ccbe997b7
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen threw up his hands."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a4a2697d0d3db812d8587dc371a1a951
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen thrusted his sword, spun and swiped at her, lunged."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d47e76d8f7f4ac7dccd29c0f657e96dc
msgctxt "speaker:Camp Guard"
msgid "Vaelen told me himself, keep the blonde girl in the pretty dress from leaving."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2fd19d55cc34144bc245b71cdb712150
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen took Sarah's hand and pulled her to her feet."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 04dd3b0b61e00f7bfb65646b699bea2b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen turned a corner, following him, Sarah suddenly found the room expanding in a every direction."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3ab94ef73f01ab300a4340b537eea3ff
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen turned specifically towards Sarah."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d73167ea634f542981874f58769dbe8e
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen turned to Cassius."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9d178f98f53212ca0f77507cbf7d1913
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen turned to face her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 00849c436f5f8479552c2a2b5f17c73c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen turned to her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fc8fc8e54c7b91486f8f09e4d82d0a6b
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Vaelen wants to speak to you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ebb6fae65eacc38b5e21eeed226553c6
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen was a skill fighter in his own right. Not the greatst that the army had ever since, but certainly better than most."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 829f438ab5ae229157cacd09041ef956
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen was hunched over his map, not bothering to even look at her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c9b87b5d3aa9ef24881fc6a05d562a22
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen was quiet, as if this was supposed to mean something to Sarah."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 69b43430d289e4062b54126563a13f48
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen was sitting behind his desk, papers strewn about."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9c94522257f3cf6250eeb3fab7733c71
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen waved his hand, dismissing the concern."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b530749c47041b7ba7d57c06895ef210
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen went over the strategy for the attack. The Mythran army would lead the main charge, and the Brothers of Providence would seize the walls and take small positions inside the city."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 034dcdc635a890013c7ab14e752c1e61
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Vaelen!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 58e9b3fea68d682b1449279cd13e316d
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Vaelen! Wait!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1e6ab1ee7fb1515bc8c9d400b5d62e8d
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Vaelen!!!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 011c690fd499a0a7c7118c6c2c00ca95
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen's behavior ever since Bagrad had troubled her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 743a62f0cbe3e3c65058c1be1437826a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen's blade slid of Sarah's, and she ducked underneath his arm."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3f1404ef8768300fddc0e00dd82d17df
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Vaelen's blood curdled scream followed."
msgstr ""

