#. uid: 76b5b01cab4d04e3dd3e06ac25d5a6a1
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where before they chanted Cassius' name, they now also chanted Sarah's, and with each chant, her name grew louder."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c41d531aebf7eae1d28fd5ee49355fc7
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where before they had been undersupplied, now the city bordered on starvation."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e0bcaa53679e2f596b09d8bbe8667af5
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where before they had just been the heirs to the throne, now Thomas was actually king, and it made all the difference."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3778055fa5a7b17c99c128915d5e887e
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where before, she thought she had a plan, she new felt her own saliva, dripping down the side of her mouth, down her chin."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4ab96ed410cff0f2c5d56f1f2e0b5fec
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where before, the gambling houses were hidden in alcoves and alleys, they now seemed to sprawl out onto the streets."
msgstr ""

#. uid: dd2c5e682ae6dae30d681bfc6b09a12a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where before, there had been a grace to his movements, now he swung with reckless abandon."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e6db1ea456c3e690aa208b9e8b3ae642
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Where can we find these guys?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5ba4dd93441899d06a6e8205a2e35f3e
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "Where did he go, exactly?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9f5059a761696686f122d36e56974b79
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where did her body end and the water began?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 056007af0b292a242ab9b0ce5bc21fb7
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where did she know it from..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 012d38894e54afc5c1c8fd11ea964ef1
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Where did they go?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 88139891194c168a80d4a4350880522c
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Where did you go..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 10bc30c88ee763dfc57e7587d51039c4
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Where did you go?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 43ecfbb7c429e3cb6b28edc3db90fa12
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Where did you learn that?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8332dea1483f063ab885bcafb3968ccd
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Where did you learn that? The streets too?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 17c2d71b9ad1109f3bf917fd715f21e9
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Where did you learn to fight like that?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: f4c05366dcb1f130121e1fc853ab72bb
msgctxt "speaker:Hecate"
msgid "Where did you see it?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: b4447cbc22b37180ba344f309d6d2c40
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Where did you throw it away?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: f9b633fa48e87e153fb634893b967bb6
msgctxt "speaker:Dio"
msgid "Where do these soldiers come from?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: e0a4b54f8e3976331ffc15dda88eb4fd
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Where do we go from here?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: e01d750320a8c1826aa76e296eae02ed
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Where do we leave it to be disposed of?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5a0ffa69fcaad55b54f5bda4c9c3b6f8
msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
msgid "Where do you hail from, Sarah?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: ac6fd3efabe9ffbf29103eebb290c7d2
msgctxt "speaker:Nickolas"
msgid "Where do you sleep?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1ffb94903bda45d9189c21fba3aea8d4
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Where do your loyalties lie?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: b2c42936a62117de53e1cf45a75e85bb
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Where does he go?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3b074952f473785883a78a9ac7936cc7
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Where does it lead?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 23867f69d19aa112ea3e5d2a711f1484
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where each year, Marius would set out to the fields again, working himself to the bone."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5ad9623c077ededa041e72aab537fac4
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where first the soldiers had cried out against it, hurled their insults, there was now only a brooding hatred for the thing."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 673adf012dfab4d7c9057faf01546e32
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where had Lady Carolyn come upon this?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0da137b50c50c3a3c834768e83eeb0d9
msgctxt "speaker:Daemon"
msgid "Where have those defiant eyes gone now?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 88e258f41f72c2ecdd323d17947f5e28
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where he skillfully dodged and stepped past each branch or bush, she seemed constantly bogged down."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a4d0771f13e6b46c29d654815ec2083f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where her dress felt soft and fragile, this clearly could take a hit."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 189e9f972f7c846557b6238f3251eb48
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where her fingers went, she left traces in the sand."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 32d9a80343f7a84e69ec1ef969e7ae60
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "Where is Sakar?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: fd9bac1733e324ef02edd135954e7687
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "Where is Sarah?!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: c7b412fc8427b1a924d3c14a1f30c195
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Where is Thomas?!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 620bb2c0af53a12852bdfbc28e9c6fbb
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Where is everyone else?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 50ac650ebc223248e7d836a47bc1d1fa
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Where is he taking that woman?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: beeee39596e74661cf2b7df875385a74
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Where is he?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2c6884de172ed590ec9bb9bc2c8ce62a
msgctxt "speaker:Hecate"
msgid "Where is he? Is he here with you?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 58b0917528b451706a748436b04d91df
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Where is it? Where is my stuff."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2a0e873a235aca7ddae5e9437e0a9caa
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "Where is she!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8a8c9aad068cd141fcd6197a9693b497
msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "Where is that from, anyway, your story?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 765ca9d61c0451ba868020d561640986
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Where is the rest of the town?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 601c49e381a9a2e2bd2e596df8dfe1cf
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Where is this place?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: e44b702744c66952fc08673e67bf6a2d
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Where is your War-Sister?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: ff19d8a3f4425f8a0b9061ba5d87f04d
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Where is your friend?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: b0906c0f853b9af8967a463b2fa5bb57
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "Where its mighty roads once stretched to each corner of the world, uniting all the peoples under a single rule, it was now fragmented."
msgstr ""

#. uid: da0171ba9bd1073a68028fe0285d6938
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where locksmiths had no work, because nobody bothered to lock their doors."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2a7da8950a7956bdbdfe54f7f1555bc2
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where mage's walked, the ordinary rules of the world often faded."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f2642ec8ba7c96ae55345f802d35cc98
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where most of the ship was rather sparse, this room clearly echoed wealth."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5674b661f35c8b500227fa3b89a6859c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where on the old road they had often been alone, they were now one of a great many."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e6d1461f10022981f7e2a891fc218356
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where once had been her breath, now lingered Lily's lips."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c3ecb7d39161bff2fa2109f9afdeec93
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where once her thoughts moved quick and sharp, now they moved like legs through mud."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 88a6cef109049b26a3cb4d668db97ba5
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where once she trudged along, struggling through the desert, unable to keep up, she now began and ended each day with a strange serenity."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7e2288209d333538e025828518328922
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where once the fires had been places of celebration, where the soldiers sang and drank until the next day, they were now something very different."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 85bf7a3248f938e03ad1bf4d84805f54
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where once the idea of regular sex with the captain seemed to her like a nightmare, now it seemed to her like a dream."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 033cd592c398d8d78cc27887c854b89e
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where once they dreamed that their leader had instilled in them great purpose and meaning, they now each believed they had thrown in their lot with a madman."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 48317bc9a657ef5c1bd36ccf102de961
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where once they had ruled empires, now they squabbled over who might hold claim over a pretty farm girl that was captured in some insignificant raid on a frontier town."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4eba1be9f46e3aba0c0b418a97fae635
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where one could walk its halls where Gods and Men dwelled together."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ee9f63f380a5a9e410bfd03aad74947d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where one ended and the other began, she could no longer tell."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8875f6d75af81b118a1d9d5c18503aa1
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where she had felt weak, naked and exposed, he seemed almost proud, standing there."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e3201e95c4c44dcdf0214dc916703fdc
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where the Empress had forged two worlds into one..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d3e66e23b6d16ce0fdaa626508e6b18a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where the Empress had laid the first seeds of the Ruin that would follow."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9ffbed7618953b1cc0c267d5fa51efc5
msgctxt "speaker:Gilead"
msgid "Where the Eternal Court resides."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f23873c1b40d423b52c02146ccda8816
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where the pyramid was a construct of darkness, the city was one of light."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1b24f8aebe3926cca66832fbd51de5c0
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where the tunnel was sparse in light and anything but earth, this room is the opposite."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 038853f34ec18d5901fe8a99542bea51
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where they're taking her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1db76e9b9de0b841dfb5e54b728a7d23
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where was any of her proud resistance, she wondered as she leaned in forward, her mouth widening."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c6d12b2c4948391bea660ea00d979bce
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where was her outrage? Sarah searched for it, but could not find it in herself."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6ca222ab2ef63edcabc76dd836d8d3cb
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where was her rage? Her fury? Why did the countless words of anger, remain only inside her heart?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9f5bd1b846d0022d76d3047f69f06ba8
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where was she even running..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 07f3216c741cdb108a6007211caf6b44
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where was the exit? Where had they come from? Everything was a panic and a blur."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ca89d1cb837d013e275917697f1a64db
msgctxt "speaker:Mythran Prince"
msgid "Where was this concern for protocol and politeness when that decrepit creature stabbed my nephew to death?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 63fe034dab723793b47306a7eeb9afec
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where were they? This couldn't be all of them."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9e289cd3fd5bab3e28c3e30115a1ab29
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "Where what?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4c2b03b6bc3f5b8f07fb95061765ad49
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Where white and unforgiving snow had ruled the land, now instead, she saw nature."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 268b34b5ccf3af2727ad9568433bfef6
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Where would that be, exactly?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: cfe74bb677dc53936efea5830a9dd8d8
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "Where you are."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5d8b4f44a2a166bbd9ea779a9f746aa1
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Where you at?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 32c21b7bdcf5651cf96d116db6368881
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Where you try to pretend that you didn't strip for me, or swallowed my load like you were a brothel girl."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 79c6c1aa2ebfa5fad115c7832a89b981
msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "Where's all that lip gone, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5dc75559a51bca9bc54850422064b687
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "Where...where did you come from?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2a795f55803f61b94c4cd08120e0cd51
msgctxt "speaker:Hecate"
msgid "Where?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2a795f55803f61b94c4cd08120e0cd51
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Where?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2a795f55803f61b94c4cd08120e0cd51
msgctxt "speaker:Woman"
msgid "Where?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 528c0e80580bcffef11cd4ffded27bf6
msgctxt "speaker:Official"
msgid "Where? What does that matter! A servant in one house is a servant in another, no?!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9d8d04da341ef78e3425dce3b0836609
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "Wherever I went, I did my best to track down news of you. To know if you were still safe."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 89644c1bab3778f5bca1fd2abdd6cfe1
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Wherever you will go, I'll follow."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2723cdc67630bfdbe51fb2b4a9b809d6
msgctxt "speaker:Kim"
msgid "Wherever you're from...it doesn't matter. You're here now."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2ba783df68342c099e6006d23e958c43
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whether by luck or remaining skill, Vaelen tumbled just in time, the blade only catching him in the upper arm, rather than his head."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7148d176f60363e876927a0973f95246
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whether by nature or by divine hand, Sarah found her wishes come true."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 32c22727844fae38815e4ace490bb3f7
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whether it was the alcohol, or her close encounter with death, it didn't matter right now. She only knew that she wanted him."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c65e88abdeb419940f283e9b2b2af3a7
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whether that was out of hatred for the system of nobility, or whether it was a practical way of dealing with rivals, remained to be seen."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 293761ab955129d36e0e993d3accbba8
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Whew..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2fbff3a57f2e7e956cd97f616b26e3d2
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Which almost definitely meant they'd hear her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ee7613c7261adafb913d05fabfc59b02
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Which also meant they would be more desperate to strike out before their supplies dwindled."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7109a57e76cc817bdb067dcd3202c5bb
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Which are."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a7aad1de77ab13429deaa341166ce3fe
msgctxt "speaker:Curator"
msgid "Which copy would you prefer?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 74d8466b48c6a624fd16bdf7a619158a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Which didn't even account for the fact that, even if she could escape the cage and the camp, that still left the wild lands beyond."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 06501022c0ff887297fb73a0fd2ed68e
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Which includes rejecting you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 44c733ac19b2df74f12e0f31e4741acf
msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "Which is it?!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4b29b81a54f045e32a5f6e724c98f1da
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Which meant that even for an orc, he was strong."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ab0eaa5f108a8b76be95dc8b620b9086
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Which meant that whatever was out there...was close."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 51928288fe132d1060e78aca9ebbe9f7
msgctxt "speaker:Gilead"
msgid "Which of them have rejected the proposal?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 13cfea1b883400064eb1f0a2987750ec
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Which one do you prefer?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 823903c7e0d75ac23fa9003c8657c211
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Which seems to be quite a few times."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8e35c348306241ca529ebc08954b9731
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Which she wanted most of all."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 45c4c2e4ebc933cc1d64e27b585165ad
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "Whichever Thomas decides, they will have to learn to endure."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2012eab46d61dd168640de6dcccce8b4
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "Whichever direction the stone may fall, I shall know that I have prepared the earth as much as I could have."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 13aa955cdbf1521cf0986f3c7db75390
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whichever it was, Sarah could not be certain, only that the feelings of pain were different now than they had been before."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 878fba3d929d940554c4d06d6cad87d2
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whichever it was, Sarah soon saw and felt her husband expending his seed."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 44bc558690a49349292f3edbcc8c52f7
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whichever it was, as soon as they reached the crowd, they attacked with a mad violence."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 67ff16b5e7a32ee9751b99398582cdc6
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whichever it was, the great orc landed with a crash in between her and the Tribesmen."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7689f74c895566e35ea901a2c4dbd317
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whichever pulled on her, was never stronger than now."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5ac24c350b48c6953aed125b7d63cd97
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whichever the reason, it had lulled Sarah into a sense of comforting trust."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f76485d5e42f14d053696d3158cf6b2c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whichever way she looked at this, this was a defeat."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b3aaa7ab6128779af759dab328f766e0
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whichever would come to pass, she would have to make certain that the new political decree would favor the commoners."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 32b3085bff6f5e5ba4ce7a2670352ba8
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whichever would come to pass, she would have to make certain that the new political decree would favor the nobles."
msgstr ""

#. uid: efb47faa1e13067bf7e84e955d81add6
msgctxt "speaker:Kravel"
msgid "While I understand the position of my friend and dear fellow member of the council..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c1acb208489457c5247774cc44f0ed4a
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "While Sarah and her husband laid in bed until the late afternoon, their bodies exhausted from a different kind of labor."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5f050d4b38e57346ed2594a0a85869fb
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "While each of them was reduced to fighting as a single warrior, her army moved as one."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 10e8cb53f4bbdfe828e3ea198833ab08
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "While eating, Sarah caught the goblin glancing in her direction."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 99a3aba62db0fbcbf5f13f507c7dd80f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "While his body had first caught her eye, it was his nature that caused her to sway."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 628194080895072a00f9b8fb7712d2c7
msgctxt "speaker:Kravel"
msgid "While it is true that banditry will undermine the commercial activities in the region, this is only one attack."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 91b1e537c55830dc7c995efefdb2a57c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "While it was no effort to adjust the sails, it had caused the ship's cargo to become unbalanced, requiring a rebalancing."
msgstr ""

#. uid: efac3956f5b75acfbc29e3c7b21154ba
msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
msgid "While nobody escaped it, it seemed to strike all men and women differently."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3725f8cc51f6f82b6e589e37d137a96c
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "While preparing the ship had been demanding work, once out to sea, Sarah noticed that the ship largely carried itself on the wind."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fe309aa8964ab336d8fd9c87c76049d5
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "While she could spot a few guards from the corners of her eyes, they didn't seem to pay them much attention."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b6e592113ebd255e3a0c579e856199e4
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "While she doubted it would ever come easy to him, she had seen some change after the battle against the Tribes."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f271cb69be931fdd2138d2a2ed5c6416
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "While talent from every rank of society is important, some doubt the wisdom of putting a man on the council whose loyalties might be divided between the court and the common folk."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1f8672114f77cb49e29f96e7264888a4
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "While the old system of nobility continued to exist, new laws granted greater rights to citizens of all classes."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 04204b982fe705ea072552cc4c3d9121
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "While the win had settled it, the official declaration followed later that day."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1b808eb8c9145739d03d59f192c98fc9
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whilst she had stood her ground, the examinator had closed the distance."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 37faf83657cbd1cfe402ea5b7c65f2ae
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whilst the old houses had betrayed her, most of the nobility still stood with the Rose family."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 072fbf1d4f58f49c7fa26f82c79b5c83
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Whisper-Rose?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 94f8f13f985f669549c68e92285a55d4
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whispered his name in worship as she rode on top of him."
