msgstr ""

#. uid: db1e52153f0e49868f503304528aed5f
msgctxt "speaker:Jasmine"
msgid "Yeah, I guess that's true."
msgstr ""

#. uid: db1e52153f0e49868f503304528aed5f
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, I guess that's true."
msgstr ""

#. uid: af95d4ffd2fc028abaaed403b3019276
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, I guess you're right. Trusting your idea says a lot about me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1d8e20faa6ec7fa0d39e4653ec3156ce
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, I guess."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1d8e20faa6ec7fa0d39e4653ec3156ce
msgctxt "speaker:Sophia"
msgid "Yeah, I guess."
msgstr ""

#. uid: dc3e8043c8267de576bf328e3922bb82
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, I heard your name before from your father. And I saw you when I got here yesterday."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 86b3fa480ee1c9bb4c2b76b9bc417018
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, I imagine life would be easier for you if I just let it go."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 61f13ba67b195f6ab3c52d3311f6ffab
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, I just dropped it off below deck."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d8dbf06585a1405006d7ebcfe5058c96
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Yeah, I know what you mean. It's been a long time since I've seen any happy drunks."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e5863873af5f955df59080aefaed5d11
msgctxt "speaker:Thomas"
msgid "Yeah, I know, but sometimes it just gets a bit much. Read this, train that, study such. Like, no matter how much I try, I just can't be like him, Sarah."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 70d56a28546fa950ac1fd2c743a142a9
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Yeah, I know."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 70d56a28546fa950ac1fd2c743a142a9
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, I know."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 98e431264e2175d87b3c939ceeefc818
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, I know. I didn't mean anything by it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8913e6e9ebd8563e65c668e77d6fb163
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, I know. I guess I'm still just getting the hang of all this, the sailor life I mean."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 217d61514c05c41d9d2117cb72a7e800
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, I love it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9ba1e824499b258113b882bd5df0a554
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, I mean, years ago. I haven't danced in...Gods, I don't think I can even remember."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9f46c51e326f412c4f3f89a39b4151f0
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Yeah, I missed out on all the classes on how to be a lady, sorry."
msgstr ""

#. uid: bcca4856e619cc490b4c236911e5adc7
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Yeah, I never said this was a good bar."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1b957713c728c10345c412f121c18bf7
msgctxt "speaker:Dalia"
msgid "Yeah, I saw them."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 82ba119745d88c84809560ec9dd92868
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, I see them."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 277d144669a368b55849ae54a85bcde2
msgctxt "speaker:Thomas"
msgid "Yeah, I suppose that might be true. The truth is I'd let them get away with just about anything..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f267c3cfab8e45246f410721567c602c
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, I think I am."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b9c783b7ea12b19499505ef802d7edb9
msgctxt "speaker:Brigand"
msgid "Yeah, I think I can fix this. Follow me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ac10f443691e9f17fdabf98ba159b4af
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, I think so."
msgstr ""

#. uid: eb2cae81d0c4f3f84035ab671a2bce37
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, I underestimated the mobility of the Tribesmen archers."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 104f3c29f8021f93e4e08518bb302ab4
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Yeah, I understand. But you need to relax too sometimes."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 94c788ad1f62e1d0e5967f57410e87db
msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "Yeah, I used to be crazy about them."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5f1be4e75a319c09cf2091e981ea0760
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, I was like that too."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ed466b723fcf6adf3fa56d9eaace30d0
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "Yeah, I was pretty young when I did it, I suppose."
msgstr ""

#. uid: abb36c9baa7ae91eb5b03834d52dd6be
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Yeah, I wasn't much good at most things, so I made up for it with stuff like this. This and dancing, mostly."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 91f65654b9ae3aae16110b067d08cfda
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, I'd get the bottle if I won, and you'd...I would..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9dd243f9c7ea715481dbbd96f3ccb87e
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Yeah, I'll get to seein about that too."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8c11a5d9feec1227b26d8784a4440573
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, I'll grant you that one."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 77c7549e67ea13c84c718687e4a32dc1
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, I'm alone."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 68239f926f9cecfbd17c09fc29d33e61
msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "Yeah, I'm coming along."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 77903df07034607c3195d6e7035d0437
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, I'm still confused about this place..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 43241d15c333042e993d4a621e41a861
msgctxt "speaker:Eula"
msgid "Yeah, I'm sure you're supposed to be here, but I mean more like, in general."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a1f8b827019efff2f2995cf0bca70c03
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Yeah, I've been known to have that effect."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2ab95343acca3bfb210b804adde472c2
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Yeah, I've been out here for a few hours now...I was getting kind of bored."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b9a06e39b3ea7a45bfc61c23b24aa486
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Yeah, a blonde, real stuck up proper type."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f41380cfe5c0996d003c88aeca0d5bba
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Yeah, a little."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f8b05c99e427280221827341b49f259d
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Yeah, all kinds of people go around thinkin wherever they are is the center of the world."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d6dfe9890d11c959b4807f4e769aa3b0
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, as good as I could get, all things considered."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 601c0c51492c269fc9f2ec0aac937a43
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Yeah, blondie. I'd caught him spying on me a few times. He's not as clever as he thinks he is."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b3e09b3804e2c548086c2b8531f26802
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Yeah, blondie?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: a8dfd2f7f79bdbc802dbc8573170196c
msgctxt "speaker:Male Soldier"
msgid "Yeah, but I ain't in a rush."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 999b217cbc5f8b74e293afc3d44a863e
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "Yeah, but Orwen I get. He's like me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0d82307aab758f0020462f9c7162579f
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Yeah, but still."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c719ec2d1c93c42fd234cdddbadf000d
msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "Yeah, but that was before I heard the news."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0c845a2b40cb0d942953257766346876
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, but you understand, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 81f1c3f4b87b3eaff863791b166b932a
msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "Yeah, but-"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 81f1c3f4b87b3eaff863791b166b932a
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, but-"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 097017c6228d38c233f018811f1b047f
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, by standing outside of it, detached."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 52c0f2c480a26b0fe0160d1dcbf74062
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Yeah, can't play Fasthand without a proper bet."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 98ace3bd3003dabd1a27b3ead687c5e5
msgctxt "speaker:Eula"
msgid "Yeah, cause you so fresh-faced you'd actually tell me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9939212889faac20c643e2a59cc42c74
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Yeah, come on!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 00979a8545d787dd94103ba0eeaa1032
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Yeah, follow me!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7498c696becfe33beaa92b263a497616
msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "Yeah, friends..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d60160ae46812841fc13b299ba052817
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Yeah, from what was it...your family owned a horse farm in Rosanna?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 07cdb229a9c8c24d6e8c2fed1f1243b1
msgctxt "speaker:Sophia"
msgid "Yeah, he does. With all of us. But it's not like...what you said!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 19440e2548873c3081188ed0c0179239
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, he got what he deserved."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ba8de97d2a2e404ba03cb18bcd187897
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "Yeah, he likes to do that, talk. He'll talk all day if you let him."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f63466ac4a2d6f02654042d15eec220d
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, he told me it's a safe town. It sounded like the kind of place I was looking for."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b1c263c36557d917ba76812ee87d2e08
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "Yeah, he wanted me to study at the Citadel, but I can't say I was much up for that."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 46391c703df3f44437f80a044a1b9100
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "Yeah, he's not big on transmogrification."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9289441f78c6842de01969f3d973ae28
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, how much for the clothes?! I can't be expected to walk back to my house naked, right?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 693979bcfde974d4a83a645b16219fd0
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, if you don't like fish, this city can be a problem."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a16d6537e075c0935a31ce3505bcf97b
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, in the capital, near the castle."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 73a4ce9c1800266c748a253dbea6b314
msgctxt "speaker:Dalia"
msgid "Yeah, it is."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b9b8f933c097f0c44a6c5d64f025b250
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, it seems to have a mind of its own."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 313ea7a86238a1ac3184fd522a87fd88
msgctxt "speaker:Albert"
msgid "Yeah, it's mine."
msgstr ""

#. uid: eb39898900359290b2fc633f06b789f9
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, it's nice..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 41cd37b1d45b33c0c84bb89ca39b96b9
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, it's too late for that."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 437ef189b3d3aa18161835783e2ce786
msgctxt "speaker:Kim"
msgid "Yeah, it's way too big if you ask me, but then again, if it wasn't I wouldn't have a job."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 48c999b7aca2456f48336ff07a5a0fda
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "Yeah, like I said, it's not as uncommon as you might imagine. Unwanted, accidental alterations."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fa5b25bb7b6c12dc052c38f3d7549f1f
msgctxt "speaker:Eula"
msgid "Yeah, like a weakling."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7e38d6761ea9b63b3950001d7f446e3d
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Yeah, like this!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6330e0a9cfd66e33a1d08f9c4f95637b
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, like...I can just see the road stretch out before me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a1bc5c5fc0fccacfd8431886762d1428
msgctxt "speaker:Jasmine"
msgid "Yeah, maybe I thought it would come in handy one day when you proved to be an idiot again."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 77aab1d7489070211f5c5b6452caf50b
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, maybe that's true. It's been a long time since I cried like that though."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ebf1bf82f678c096ae3cf3d4c3b742fd
msgctxt "speaker:Sophia"
msgid "Yeah, maybe."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f335dd1426a7c632a6aa626317aa204b
msgctxt "speaker:Nickolas"
msgid "Yeah, maybe. I've learned to just roll with it. Some captains are great, others are...less so. At the end of the day, the money is the money."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6200b288ed980920f76bc8dc4468dfae
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, maybe. Well, I learned my lesson I guess."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2a72632d4b418e2b1df76f42fe03fbe0
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, me too."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8021e7499ee6e51321bf80fdccdbeb28
msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "Yeah, my first kill wasn't much to write home about either."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f9b6fc9e597d07cf8815763369a6acca
msgctxt "speaker:Sophia"
msgid "Yeah, obviously."
msgstr ""

#. uid: edcd84a0ffe52a8c00241eec90173022
msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "Yeah, of course, no problem!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 98c2ad27d6b155577b485df22d94ec5d
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Yeah, of course. Why? You thought I'd pawn it off first chance I got?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: a96eff4858e10956d8bdbe4d59bb9d7d
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, on a good day it's no different than all the sand you can see here, just a whole world covered in white."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 798cc077bf81d7b07f831bae33e35278
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Yeah, on paper. In truth, they make decent homes and nobody charges you nothin for it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b3a5aa3f46598947e8acd89e2b40c186
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Yeah, practice and never starving when you grow up."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 696c072c52998adab2a52178a6b5226d
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Yeah, really looking forward to eat..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5ef6f66e8dec92d7659760ed0a8cf6f3
msgctxt "speaker:Caleb"
msgid "Yeah, remember when she just dissapeared for...what was it, seven days? Even I started to worry then, but there she was one day, just back, pretending it never happened."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 575246eb3cf05edc1c0a83cb88d1b476
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, right. We can go back and drink wine if you want."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 218650b0055d1dd89391d42220cc3274
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, she always liked small things."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c690bedea216281ad5cc628ad380f5f0
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Yeah, she isn't the first. It's been going around the camp. Still though, given how small she is..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 40a50aebe6edd958251a565ce7576145
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Yeah, so long as we can pay, they take care of everything we need to survive."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 24d702c87ec67eb7758bab8de8f174f7
msgctxt "speaker:Jasmine"
msgid "Yeah, some like to use it for their slaves."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 26d223bfb4a0abeceafa8bee144d8bd7
msgctxt "speaker:Kim"
msgid "Yeah, some rich girl with noble blood, plenty of poor folk around here that would put a dagger to you for a quick coin."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d368a50c92495db1e041f9d1943f9275
msgctxt "speaker:Dalia"
msgid "Yeah, sorry about the hay...that was all I could find for now."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a0800b218f925db8aba7cd4531b0a6fb
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, sorry, I just got distracted..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1af82b86397ce3858a27b5215033636f
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, speaking of that, shouldn't you be out there, taking your seat? I know you dislike these public events, but it's still important that you show yourself."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d1497197e4940416bee651ac4c1135ba
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Yeah, sure. Maybe some time apart. You're right."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4b682ee5b8dc3a7a0b51828461b91a19
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Yeah, surprise surprise, Kate can be a nice person sometimes. I know I come across heartless and all that."
msgstr ""

#. uid: da655bbf334ceda1a8198575b0d2b58e
msgctxt "speaker:Mary"
msgid "Yeah, take you for example. He was supposed to buy this month's food from the market, instead he comes back with you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 54fb7639dd75228ab605bbfe5e64de01
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, that does sound like him."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 621ff7f52a32c3c64fb1094a0e4e71aa
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, that sounds familiar too."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 08f988637780940ea9565e7d44899a75
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, that sounds like the Alaric I know."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c1bbc5107c39792dc4a4d516d6c8b5af
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Yeah, that whatever you think about that fella, he ain't got nothin."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b7bff43c7230451019de9b0c72eb5172
msgctxt "speaker:Kim"
msgid "Yeah, that's good news. We get paid triple for those days."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 85230b38c4a5222e803d945d667741e4
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "Yeah, that's not going to happen, Sarah."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2849d1598f7e2a6b9ddb233418790507
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, that's true, but you should be careful with that."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d90be5ec701c5a374162e886efd8c702
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "Yeah, that's what I thought."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ebe25b237faf4bc666d50edc69c09015
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, that's why Ramsey...uh, your father...he offered me a job..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ef341707da97d29721bac8ad6df82d06
msgctxt "speaker:Gabriel"
msgid "Yeah, that's why they send me along with you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ec5e2bad7419c17ea6d4edae8f806f57
msgctxt "speaker:Dalia"
msgid "Yeah, the Master himself lived here all that time. He's older still."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 997d75bf2c251a53253fb129422513b2
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "Yeah, the first time is always a mind twist."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a10f05bcf115fdf512441920c165126d
msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "Yeah, the forest here is known for such things."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9f01d0b7fe572ed01e925b05f265051a
msgctxt "speaker:Sophia"
msgid "Yeah, the sanctum is Hassar's private retreat from the rest of the world."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9272d532d74cfbeee0454dbc0d849ffa
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "Yeah, the ship I chartered came in a few weeks early."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 880aa1d0a96472fe83f53f0e354cd2e1
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, there about."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2deecf3d68dd1a314e1ec5c366da627e
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Yeah, this is how I'm supposed to be starting my day."
msgstr ""

#. uid: eb6d4d61f9b707419a683a2b8d6f676c
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "Yeah, this one will grow out purple leaves instead of regular green."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1532771870352f256e4909392889d8ef
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Yeah, though I have to admit, honest work ain't what it's cracked up to be."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7d9e8b752c16ab6ba977edebd6a44292
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, too bad you didn't lose, that would have been fun too."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6dc579857e307a7f220eb9ac30560641
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Yeah, took my breath away too first time I got here."
msgstr ""

#. uid: edec2f94cb57796b3debe60e40fad933
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, two weirdos."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b4606cc6d974fb49b86a16fd2076f0f4
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, we are talking, and if you keep being rude to me, I'll just walk back to camp."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 72f02ae321c6b472173b8d4c8cae87a1
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Yeah, we did."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 423ca00c3c0e6868b2d51e6a3efcc882
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Yeah, we made out pretty well. Woulda been even better if...ya know, but still."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 512957e3fc897a0c4416b704a3a58db7
msgctxt "speaker:Soldier"
msgid "Yeah, we're gonna go back to celebrating I think. We caught the intruder, determined there was no risk. Job done."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b0a561e47ec4664a087a4dd86d6fe0b6
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "Yeah, we're still close to Lethram, but the further we get out from the city, the bolder the bandits tend to get."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e9bd493b5981d3a719d82bdc4328068d
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, well, maybe you should have tried your charming personality instead of cornering me in an alley all those years ago."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 23188bde6e1076f1bc8fc121bee92a6a
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Yeah, well, most people wanna get old and have a million babies. I think I'll pass on both."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e00179200e496a39338de64e2015d33f
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, well, you can't just ram it in you know."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7046f21abae48c694adafde63fa6fe6c
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, well...it is snow."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0f5c98738ddf2ed160b4e22e112da3ba
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Yeah, well...they ain't teach how to read, much less do math. You rich folk got all the advantages."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0524cfe7173e7b45d47ec4ff1a28a9b5
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, what did you think?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: f002c27b96c76dadbf4b14b16570e4d1
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, what have you been up to? Surely you got a good story or two?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: fc7b99fc67bbdcf538d3a5bbe287b0ae
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah, what's your story? How did you end up here?"
msgstr ""

