#. uid: 84f417126b2a2513c47030d7aa9baab7
msgctxt "speaker:Tribesman"
msgid "Yes, he and his three sisters were spared the blade. As much a kindness as he deserved."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8403b4fcc93d945477f511c617f5c9bd
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, he knows."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1418f5449b977217b4f89984674f2310
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Yes, he may very well be depraved, but that is the angle that affords us his support."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 06766daa62f7f8c4e9b2d623c2286bdb
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, husband."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 68807f9f48cb3a11fd896aaf61d45f62
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "Yes, if you want your answers, you will have to give up your body to me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9b3baa981f7541f68ae5477bc4282fda
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, in a way."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4b4ac8efbbb97d234b3c0a967be45193
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, in fact, we are."
msgstr ""

#. uid: be522c42e20179a2e3b140ada12ba97e
msgctxt "speaker:Oryon"
msgid "Yes, in history, nations and empires, come and go like all cycles."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e829e74ee4a86708bc5c46ca4d4c3496
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, in part of what you did to me all those years ago...but your kindness too."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 56f666ac1ca16a79aedb798f3219d414
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Yes, it can be a lonely place."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6d1555064133c7b97c1eb6991d027afb
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "Yes, it can be powerful, to a degree."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9433f373fadd6d3bf1947c66454ef1c5
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, it is admirable. There are servants in Rosanna as well, that are older than myself, some even older than my father."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7c3ab8002b5de5725b2a8fad0bb895e3
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "Yes, it is as I feared..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b123b8ebb8ed169ba4c412fbd9c80d2c
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Yes, it is only a few hours out from the Capital."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ca8ea06ad3ead00a5d00b65fafe86a31
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "Yes, it is quite something. A bit opulent, perhaps even for me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 61984ad27935be1530cfeba2b5427563
msgctxt "speaker:Barion"
msgid "Yes, it is true, I have been quite busy. An assistant to carry some of the load would be very welcome."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ca9193bfd3145e6f4805e88a6780ff85
msgctxt "speaker:Naydeen"
msgid "Yes, it took my breath away the first time too."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b7022de11a278717bf8f2d190daad895
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, it won't be easy..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5fc3b65b37031158bf0872e4439b2c3b
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, it won't be long before the night sets in I'm afraid."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8c5430cbc6b6c1a84e92eac47e7d40cd
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, it won't be long now before the captain of the guard declares we are ready."
msgstr ""

#. uid: be1bcb0780128babf4953eba97567635
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "Yes, it's a useful thing this house."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 84c82b761a2beb784414b981f9225017
msgctxt "speaker:Ragged Man"
msgid "Yes, it's been a long, long time since I came here."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ff9b2a4335a2d106c8d652864f4e2ec0
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "Yes, it's not the most glorious task, but sometimes even these base things need to be done."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 35ddc1e4678ff982e549950e22f8d28d
msgctxt "speaker:Caleb"
msgid "Yes, it's nothing, ignore it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 54c02ca1071651b3346a6dea1d838946
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "Yes, it's so long ago, and so many empires rose and fell, the story has been lost to most people, except for my order."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7df517ff87afe80ff440a032ea3c8eff
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "Yes, it's true that this house does not abide by the rules of the world outside."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b38f8f0bbcd14b4632eaa9cd9402c7df
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, just for a moment."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8ad027df4c495310336276ab00a1d400
msgctxt "speaker:Hassar"
msgid "Yes, just two ordinary people, I suppose."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b5c19c69313d1bcecd5dc850b9e722b2
msgctxt "speaker:Servant"
msgid "Yes, lady Rose, please follow me and I shall escort you to the throne room."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e54d042637218499aebc871fef49616d
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, lord Varga, I am aware."
msgstr ""

#. uid: be3c32dcd9e509c1fbe8b554f63df2a8
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "Yes, maybe you're just actually a good person. Possibly."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f8547bf5d00b57407374ddef02c8d484
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 40cceb6ee3345a41eafe3d2d7e932b76
msgctxt "speaker:Damian"
msgid "Yes, my Lady."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5f6f4db85348a6fa22c82b6c42f8cf6e
msgctxt "speaker:Kravel"
msgid "Yes, my Lord, it arrived in the dead of night."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6ef948a491610f07e0c2233aaece9d9d
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, my country will be one of justice."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b293d35d451717e69667c0aae58262c4
msgctxt "speaker:Ragged Man"
msgid "Yes, my friends hold you in good favor. They look upon you with kindness and wish that you return to the path."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1dfb23460a914947662170d4104030ce
msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "Yes, my lady. I'm so sorry."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2e9a56a0aa57bd30392118593f39bb46
msgctxt "speaker:Barion"
msgid "Yes, my lord."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 92e86690e3f6c3320af24a7da02769ba
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "Yes, my old mentor."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4722701e24399abff228aab5ca1b8094
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, my...my family insisted that I learn."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 96167afc08643a6658d2e8b9ae02e4c2
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "Yes, now you know the words to say, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: c0fcbc06b4bafb008c1100e84fafbe34
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Yes, of course. Please, forgive me my indulgences, I was a fool."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4c74b71166994953587d412bb3f82d15
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "Yes, of course. You were the last to arrive, Marshal Edmond of Elarand and Duke Antonio of Medini arrived the day prior."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e18e95d73650c331a3cf9ebc4a3539e5
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Yes, of course..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 770be1aa712bc0b212bf805fa31b761d
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Yes, of course...Princess Rose."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 75e673adf1ee0d9adbbf6af0798b9bf0
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "Yes, old friend?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: ef7fc5eeb6b6763e7fc06dcf383cf16d
msgctxt "speaker:Hecate"
msgid "Yes, perhaps they would have."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 468bf3501e267a1af41b42b2ca8881a1
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Yes, please...uhm...spirit?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5fb13ad2f2e47b12821cef1125aacc77
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Yes, quite."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 918df20f6a6c8217a2fba743a32d1e9b
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, retake Rosanna."
msgstr ""

#. uid: dbe7b159dc929a03643afe984433266b
msgctxt "speaker:Gabriel"
msgid "Yes, she is skilled enough to defend herself from most things."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8f564dab7bf0c0a183044cb1eeb136b6
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, sir."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0da64daf1ae631717f254e0cb29c9cd5
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Yes, so many people are born, live out their lives and then die, never seeing their true potential."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 70c162ae08a24061f436ffe96c41e5ca
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Yes, some will get rich off our decisions, some will lose out."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 70bc5fbae927182849df99172924de73
msgctxt "speaker:Tailor"
msgid "Yes, strip down. I need to take your measurements."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d1e13bb53470b9813b42ca18cd209b20
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, stuff for on the road, some clothes...jewelry."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 968180228f21264f7b4b002be47ac797
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, thank you for the water and soap to. The bed is...well it's what it is, but I'll manage."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a29523081af12bd3f7a1968ccda31e5d
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "Yes, that is correct."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4e44734994b63b5f4535c0aa9e7e5d2c
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, that much is very true."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c7e977da227028f75b65e0ca526eea2a
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "Yes, that must be a lot. But surely you have some good people about to help you, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 023245b563ffd19b6d09bf55c722d299
msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "Yes, that too is possible, but we can't say either way."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9d10cb906c73fe7ab83189fb8f1e32b3
msgctxt "speaker:Marshal Edmond"
msgid "Yes, that too."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9fd9861423816047531fda396c8d2dbc
msgctxt "speaker:Gabriel"
msgid "Yes, that will sour anyone's mood."
msgstr ""

#. uid: aecf84a4f06f3b96a120c0e7151c1e3c
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, that! I'm not asking you to change, Thomas, but you also can't live like a recluse."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 469176ab441955a8fc3f38c3a70c4c63
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, that's fair."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3b4c8b0dd1f253a1dd212e078d813528
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Yes, the higher up we go in the world, the more obligations we seem to gather along the way."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d701eb6066683588cf98e68d579fe267
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "Yes, the house on the other side. It's warded, but beyond that I can't keep you safe."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6fe07c739d0f5f9f03122c7082779490
msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
msgid "Yes, the overseer for this entire expedition in fact. They wish to meet with you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cb4e4f22f539858b9a8c59240ff2889c
msgctxt "speaker:Ragged Man"
msgid "Yes, the path."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7e2bab44967d132745bbbf5bd9fbe787
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Yes, the pretty one."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0495f432559206f3451950996be905e4
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "Yes, their great return."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 11d3259747a1cdb197bdb0a89bacbe4d
msgctxt "speaker:Hecate"
msgid "Yes, there are a few places in the world that still have remnants of the old Empire."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 991feef6af5526c89c18ce2b87236e83
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, there are things in this world even Lady Carolyn does not know."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b9a8cae9648ccb73fb25044b31fd89d8
msgctxt "speaker:Albert"
msgid "Yes, they tried to get me to use one of the newer models."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 64f952dd4c3338f6548b6c3209d5c1f6
msgctxt "speaker:Naydeen"
msgid "Yes, this is his sanctum, where we are kept safe and away from the rest of the city. The world, really."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f268f7d324f0538774837d42d15ef5f2
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, this is why I am hestitant to bring it up. It feels...wrong to complain when there is nothing to complain."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fa4e0dd5c48883f75450dc9ee626929f
msgctxt "speaker:Gilead"
msgid "Yes, though I must admit that it was both a sliver of luck and timing."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0bdb28f301f6a7b9187b91b11c935368
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "Yes, to an extent."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0821c473889576b757427fc83f2e1eaa
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "Yes, together, Sarah, we can resist this tyranny of heaven. Break free from the chains of your gods, and return agency to the world."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a466bc1a954f4bf1fc77a1885020b7a1
msgctxt "speaker:Gabriel"
msgid "Yes, very mature, insult the man tasked with protecting you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8c9f060c66233aaa0c92711f22f088b8
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, we can go to the commander's tent."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2090986a6f52372a5b0e76cb515f0ee2
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, we can pick this up another time."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c37f922738a53660075627137ae40a67
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "Yes, we could."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e3271ab186da50cf9b4b0bbf10272d5e
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, we have."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 731c5f9a059031713c70f2a17892554a
msgctxt "speaker:Oryon"
msgid "Yes, we must stop the void. But not too soon. Only after they have weakened the Betrayer."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 22fabb83fbb2a0294702a4957dda8985
msgctxt "speaker:Thomas"
msgid "Yes, we will act just as my sister said. It is the best option, given our circumstances."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 471e2af37aa03b7de8daaa15cab05d66
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, we're the mercenary company, unless you were expecting anybody else out here on the other side of the world."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f14f4f8093075ec8c282a83af7e48746
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, well, some things do change I suppose."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1f708a5b0e4f631b336d9d51b1d9b02b
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, well, when I left Rosanna that night it was all sudden...and things seemed very dangerous."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7e8bc3800ce310ed7c11f0985cc51c95
msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "Yes, what is it this time?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: ec267d919927ec6e37699dcb980c9bd0
msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "Yes, what?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: ec267d919927ec6e37699dcb980c9bd0
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Yes, what?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: ad35052c727c420838c86c1da4394fbc
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, yes, I'm fine!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4a3ddc1c29ed8f17b5f9e840a1d2130b
msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "Yes, yes, you wanted to escape, get away."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5586778fc50e2bb9fc1f3859507cc317
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Yes, yes. A little slower this time."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 003a31e8f79c1d0f5a1aea56a0ed4cbf
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "Yes, yes. Good girl."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1a266a190734302724a5425169d2d0e6
msgctxt "speaker:Brigand"
msgid "Yes, yes. It happens, all these narrow streets and alleys. I'll just be on my way, apologies if I caused you any trouble."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a546f89128d8973a4f7c7ae76c5a1150
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Yes, yes. So this one here is the heavenly center, and you just calculate back to this star, by deriving your location from observing the others in relation to it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a0c001694622db0ac8188ad7f2241126
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, you forget yourself. See that it doesn't happen again."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ea96584b993edf1074e0edd58efe68be
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, you know him name."
msgstr ""

#. uid: af3f1422942babe5f4a8009b5424edba
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, you know his name."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0cb1773bc379c5675e1f68e4305472a9
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, you say that now, and tomorrow I'll be picking you up off the floor, sleeping."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5c0594a11f2ba01b8b2067fa8b3c2675
msgctxt "speaker:Ephraim"
msgid "Yes, you still have a lot of room to grow, but they way you are now, you'll pass for sure."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8fdcde214a949415a1f539cfaa8945e1
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, you treated me very well..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2a90fb751ac02afafa281dbe65c82402
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, you were great."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ed8da589c21f0c7e20d487eee72f575c
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "Yes, you're probably right. I've been thinking about this for a while now."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 662746547a9b31780acd7fcad0838eef
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, you're right. We should each commit ourselves to our new roles."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fe8e6f276aa579b9618fb2a45fb571e3
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Yes, you're such a good person. A good ruler. You wish nothing but the best for your nation."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 94ac39eac7b175756012668a0919c38a
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes, you've told me as much. Gods and whatnot."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6d62cf534c2f44bf9917ee680200c1fe
msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "Yes, your Grace."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ec5aa9f4eca25c980d8ea841791572bd
msgctxt "speaker:Kravel"
msgid "Yes, your Grace?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 57952020a412568f74787e1ac4bf46e0
msgctxt "speaker:Servant"
msgid "Yes, your Highness, but Lady Carolyn has also extended a gift to you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 50a2f70947b1fdb40a48e6bae54f8d9b
msgctxt "speaker:Merchant"
msgid "Yes, your Highness, but Lord Greytower will see no reason in the mattter!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: b127099c71415d532da3a26ed73eb041
msgctxt "speaker:Albert"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b127099c71415d532da3a26ed73eb041
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b127099c71415d532da3a26ed73eb041
msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b127099c71415d532da3a26ed73eb041
msgctxt "speaker:Gilead"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b127099c71415d532da3a26ed73eb041
msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b127099c71415d532da3a26ed73eb041
msgctxt "speaker:Raza"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b127099c71415d532da3a26ed73eb041
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b127099c71415d532da3a26ed73eb041
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b127099c71415d532da3a26ed73eb041
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b127099c71415d532da3a26ed73eb041
msgctxt "speaker:Tribesman"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b127099c71415d532da3a26ed73eb041
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b127099c71415d532da3a26ed73eb041
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b127099c71415d532da3a26ed73eb041
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 921c0722fec9ffe7433dbda41d1d00e4
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "Yes. A mage creates a link between oneself and a creature in a different world. Then they cut the veil and pull it through."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9fe4e0738267d3f8af8daa8060d9f24e
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes. And I feel like I should..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f0859f270146b1d360a6428c3a7f24df
msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "Yes. Calshure is a hub for all the medium and small towns in the area. All the farmsteads converge there for their trading."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3a7f6f899a0b07e5b5ea0a96f95a15b8
msgctxt "speaker:Dio"
msgid "Yes. For all our life, people simply barked their orders at me and Cassius. We went where we were told."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9e26c2bb84267ecd285b6375276f830e
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "Yes. Full of fire, your soul so bright it poured out of you like light from stars, your hair blazing flame."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4a72f73c7d4f7d0a781db9478284dd33
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "Yes. Full of fire, your soul so bright it poured out of you like light from the stars, your hair blazing flame."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f3ba844962406a9348e311c48805dc36
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "Yes. He was a man who enjoyed his secrets."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c9b366af886afc7536e92b6fa0958930
msgctxt "speaker:Emmissary"
msgid "Yes. He will forgive all of you for your attempts at usurping him rightful throne."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 738ccac8a8fd882dd78e2ff9eac572d9
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes. Help me keep my freedom. Keep me from being send to the citadel."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 925b6a39a0c9db3be4fd183b2e772827
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yes. Help me subdue Xan. Together we might be strong enough."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ee5fd55f12194f77af18a8f951f6634e
msgctxt "speaker:Hecate"
msgid "Yes. Here they formed schools of magic that were tasked with researching wicked fields."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 67c2972f3c5c8581f03cc8febef49bde
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "Yes. I joined them because I knew the day would come when you would face them."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 212c428c73f133875099c047b6cbb0f3
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "Yes. I suspect Xan kept you from that room as well, but it is quite easy to find should you be willing enough to find it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e247b69ba273e40f1f9281573f315d16
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Yes. I think last time we had such a good understanding of one another..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2b5db38c810aaf76c3ebf0454c1ba4a0
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
