#. uid: ce3a4096ff67bdcbed29215f49f2c787
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Yet, a part of her was confused as she took in the sight."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 69bf554bc767326f363224803f161ae1
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Yet, despite this, she had somehow caught the interest of the Empire all the same."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f07dae3ec78f5b15854ed993beaa45e3
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Yet, he also spoke a more universal language, as he seized her waist and pulled her on top of him."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6ec560a175f07f98c8b7c010c388c9a4
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Yet, his eyes still spoke. Fear."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5831195284e7ed96ad74c387d9085f3b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Yet, if their story was true, then the innkeeper was a turncoat. A traitor that turned on her family the moment they fell out of power."
msgstr ""

#. uid: bcae14a6bef6e96ad9f7950460c45a93
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Yet, in the back of her mind, the dream and its beckoning voice are never far way."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2762d9983091fd30af89916064329715
msgctxt "speaker:King-On-The-Outside"
msgid "Yet, knowing does not change how fate has pitted us against one another."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 392e3242a72ac04a169ca4c81c2b308d
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Yet, on the men of the march went, each day another step."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 45b52df05cb4d59036c9ec8b71564f24
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Yet, she could not act insulted when extended an invitation."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1e500878edb25e967b8f3207ca5eb2b1
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Yet, she could still taste him on her tongue."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ced64dc21642528167a40b7ee93e2950
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Yet, she imagined he would be true to his word, if only since that was the best way to get what he wanted. Her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8da992a8f1025d60381111f88043a75f
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Yet, this place is oddly full of life."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ed084591e9a90b83ed6ea735ff6ee698
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Yet, to her own surprise, his arm wrapped around her body, holding her closer."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 36ce113b11464cb2e6b439dc305e82a2
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Yet, unlike Sarah, Kate did tire."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 038e58d5bd10b061413804b3f150813b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Yet, without missing a beat, Sarah pressed her mouth down on Samayra's sex."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ac8f6901e5636a1cece69742c2dc2e1b
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Yet..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 89223b0d489f99568b462f60d7e7b554
msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "Yet...if we take them by surprise, it might make up for the layout of the land."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7ebcda62a0685d41c6154be9094f81ac
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Yet...perhaps he had been the goblin that struck her with the dart."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 95ad11ea0cec0364e33ef2e622e435cb
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yield!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 34cf40ff5ea62d0dfe48c347f91fd855
msgctxt "speaker:Mary"
msgid "Yob'Gelah."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b2d52c9a8aa3fc0f9a30bcb4ccd119bc
msgctxt "speaker:Sophia"
msgid "You a princess, but you're learning quick enough."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 50be9447fcd721327db782fe75398552
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "You abandoned me to that pack of nobles."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 14fe6e34ac034ed7ef44591572e51360
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "You above all will come here and prostrate yourself before me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a6a1cfe4d0e990a16709657d820793b7
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You accuse Lord Greytower's son, perhaps indirectly even himself, of engaging in banditry."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 934fe37d00c5211fa62afab15c59f4dd
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "You act all up and proper all the time."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cccbe67e9e9d743c9ea836ad7008ce49
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You act as if it is such a strange idea."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a0a30bf691828e93c5021484682f1275
msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "You act like an animal. You can sleep among them."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1a936447bee40f336e65d168684cd413
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "You act like the world is on your shoulders and...maybe it is, but what will happen if you don't take care of yourself?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: e9208cb8e2f350515570058746c78f47
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "You act surprised, but surely you know this will be important, no?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 52dc112d13f99bb34750a56190114c45
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You actually think this is better?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: b9f02b8432447ac5e0e3d17a7611d42a
msgctxt "speaker:Tailor"
msgid "You again..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: bee463ac844ccbe63f7328b34eb01e33
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "You ain't ever gonna forget me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 40afdc9ebe491d5d0c1bf27cb6dba567
msgctxt "speaker:Eula"
msgid "You ain't gettin no sleep, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: dc3701ddcf46fb4f1897f6b17a0518c0
msgctxt "speaker:Damian"
msgid "You ain't got a dime, so I'm doin the honest and friendly thing. I'm lettin you pay the other way."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 74aa62fb491e702a69d22adcf0036c92
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "You ain't seen nothin I didn't want you to see, girlie."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9b3df98e3fec6a3fcb3549dc613c5036
msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
msgid "You allowed her to lure you into her own style."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0405f481e19b66254e32155eb32205e4
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You almost did."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a5046e3ea674d11613490122adaa304b
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "You almost fainted!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: ffbc44bcb322219e3ea2616c8cbab5d7
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "You almost gave me a heart attack."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5990e9fdaa969de7713b3888f6e3a49d
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "You already impress me, Sarah. You don't need to try and do what no other mage has ever managed, a full transformation in the second lesson."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 78792984ee81b34a1f25382977fb0e78
msgctxt "speaker:Damian"
msgid "You already owe me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 584ebf935a63167a8193247ecdbd3100
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "You already took care of them?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: c7be21f51db2484b247f1eb3d79416c3
msgctxt "speaker:Ephraim"
msgid "You alright there, Caleb?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: fe0bdec8ed6551d8c7e4fcee2bd43d1d
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "You alright, blondie?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 81397a13f41d0f421f303f8dca654b1f
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You alright?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: ab2b94f12db84acf26d1d8371218828d
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You always act like you know me, but you really don't."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1ccc55c7622e44295f4d05cd418f05e3
msgctxt "speaker:Daemon"
msgid "You always apologize for sloppy work."
msgstr ""

#. uid: efb5caae82c15bd13d122dcaa81a7c3e
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You always have a way with words."
msgstr ""

#. uid: addc06e26319d4db1b8917e84c9617ec
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You always look so lonely walking around here."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f2c321596b27a81f7f8365c0fa7725a4
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You always look so put together, but now..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b06e49fe58e1767b918cc83835b0b303
msgctxt "speaker:Other man"
msgid "You always say that shit."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 27c029ac6267a2570306af414572b4d2
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You always say, don't question, don't ask. You never tell me much of anything."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e4ea47711e12343bc831667be7ed72ff
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "You always take on all the troubles of the world and blame yourself for them."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 93017bd6cfd631f7c11f7e3ced02d7ef
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "You always take on so much responsibility."
msgstr ""

#. uid: aa40415d31a44d83fc4438876b8d8770
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You always tell me this."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cce604b80539e001732ad2c60e24c9a8
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "You always..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 87053cdf430dfc97875ff254c618d0f0
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You and Caleb were one of the first people to really welcome me when I was all alone in this world."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e0c94bfc729f4a31b53d88d9cec962f0
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You and he are, as you mentioned, cut from the same stone I think."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9264e4085e51c32b64146e3ae1b2702c
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You and me...we have found each other through strange circumstances."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2f10e806d7e4f87903403c58f798e14f
msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "You and my dad getting along alright? I know he can be a bit demanding."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ddde4fe77819346d6c5c7755d7fdfd74
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "You and the other mercenaries can march with us, it is not uncommon for mercenary units to be attached to legions."
msgstr ""

#. uid: bada6df556550c54a5c79876759d185a
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You and the rest of your mob of frenzied men, seeking to settle a score."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 316ce5a1043e1e67caee1271fe500d91
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "You and your brother have each other. It's different for me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1e84ca15dcd23ef32b8f7cbd965a5ed6
msgctxt "speaker:Guard Captain"
msgid "You and your co-conspirator match a description for two criminals seen operating at a nearby market."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3fa4c7a9d4301934107e8d9605137fe6
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "You and your family have exploited my family for centuries."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b7cc14d185612dfda62e957fe4528109
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "You appear to have much use of that."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 75cb68a97478784b1a0ec900119b2b3b
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You are Garret, the town Huntsman?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 359c579ee4496d29a5b5a70824c6abce
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "You are a delight, Sarah."
msgstr ""

#. uid: af7614ff77286c7449a27cb79355056f
msgctxt "speaker:Gilead"
msgid "You are a fool if you think an army of peasants will stand up against the Tribesmen."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 395154f1491e6fced86716d3391608f0
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You are a kind person, Jaeid."
msgstr ""

#. uid: bfcbf9c1c77b71816869015723b1f653
msgctxt "speaker:Gilead"
msgid "You are a mage."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 08e0b13b0689160e5f521d2e1428366e
msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "You are a people conquered."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1c64bbdcf0b22e078d59693868ebf657
msgctxt "speaker:Gorak"
msgid "You are a rare exception."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 364f345d4906f03b5ae704c243c38d04
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You are a sick pervert if these were your designs."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 180579c5e879b0905401fa28c5c9a3a8
msgctxt "speaker:Daemon"
msgid "You are a slave."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4c4d334acc5ffab77ccc0d78360997b7
msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "You are a strange one, Sarah Rose."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c8b272d543a75abbacc7603fd39f4f4f
msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "You are a stranger in this town."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ec3e77d8daef199bbdf0bca1fa5ce1f3
msgctxt "speaker:Gorak"
msgid "You are a valuable prize. Our clan has grown weak these years and we do not often have spoils from raids."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c0065fb78d9f2947ba13f569f6959190
msgctxt "speaker:Marshal Edmond"
msgid "You are a very insultable man, Antonio. Be glad that is all I do."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f15f1971d1b16977b164a5ba361663b4
msgctxt "speaker:Marshal Edmond"
msgid "You are ambitious to a fault."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 16dd69627428635273a12db9c61c11b3
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "You are as beautiful as they sang in the songs."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 489738c6dc53332995e54a0acb9d0b56
msgctxt "speaker:King-On-The-Outside"
msgid "You are as much a victim of your Demons as we are."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 24b4d774032ddb22c4dfdb14098b43ad
msgctxt "speaker:Tirion"
msgid "You are at the moment at peace, but the world moves in cycles. Such as there is now peace, there will soon be conflict again."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4c7ef64459e882df0a52f58fe3fe7388
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You are being nice to me. You and Jasmine both. It is more than I deserve."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f0b5bedc75ade84272d89a8eae558a5b
msgctxt "speaker:Gilead"
msgid "You are clever. I appreciate that much about you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a00b9e3979f06ef52cf47393a33e5f1a
msgctxt "speaker:Voice"
msgid "You are close, Sarah."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 84f446ed26ad853e165696b63857b03f
msgctxt "speaker:Daemon"
msgid "You are confused because when you came here, you were one thing."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4fcc38f4c99911a201c28eda20ba2bc3
msgctxt "speaker:Daemon"
msgid "You are confused in this place."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 756bcaf288f308ffa1fbb08d4ef128eb
msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "You are cruel, Sarah."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 221faa5df542097791edd2ca2c82bd14
msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "You are done here, father."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b66303f0f31a66bf66ae3f6becbc6fd9
msgctxt "speaker:Tribesman"
msgid "You are even braver than the stories."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c52b412573c63411213153244569e83c
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You are even more vile and low than I first suspected."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d8eed42dab08ac1314047dd0bbd03790
msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "You are expected to be available, even when not on your shift."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3490c4c48282a1bdda723db2399efce5
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "You are free to do as you wish, but you fear that you do not yet know what that is..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5eb95381cebc521586f7db407858a00a
msgctxt "speaker:Gilead"
msgid "You are free to refuse, but then you will gain no reward and there would still be the matter of the punishment."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2f462ac66f4300235d876cb7cd90bc8a
msgctxt "speaker:Dio"
msgid "You are from Rosanna, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: f7f19c77b6b88c8a36b62043bd5443a9
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "You are going to Normandi soon..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d35ba1c7c79991d8bb07df928d3b892a
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "You are great fun, Sarah."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7db3fd8a3066ae93aef0672a9b178e8e
msgctxt "speaker:Daemon"
msgid "You are here for my work. And for my pleasure."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e667db3c5ca569be2da6c039a340728f
msgctxt "speaker:Voice"
msgid "You are here."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 366d524c2512dc443cb9f14b19c3802e
msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "You are his slave."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3540ae115c7998baa78bfa6ee87eed44
msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
msgid "You are kind to say so, but forgive me when I say that I have not come seeking your soft words."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b0087f8bc9f066657cdf27a43ee19f93
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You are kind, and handsome and...anything a girl could wish for in a husband."
msgstr ""

#. uid: bd9bb5f298a89148aead67b83d66c57b
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "You are like a blade to him, unrivaled in potential quality. A weapon that he can wield towards his own ends. A tool, or an instrument."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1b9327adbabcd6e7a3a19e5ec131e2f4
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You are little more than a sick pervert!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0b820b9f652289366a1c266294d1e1ec
msgctxt "speaker:Daemon"
msgid "You are livestock."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f7e243959ac249a51e23b9c3b86a71cd
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You are loyal to your sister, you wish to save her life."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a42fa7a4681e6a971e52953e68341ec1
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You are mad if you think I will debase myself."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7f82959ae25986fb766b893c75cc1495
msgctxt "speaker:Daemon"
msgid "You are mine to use. Your body is what I have need of. All the rest is secondary."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 645054e511ca7f29239113afe8064ac7
msgctxt "speaker:Hassar"
msgid "You are mine, by right. Not by law or vague ritual, but simply because I am stronger than all the others."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 060461eb61fa3d4f8168f5492267fc34
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You are my friend, Lily, and I value your service to me. But I am still your sovereign."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 47c0f76e50c6625ce549f09f76a37d0a
msgctxt "speaker:Hassar"
msgid "You are my guest, and I will treat you with all kindness that such a station demands."
msgstr ""

#. uid: bb7409fa062fcb7f8be33d55a885e516
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "You are my wife."
msgstr ""

#. uid: dfd3d5f9fec3019f64ed2feed4545192
msgctxt "speaker:Master"
msgid "You are new to this world."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d22ad60feb42b7cacf6841ee57fb3df1
msgctxt "speaker:Emmissary"
msgid "You are no more Queen of these lands than any other who claims it. Only the one who sits on the throne rules it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 028c5677871b5327b407e6bea7d14dba
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "You are not the girl that I left in that mercenary camp."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e9f6fa2621f1fc95a2708f6a180c4d7c
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You are not the only one with military experience."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 147a7b989ed0f4c51123964be5252e5c
msgctxt "speaker:Voice"
msgid "You are nothing here child."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3522c6ccf279a4152111280e3798040d
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You are older than me. A lot older. We don't have to pretend otherwise."
msgstr ""

#. uid: bd36bd7b34698c70aae747fbaa0a489b
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "You are one of them, I have seen it in my dreams."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1accfd65ace21d19e01e5ffefe2f9fc5
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You are right, you won't win."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 061629e6861feb8977f5ac1d29a9fd5e
msgctxt "speaker:Daemon"
msgid "You are right."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 061629e6861feb8977f5ac1d29a9fd5e
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "You are right."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7859a401082f11afddb8a844d2792bac
msgctxt "speaker:Daemon"
msgid "You are right. I am more powerful than you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 84e81b6e71437ab17ec28f30589da15e
msgctxt "speaker:Master"
msgid "You are slower to learn than most, but you will learn in time."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4b14e216ccaefd8537984d83166be849
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You are smart. You organized all of this. You knew about the Mythrans before any of us did."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9233124ea75fa355e2b36e5255ec27ef
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You are so low you would wield your influence in this moment for such pathetic ends?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8772cb476dfdf2ecc7b6dd62d3b66ae8
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "You are so much the woman that I had known you would become."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ea232f9dde53fed74b3b29ea2b4f0fa1
msgctxt "speaker:Voice"
msgid "You are so very close now."
msgstr ""

#. uid: be12ada818a61c3054c3c06455fc66d7
msgctxt "speaker:Ragged Man"
msgid "You are special among specials, and they fear losing you more than most."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1ccf8d84811fc21efc44aca74f4d19f9
msgctxt "speaker:Voice"
msgid "You are special, Sarah."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a23ed278542d2912daa69708aee498db
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "You are strong now as well."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e95d7311c25ad5e826a68cf021e61f62
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You are stronger than me, so I am sure you will manage."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1042b18a9ee0660d028180d193b11304
msgctxt "speaker:Dio"
msgid "You are the first person in our life with whom Cassius and I will strike a bargain as equals."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d91edc8a3b6b8550e0cac19220e1e329
msgctxt "speaker:Tribesman"
msgid "You are the first woman to ever threaten me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 45475d407fcbc932fba4898b6977699f
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You are the leader of the voidlings?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: fdf7c2c4b523de9fd5b39a551b9257fe
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "You are the woman I knew you would become."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 159599bcc5e297e04c65f05ea3caae6c
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "You are to her."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fab6613551743379ee962e353d0b2669
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You are well secure from attacks on land, but the Mythrans will not come from land."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0ebfa6d55eeca12a685d68ae2f763335
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "You are, you'll both be."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d71efba1b2a8f15ea8475926a36103c2
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You are..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6990dccb7a65280e39c13c4271db685b
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You are?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 80534a33149c9d981cbc9d29c12dead8
msgctxt "speaker:Hecate"
msgid "You as well!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: f416fe066a786f513ee4f9adaaec6eeb
msgctxt "speaker:Marshal Edmond"
msgid "You as well. I fear you must forgive me for failing to welcome you properly. I was reading and it appears I have lost track of time."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c404f503164b1a91a4a4b36940a5b7b8
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "You ask me for answers, yet when I give them, you are displeased?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 411f695db107bae6b848762f90c6be92
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "You ask me how I know them, I wish I knew any better than you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0d66ae6ffe44fe6aa281a4b3e2a9b5c9
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You ask me what's wrong? What do you think?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1faa17a804e4d94851608aae2a867015
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You ask questions as if you want answers."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 667145533cd69cdc15edee4b4ddf83c4
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "You ask the impossible of yourself, and then you punish yourself for falling short."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e8b7a5b97efa54e772cd142fcbd3fcce
msgctxt "speaker:Oryon"
msgid "You ask, why did we not save your kingdom?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 027a0ef8e5247b9fb543c3764866e4d9
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You asked for me?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: a6c79c2a9f618b28b784d7391d5d5ceb
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You asked me to set you free..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0b6830a732c91cd348d0c0578b8e4caa
msgctxt "speaker:Hassar"
msgid "You asked me why I brought you here, and I shall be truthful with you, Sarah."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0c796815ba9e69eb99379e2c34c8a48f
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "You asking me if I have experience taking off women's armor?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6d0a530773ebbb251d3dc950243f0b61
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You assume the position of leader of our Union should be you?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: b05ecdc92e9f70ca1e059e2500b67c69
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "You attending a ball nearby?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1ccc5d4dbbf1effda40c0108439521b9
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "You bear a crown that none can see."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4c70750c6992d4259c36737bd0d73d7f
msgctxt "speaker:Master"
msgid "You bear my mark. Inscribed upon your flesh and your soul, it will linger."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3f4946e24ee443efcd7c237fdeee61f8
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You been practicing?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0c885a3740334fd8c1c665d812993851
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "You believe us to be like you. But even there you make a profound mistake."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a3af2bcb10d98b13f9fea9a0bca66ba2
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "You better fucking swallow every drop or I swear I'm gonna take whatever you spill and smear it on your face."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2e82db267133d83fc93388972e816354
msgctxt "speaker:Jasmine"
msgid "You better learn to get over that."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c6ab9035b6937268838d43ecc5a92635
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "You better make them right."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 8983e0f3ade91fecb63c50fb98031bf8
msgctxt "speaker:Jasmine"
msgid "You better not try and steal my workroom!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2f8e51ad8a727298f46b92c079c54126
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You better work real hard at convincing me these next few days."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 87241d099e034d8585bb370a5f8d8ea4
msgctxt "speaker:Brigand"
msgid "You bitch! Get back here!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: c84ebde8a7f41ef135284b911b5694ba
msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "You blew a sailor?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: a197892ccbf8ba564186b6ffb728689d
msgctxt "speaker:Romanov Twin"
msgid "You bring a mage to fight your battles? For this?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: f751b7858296afc88e14cb832afec308
msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "You brought this out in me...now you want me to be careful?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1e3b7c457140093b2708f6a8518b5eb6
msgctxt "speaker:Tailor"
msgid "You call me old?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3d1fd38ab15df948c8568518b9008ec4
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You call them a strength, but they are a weakness to you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5349eec8747d4d88f1e259410d2b7529
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You call this justice? To have a man and his daughter thrown to the wolves on your account?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: b54f92098179423b427d519a6b4a41d5
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "You called on me..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2db115e8d2d08e2ed6b006ee0c2e08b7
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "You called on me?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: a677502100637926c9ba750c61e3e37e
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You called them...piglets once. Greedy. Always hungry."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f01cd290d4fd061f21d6baf2f1cdf793
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You calling me old?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: b08ed73270d69302b67a5744506a5d30
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "You came all the way out here, now you wanna go back to Lethram?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 667ea32a6a9391582c5f76475cd274d0
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You came for a ruling I have given you one. Pleading with me more will not invite reconsideration, only my annoyance."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f6c187b372b3197f607e705365e4431f
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "You came four times, guess I shoulda gone easier on you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c08ed8be3da2dab4eee553ff0f5e98fb
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "You came to Bagrad and you saved me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 21d55ca12cdffa6f381f0865a7e0f79c
msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "You came to my house, and now you blame me for what you started?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 834d40825c5a2d579403d7d66daa6e94
msgctxt "speaker:King-On-The-Outside"
msgid "You came to us."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6ca1dfb2b6118204101d8441701b2ee2
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You came..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1c6172c93727cb6c840b67ee17bf4aa4
msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "You can barely handle one of me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 69f3138bd7ba22fcb07d2261d8605c3b
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You can be a real brat, you know that?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4e93548281023cdc0dd3f8a99bff98a0
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "You can be my partner, right?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 83cfc0c5d10d1cf8aaf4b391c7380983
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "You can be really mean, you know that?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 94a70e225898698bf62a6af8b28bcd6f
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You can be sad about what you wish was true."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7a5cd0b8a760c28705c05d661ce2d995
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "You can call that livin, I guess."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 42a1cf58c21a4fbbbe0022355842442c
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You can come out if you want, stretch your legs."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f5f5c9f730d4c95ab7326b4d42dd48ea
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "You can cross the bridge in any way you wish or feel, but it will change nothing."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 34cf55dc6a1dca1907a58ac70a230374
msgctxt "speaker:Eula"
msgid "You can do that for them, they'll treat you right."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 56697604f6dafdf618f3de8918c9f325
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You can finish on me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 53e89731a51e70a30ed9af0dd1c1c441
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You can get settled here."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 573d69765054b53513053af4c7592248
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "You can get started on cooking now if you want."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 788128645a81529a82a4c5c9af922fbd
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You can go ahead and retire for the night as well Lily."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7f16740a9751acfef85ceba90a135bcf
msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "You can go ahead now, they shouldn't give you no trouble."
msgstr ""

#. uid: c5c4433ed96bdf8f0a97f86997d8056b
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You can go and...I don't know, sit and read in silence next to each other."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fd5e05726f0004c01a72b047a35d8642
msgctxt "speaker:Soldier"
msgid "You can go in."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 0b68e8b9dc1f62263362abea7c4e4229
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You can have me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 642d6b73cf36e629d5c22c860be13a37
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "You can have the next one."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ce967af74a046bc06fe619d78c4bbfb3
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "You can joke all you want, I'm old, but I ain't blind."
msgstr ""

#. uid: bb36920fbc417d82ae73602e664d00d4
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "You can just bake up a few eggs and some bacon, there should be some in the trunk of the cart."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a8a680455a7f9c260cb5473dca3a3f52
msgctxt "speaker:Ramsey"
msgid "You can just call me Ramsey, got it?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: fb27ddc1c0e74724f5754d1463c4b88e
msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "You can kill me, return to town, and tell them that we found the Beast. Tell them that it killed me, and you killed it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e50046583720199dba0babb9ec70f2a1
msgctxt "speaker:Daemon"
msgid "You can learn a lot from this one."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 537b72236ac23dc2b3ee741639b782af
msgctxt "speaker:Dalia"
msgid "You can learn from me, like the Master said, and not make the same mistakes that I did."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d95b1549632df8d344d85942a3713f44
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You can leave the report here, prepare yourself to board the flagship with the rest of the commanding staff."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 684553f0a538c2aacfd0a4e174709fd0
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "You can lie to the others if you want, just don't bother lying to me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 38b2eea189bc2a452d942448573e5472
msgctxt "speaker:Mary"
msgid "You can make a life here. It might not be the one you dreamed of, but it's a life."
msgstr ""

#. uid: cf1bc86dfcaa0079a5c284550bfc3883
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "You can make your skin as hard as stone. Transform into a cat and move around unseen."
msgstr ""

#. uid: bec4c135a5f85a520ec1141e94858a34
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "You can move, truly free."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 48cb3579d4c5f371b4062ef767e0d78d
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "You can play at the ordinary girl all you like, but unlike those other two idiots, I actually pay attention."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 79c2aa2857b11e6986c0cf8646958257
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You can promise me all you want, but such things are out of your control. Even out of mine."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 401987b32b45984c88e3737608432e1b
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "You can promise them anything, and deliver nothing."
msgstr ""

#. uid: bddc4a37e7c5a9426d955cf6dfce8b34
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "You can read and write, you're educated enough, and you're telling me you don't know about them?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: d54daf20bba1d6a0c608add1c4eaa30e
msgctxt "speaker:Elsa"
msgid "You can read, I assume?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: be1a0c83fc4ddca0c3aa1602a6d8c470
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "You can ride out the rest of the journey without working another day."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7c3affc909430c93d942017162d9c4a9
msgctxt "speaker:Voice"
msgid "You can save millions, and have all the love that this world denied you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 84869a61e1e7e5f54f7d5894c89d20e6
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You can say it shouldn't matter, but it does."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 22c226c6085ad028d7b3f9e9d552ab82
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "You can say that again. It's a miracle there's anything left of that miserable ruin."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6524ae493b7e36334cb518513bd5f790
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You can see that I don't have anything on me!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: b6516d1c0483711561f28c1fd63b325f
msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "You can spare me the vain little act."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 142b927d4d342fe4226c3b26cca8bda1
msgctxt "speaker:Kim"
msgid "You can spend all your life worried about how unfair life is, but that don't change nothing."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ae0c8b94683b63b36694910c44bbff3e
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "You can start by setting up the campsite, put up some logs to sit on, a circle for the fire, get food going."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 05efdbf665f9e04ac1d984b89149d63f
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "You can start by taking off that dress."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 120143430261284d4dd3c35d97a9aa36
msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "You can stay for as long as you want."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 91cd940e9042011ce65353305bc5c183
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "You can stay here for as long as you like."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a06e02b325b8f7d2fd53a9cd9052a7e6
msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "You can stay. But you cannot poison our new marriage by walking about the house in constant resentment."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a4e02079345db483af2844c1a983d5b2
msgctxt "speaker:Voice"
msgid "You can stop them all."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e6b67eabe09d52fe5249d21428d31274
msgctxt "speaker:Daemon"
msgid "You can struggle against this place, but this place is like the bars on your cell."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ee3f6fcd19f08023d50a0b66529c69e4
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "You can take one of the bunks near the back of the ship, there are some chests for you to put your stuff."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6e646c4bfff8091b895d0daf76ef20d0
msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
msgid "You can take our contract from her hands, away from our master, and rip it apart. Once it is yours, you are free to do with it as you wish."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a6f9cd41b73d87674a2ef0812bdc0a49
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "You can tell your little friend to take a break for the night."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 7e3e66ea6d979b0782be8ae42aa4e6f1
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You can touch me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3c752ba42b6e4a86077241d613f51aff
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "You can trust it to do what it has done for centuries. Survive."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9f5b5ae278293cb1f7b4e0addb022601
msgctxt "speaker:Hecate"
msgid "You can trust me, because if I wanted to hurt you, I really wouldn't have much trouble at all."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5e1e442dff937f33815829be00cef2c1
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "You can try and learn a thing or two from him blondie."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e2b40d8e4283cdf838efe4585693653c
msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "You can use whatever you need from the storage closet."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2b63db339b400bc4f24573053b7d279b
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You can wake me up, same time as the others. I can carry boxes, I can help rig the cart...you just need to give me a chance."
msgstr ""

#. uid: b00ce160fc12c84a0fbbe228282a3fdf
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You can walk away."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 13a743f2021dbfbf3d1b37c79346d09e
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "You can work on your knees for now."
msgstr ""

#. uid: f16b1231abf255e171c424f9450338c7
msgctxt "speaker:Soldier"
msgid "You can wriggle on my lap all you like, I don't mind."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ee043615239389b7bbe7f79f2c0c87b7
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "You can't be blind to how men look at you."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5db556855563b26c6826ab43d82ce310
msgctxt "speaker:Nickolas"
msgid "You can't be serious!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5db556855563b26c6826ab43d82ce310
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You can't be serious!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 958639c1c681d43d024ec0e6e39da6b7
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You can't be serious."
msgstr ""

#. uid: bd704be99bcce0aff2c13b37686bad83
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You can't be serious..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4381c7f7ebd6e97d6509256d9924a035
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You can't be serious...you and me?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: baf0cccc5d8749df1efbef5f5ccf6759
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You can't convince me that I'm your first. I know what soldiers get up to at war."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a3ecd704a42c57a30408b1c175649d82
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "You can't cook. You wear a fancy dress in the style of the union kingdoms. And your hands are soft, like you've never worked a day in your life."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d77429a31a9795cb0d716c6b0cab9919
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You can't cross beyond this point?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 4a74d3e0f41da38c51970c63927fe38c
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You can't do this...I..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e4c6a2289b46ad559417b788db3e6c30
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "You can't expect me to hold your hand everywhere you go."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fc75f2b091fdf142dd2c516e7b79f2b9
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "You can't go around prancing my ship in a dress, not if you're gonna be a real deck hand."
msgstr ""

#. uid: fa954940a3ac89e749006615381e804d
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "You can't go through life looking back."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 99c1c51036cd3e6d60753641f81ea95f
msgctxt "speaker:Dalia"
msgid "You can't imagine it now, but in the moment...you'll betray anyone."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ed236e51b78034c636f427de201eabbc
msgctxt "speaker:Tailor"
msgid "You can't just go and rip them up every day. They'll have to take that out of your pay if you keep that up."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1d9b4e9da97a8247c4fbeb1acaa72b5c
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You can't just let people into the house, it's dangerous!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 88c91de9db54f920789842b0b72f0d44
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "You can't just seize an opportunity, you need to think what comes after."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 5a16116d3249bd63b3701545388e072d
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "You can't not return home..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 53622cfa9bca0013ee8e705d175eeaf3
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You can't possibly know the future."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 824fbb9cba2ecef1401a2726bb508780
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "You can't rig a sail, couldn't tie a proper knot if your life depended on it and if I let you navigate we'd be lost at sea in under a day."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1e62532a2f16beaceb9e5b3368dcef1c
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You can't work them too hard, but you can't let them just run wild. You need to maintain a degree of control."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 1b491a26f0a901d5336a2482a936d5c7
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You can't..."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 68254e47aa5756855be3dfba104ec418
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "You can...but...I kind of get self-conscious when people watch. That's why I usually practice when nobody is around."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 206d5541e57bb95eb90b00fe5289d225
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "You cannot stop this, for both sides yearn for this great and calamitous war."
msgstr ""

#. uid: d044daaf18a1329976d192baaf51f864
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "You cannot trust him!"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 56229e01c735c2284fe24f34d05ffb7e
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "You can’t be parading around in a dress like you’re going to go off to a ball."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 2a73287a19fc7c8364b11a48900cf978
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You carry a lot on your shoulders, Marion."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9f21d5924d77229341d8738bf601e140
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "You carry around so much from before, from when we escaped Rosanna...I think sometimes you feel guily about it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: ec12fe38a17ca9522becf67a4ee95e55
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You carry yourself as a free man."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 49d77dd4a0b5788f5427b74d5349a433
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "You catch on quick."
msgstr ""

#. uid: e1a753da33e10093a3535cd832992f66
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "You caught me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 88f9f1928642cf4235332aa7e2a8f679
msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "You caused this. Least you can do is fix this."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 9aecbc3113448def31a03e397a334759
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "You come here more often than you did before."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 3ae594fa9d457c99b3859df7731e57ed
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "You come in here looking like this, gettin me all hot and heavy, and now you're talking about putting your clothes back on?"
msgstr ""

#. uid: 99d8c990a62889075756fab2d4c29bcd
msgctxt "speaker:Damian"
msgid "You come with me, you'll be spendin ya night in my room."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 12b40d7b19e710a060fe97c70f6ad360
msgctxt "speaker:Raza"
msgid "You come. We run now."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a3c97e79e911fe789d650f7af5fb019a
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "You could bring five armies and you wouldn't have enough men to search every corner of it."
msgstr ""

#. uid: 6700028854d8e0d582e0bfc0721e3085
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You could come with me."
msgstr ""

#. uid: a35671c38da3a350c0f440efe8028d33
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You could get lost in it."
msgstr ""

